{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "2Hoo", "line": "I got two in here at once, I hope that they don’t go to scufflin’", "vault_lines": ["I got two in here at once, I hope that they don’t go to scufflin’"], "meaning": "According to TMZ, Yaya was arrested at 1:30 am Saturday for felony aggravated assault with a deadly weapon. Police sources told the site that the alleged victim, who was identified as Lapattra Lashai Jacobs was at YoungBoy’s home in Houston when Yaya walked in. Yaya reportedly told the other woman that she was his fiancée and that she needed to leave. Eventually, the two got into an argument that moved to the kitchen and Yaya allegedly ended up with two knives. As Jacobs stepped toward Mayweather, she reportedly charged at Jacobs with one of the knives. Jacobs was then hit with the second knife and fell to the floor, where she was discovered by EMTs in a pool of blood. She was treated at the hospital and released.", "annotation_id": "25470950", "url": "https://genius.com/25470950", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "2Hoo", "line": "You my lil’ baby, that’s your sister, hope you got it", "vault_lines": ["You my lil' baby, that's your sister, hope you got it"], "meaning": "Youngboy is implying that he is with a female and her sister , and is hoping that she feels okay with what’s going to happen.", "annotation_id": "25399004", "url": "https://genius.com/25399004", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
