{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "338", "line": "With a icy slave chain ’Cause I’m rich and can’t move ’round", "vault_lines": ["With a icy slave chain", "'Cause I'm rich and can't move 'round"], "meaning": "The slave chain is icy (has diamonds) because he’s rich. He compares the chain to slavery because he can’t move around and back then slaves didn’t have free rights, so they couldn’t move around like any other race. He also says he can’t move around because he has a chain around his neck meaning he’s chained.", "annotation_id": "35715780", "url": "https://genius.com/35715780", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "338", "line": "Big 14, 38, triple nine", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Pretty sure YB is shouting out Trippie Redd and Juice Wrld with this line. “Big 14” is a common phrase that Trippie starts a lot of his songs with. Juice Wrlds “999” is pretty self explanatory. The only other artist featured on this album is Trippie Redd who also happened to be best friends with Juice.\n\nYoungboy has also said before that he listens to Juice Wrlds music everyday. Not to mention, one of YB’s most popular songs “Bandit” features Juice Wrld himself.", "annotation_id": "33037440", "url": "https://genius.com/33037440", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "338", "line": "How I go wrong by lovin’ you? You talkin’ down and that’s not true Them people ‘round, they usin’ you", "vault_lines": ["How I go wrong by lovin' you?", "You talkin' down and that's not true", "Them people 'round, they usin' you"], "meaning": "This female he is speaking about is being influenced by her friends to think down upon NBA, which is making her talk bad about him.", "annotation_id": "26040302", "url": "https://genius.com/26040302", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "338", "line": "With a brick up on my mind", "vault_lines": ["With a brick up on my mind"], "meaning": "A ‘brick’ is known as cocaine.", "annotation_id": "26040300", "url": "https://genius.com/26040300", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
