{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "50 Shots", "line": "Blick shit, catch the whole clique and then we knock ’em down Duck, duck, goose, they runnin’ around Out here tryna pop a duck, no stoppin us But they got one bitch that’s think he fly, we euthanizing him", "vault_lines": ["Blick shit, catch the whole clique and then we knock 'em down", "Duck, duck, goose, they runnin' around", "Out here tryna pop a duck, no stoppin us", "But they got one bitch that's think he fly, we euthanizing him"], "meaning": "These bars are most likely in reference to the beef that YoungBoy (4KT) had with King Von and Lil Durk (OB/OTF).\n\n“Duck, Duck, goose, they runnin' ‘round out here tryna’ pop a Duck” is a clear reference to the beef between Lil Durk/King Von and FBG Duck. Durk and Duck were huge rivals of each other long before music came into the picture, but the rap game only turned the heat up on their problems.\n\n“But they got one bitch that think he fly, we euthanizin' him” is most likely in reference to King Von, who at this point was just stepping into the rap game and seeing huge success; because of this, he very quickly became cocky (“think he fly”).", "annotation_id": "29495630", "url": "https://genius.com/29495630", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "50 Shots", "line": "Everything around me banging red", "vault_lines": ["Everything around me banging red"], "meaning": "Everyone around Kentrell is banging, or repping, “red” or “blood”, which is a gang he is affiliated to.", "annotation_id": "29249997", "url": "https://genius.com/29249997", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "50 Shots", "line": "Youngin can’t control that Drac’", "vault_lines": ["Burn that bitch, take off his face, youngin can't control that Drac'"], "meaning": "Speaking of a youngin` apparently not being able to control his Weapon.\nYoungboy uses this part as a type of excuse regarding shots being let off a Draco.", "annotation_id": "25551421", "url": "https://genius.com/25551421", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
