{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "50 Shots", "line": "FN with that scope on, nigga, this that skully shit", "vault_lines": ["FN with that scope on, nigga, this that skully shit"], "meaning": "“Skully” was a fictional character & gang leader from FX hit show Snowfall.\n\nIn the series he’s seen with a Dragunov sniper rifle.\n\nYoungboy compares his gun, an FN rifle to Skully’s gun, a sniper rifle.", "annotation_id": "24031724", "url": "https://genius.com/24031724", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
