{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "7 Days", "line": "I said I quit for seven days, and then I’m back on drank", "vault_lines": ["I said I quit for seven days, and then I'm back on drank"], "meaning": "Drank, lean, codeine, or sizzurp is a staple in many of NBA’s songs. Here Youngboy is saying even though he tries his best, he can’t get off the lean. This doesn’t just mean drank however. He is talking about the whole lifestyle he lives and how he tries to quit it.", "annotation_id": "28835494", "url": "https://genius.com/28835494", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
