{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "AI Nash", "line": "Thirteen hoes like Steve Nash", "vault_lines": ["Thirteen hoes like Steve Nash"], "meaning": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again boasts about his sexual prowess by comparing himself to Hall of Fame NBA point guard, Steve Nash. During his stints with the Phoenix Suns and Dallas Mavericks, Nash wore the #13 jersey. After joining the Los Angeles Lakers in 2013, Nash changed his jersey number to #10 as #13 was retired in honor of Wilt Chamberlain.\n\n\n\nNash wearing his #13 jersey for the Phoenix Suns.", "annotation_id": "19475844", "url": "https://genius.com/19475844", "state": "accepted", "votes": 33, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
