{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Acclaimed Emotions", "line": "Shit, nigga, I done came up from the bottom, like literally", "vault_lines": ["Shit, nigga, I done came up from the bottom, like literally"], "meaning": "Youngboy is from Baton Rouge, Louisiana which is one of the most violent and dangerous places to live in the United States. This can also be interpreted as being from the south, which is literally the bottom of the country. In the song “No Switch” on the colors mixtape, Youngboy proudly proclaims, I’m from the bottom of the motherfuckin' United States\nYou heard me?\"", "annotation_id": "25519811", "url": "https://genius.com/25519811", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
