{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Achievements", "line": "Get blues, I give her a clue, like", "vault_lines": ["Get blues, I give her a clue, like"], "meaning": "“Blue’s Clues” is a popular children’s television show that combines animation and live-action. It follows the adventures of a host named Steve or later Joe, and their blue-spotted animated dog named Blue. The show is designed to engage young children in problem-solving and critical thinking. Steve or Joe presents viewers with puzzles or mysteries, and with the help of the audience, they solve these by following clues left by Blue and interacting with other animated characters and objects in the show. It’s an educational and entertaining program for preschool-aged children.", "annotation_id": "29656855", "url": "https://genius.com/29656855", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Achievements", "line": "Fill ’em up with slugs, nigga", "vault_lines": ["Fill 'em up with slugs, nigga"], "meaning": "In the context of “fill ‘em up with slugs,” YB is likely referring to using a firearm to shoot someone with bullets, which are sometimes colloquially called “slugs.”", "annotation_id": "29656854", "url": "https://genius.com/29656854", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
