{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Achievements", "line": "I can’t be apart of your family", "vault_lines": ["I can't be apart of your family"], "meaning": "He’s telling Yaya Mayweather he cannot be apart of her family. Or be together. Because he cannot stand her, as she reminds him too much of her father (Floyd Mayweather.)", "annotation_id": "25046087", "url": "https://genius.com/25046087", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Achievements", "line": "Hate that bitch ’cause I see she’s just like her daddy", "vault_lines": ["Hate that bitch 'cause I see she's just like her daddy"], "meaning": "Saying he hates that the mother of one of his children, Yaya Mayweather, reminds him too much of her father Floyd, who has always been described as flashy for  attention.", "annotation_id": "24986813", "url": "https://genius.com/24986813", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
