{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Act A Donkey", "line": "Came inside this game and bitch, I fucked it up, I’m a donkey", "vault_lines": ["Came inside this game and bitch, I fucked it up, I'm a donkey"], "meaning": "YoungBoy states that he has essentially won the game of rap and has made fruitful successes throughout his rap career. “Act a donkey” refers to how he is effortlessly doing this as donkeys are usually depicted as lazy", "annotation_id": "32965238", "url": "https://genius.com/32965238", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Act A Donkey", "line": "And I keep it on me, plenty money, bitch, don’t speak up on me", "vault_lines": ["And I keep it on me, plenty money, bitch, don't speak up on me"], "meaning": "Youngboy is referring to a gun when he says he keeps it on him, similar to the famous rapper Playboi Carti, who may keep a gun on him.", "annotation_id": "31869524", "url": "https://genius.com/31869524", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Act A Donkey", "line": "Them hoes took they children Benjis, now gotta find another boy, not YoungBoy", "vault_lines": ["Them hoes took they children Benjis, now gotta find another boy, not YoungBoy"], "meaning": "YoungBoy talks about his baby mama’s are not appreciating or are misusing the money he gives them for personal benefit.\n\nThis also correlates with the fact that his previous baby mamas were just using him for money, just to find another man\n\nThis can be confirmed through a few of his songs. In YoungBoy’s 2022 single, ‘Change’ he says\n\n“I put money in they pockets, although, they still plan on robbing me”\n\nThis can also be supported with YoungBoy’s song ‘Foolish Figure’ On his 2022 Mixtape, ‘Colors’\n\n“I ain’t see my daughters no, two of ‘em, I’m talkin in months\nThen they gon’ tell them people, lyin ‘, like I ain’t tryna do nothin’\nI gave them both one million a piece, they still keep my children for me”", "annotation_id": "30639765", "url": "https://genius.com/30639765", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Act A Donkey", "line": "Can’t fuck with JAY-Z, I’m way too ignorant, bitch, I stand on business", "vault_lines": ["Can't fuck with JAY-Z, I'm way too ignorant, bitch, I stand on business"], "meaning": "Since the beginning of November 2022, JAY-Z has found himself caught in the middle of a fued between YoungBoy Never Broke Again and NoCap about outpassing each other in music sales and the charts.\n\nAlthough it’s unclear what exactly started the beef between him and JAY-Z, YoungBoy claimed in an Instagram Story:\n\nI pay attention to all that slick ass shit you be doing and saying you a bitch ass nigga. What I call a real rapper? We don’t do music ’cause I don’t [fuck with you]. Stop speaking on me to these people. […] Jay-Z can’t out-rap me, boy, this ain’t ‘bout no music, you just a scary bitch. I wanted revenge on the labels, nigga. I’m holding over here.\n\nThe phrase “[standing] on business” means to focus on your responsibilities and not let anyone interfere with it—which, in this case, would be YoungBoy not allowing anyone to disrupt his musical success.", "annotation_id": "30600381", "url": "https://genius.com/30600381", "state": "accepted", "votes": 24, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Act A Donkey", "line": "You invited, ayy, tell Charlamange he invited to Grave Digger Mountain All he gotta do is pull up on me, nigga, and talk to me face to face", "vault_lines": ["You invited, ayy, tell Charlamange he invited to Grave Digger Mountain", "All he gotta do is pull up on me, nigga, and talk to me face to face"], "meaning": "This is pretty much, because YoungBoy on interview with bootleg Kev, and say that he does really “not big on being a father” in which He got immediate backlash, and that’s when Charlamange gave him donkey of the day\n\nhttps://youtu.be/D7PDXKQv0eE?si=q8LvSRaG8aMTgKp1\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/C120pLsvhew/?igsh=MWdqZnBzN2J6eDFndA==", "annotation_id": "30596136", "url": "https://genius.com/30596136", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
