{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Adapted", "line": "She was fuckin’ with lil’ nigga, I was fuckin’ with that boy", "vault_lines": ["She was fuckin' with lil' nigga, I was fuckin' with that boy"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is talking about the time he caught his girl cheating. He mentions it on a older song called “Get Right”\n\n\nGet Right “But the situation was a knot (Knot)\nWhole time I was feelin' her (Feelin' her)\nI ain’t have no intentions on thuggin' the bitch\nI was ready to flex, do my shit with her\nHold on, but she was fuckin' caught up\nShe know that’s YoungBoy, boy (She know that’s YoungBoy, boy)\nAnd that’s that Lil Top brother (That his brother)”", "annotation_id": "38173661", "url": "https://genius.com/38173661", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
