{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Add Em Up / Active (Boosie Badazz, Gee Money, and Fredo Bang Diss)", "line": "It’s gon’ be a murder nigga Cold cases, dead bodies Now, you facin’ me, I don’t give no fuck about them old bodies (Old bodies) You ain’t active in the set, nigga Northside all night, we zip nigga You throw one brick you gettin’ stretched nigga (Blrrddd) Put your pussy ass in check nigga (Check)", "vault_lines": ["It's gon' be a murder nigga", "Cold cases, dead bodies"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is talking to Boosie, telling him he doesn’t care about the bodies he sent Marlo Mike to get and how Boosie’s not active in his gang and how in the north side of Baton Rouge, LA, YB and his crew are killing people all night. He also says if Boosie throws a brick (sends a hit out on YoungBoy) he’ll get put in check instantly.", "annotation_id": "40122540", "url": "https://genius.com/40122540", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Add Em Up / Active (Boosie Badazz, Gee Money, and Fredo Bang Diss)", "line": "Now this the story ’bout two niggas from the south of the map Got too much money so the other wanna knock him off It’s cold blooded, take a blood bath when windows let down Gon’ be a cold motherfuckin’ war inside of this town", "vault_lines": ["Gon' be a cold motherfuckin' war inside of this town"], "meaning": "This is YB telling us the backstory of why Fredo Bang and him are beefing. Says it’s all about him having more money now Fredo Bang wants to kill him. YB responds to that by saying when him and his gang car windows roll down, it’ll be a cold-blooded killing, and it’ll also be a cold-blooded war inside of Baton Rouge (in which indeed it was).", "annotation_id": "37927405", "url": "https://genius.com/37927405", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Add Em Up / Active (Boosie Badazz, Gee Money, and Fredo Bang Diss)", "line": "Tear up the car, that be that Bleek (That be that Bleek, baow)", "vault_lines": ["Tear up the car, that be that Bleek (That be that Bleek, baow)"], "meaning": "Boosie got a homeboy named Bleek that died so this was a diss to his homeboy and him", "annotation_id": "37927402", "url": "https://genius.com/37927402", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
