{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Akbar", "line": "And you want them fancy things so you better play your part Told that bitch you don’t work then I swear you gon’ starve", "vault_lines": ["And you want them fancy things so you better play your part", "Told that bitch you don't work then I swear you gon' starve"], "meaning": "A rephrasing of “he who does not work, neither shall he eat,” which originally comes from the Bible verse 2 Thessalonians 3:10:\n\n“For even when we were with you, we would give you this command: If anyone is not willing to work, let him not eat.”\n\nYB is telling his girlfriend that she can’t complain about his lifestyle when he works hard and she doesn’t, and if she wants the rewards of the work then she has to do the work", "annotation_id": "29843268", "url": "https://genius.com/29843268", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
