{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Another Episode", "line": "I got a knife inside my bunk, no bond, I don’t know when I’m goin’ home", "vault_lines": ["I got a knife inside my bunk, no bond, I don't know when I'm goin' home"], "meaning": "This might be a reference to his incarceration for the prescription drugs ring in 2024. In May 2024, his bail was denied. YB says he hid a knife under his bunk in prison and also expresses his paranoia at the time, as he didn’t know whether he might be released.\n\nThere were rumors that, given the 66+ charges, he would receive a sentence of at least 60 years. Some even said he could face more than 100 years, considering his pending charges in his Baton Rouge case too.", "annotation_id": "38347411", "url": "https://genius.com/38347411", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Another Episode", "line": "I’m finna go back to that North, right where the fuck I was found", "vault_lines": ["I'm finna go back to that North, right where the fuck I was found"], "meaning": "It could be a reference to his lyrics in Blackball: “In the slums, right in that North, where the fuck I was found.”", "annotation_id": "38347359", "url": "https://genius.com/38347359", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
