{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bad Bad", "line": "I’m real right, hold yo’ sticks tight, get yo’ clique knocked with this cash", "vault_lines": ["I'm real right, hold yo' sticks tight, get yo' clique knocked with this cash"], "meaning": "The correct lyric is “I’m Real Ryte” YoungBoy is affiliated with the Real Ryte Bloods, “Real Ryte\" is a set within the Bloods street gang, specifically operating in Brooklyn, New York. They were involved in a violent conflict with a rival crew called the “Breadgang”. Members of Real Ryte have been arrested and convicted on charges related to violence and gang activity.", "annotation_id": "35251556", "url": "https://genius.com/35251556", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
