{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bad Bad", "line": "Wanna be YoungBoy, ol’ clown ass nigga", "vault_lines": ["Wanna be YoungBoy, ol' clown ass nigga"], "meaning": "This line is a reference to NLE Choppas rise to fame, and his EP ‘Cottonwood’ that was released just a month before ‘Still Flexin, Still Steppin’. The EP contained his smash-hit ‘Shotta Flow’ along with a music video that ammassed over 150 million streams on YouTube.\nMany fans and critics alike have found NLE Choppas appearance, style and flow extremely similar to Youngboy’s. This gives people the impression NLE is trying to “be Youngboy”.", "annotation_id": "26011102", "url": "https://genius.com/26011102", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bad Bad", "line": "He lose his mind and he put five on top yo’ head On them Xans he catch him walkin’ like he dead He don’t give a fuck if it’s his blood, he zip him, yeah (Mm-mm-mm)", "vault_lines": ["He lose his mind and he put five on top yo' head", "On them Xans he catch him walkin' like he dead", "He don't give a fuck if it's his blood, he zip him, yeah (Mm-mm-mm)"], "meaning": "This is another mix order of bars done by youngboy\n\nLine 1 and 3 is related\n\n1.he put money on his head for his shooter to collect\n\n3.he shooter loves the gang more then anything so he doesn’t care if the target related to him or a member of blood that he cools with he only loves 4kt", "annotation_id": "24959641", "url": "https://genius.com/24959641", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
