{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bad Morning", "line": "Got another pack rolled up, he gon’ smoke it Ten grand, twenty grand, all night scope", "vault_lines": ["Got another pack rolled up, he gon' smoke it", "Ten grand, twenty grand, all night scope"], "meaning": "“Got another pack rolled up”\nHave another contract pending for his shooter.\n\n“He Gone smoke it”\n\nRapper referrers to their dead enemies ass pack\\weed sense this one is just rolled up youngboy is sure he going to lit and smoke it ( do the hit )\n\n“Ten grand, twenty grand, all night scoping”\n\n10k 20k to kill the target and the shooter iwill stalk the target all night then perform the hit.\nNBA Herm is also known to do the stalking", "annotation_id": "24949257", "url": "https://genius.com/24949257", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bad Morning", "line": "I’ma foreign my engine, take luxury narcotics", "vault_lines": ["I'ma foreign my engine, take luxury narcotics"], "meaning": "“I’ma foreign my engine”\nOverseas exotic luxury cars such as AMG , M-sport , Porsche ect.\n\n“Take luxury narcotics”\nUsing limited or rare expensive drugs like lean , Molly , Percs or Xans", "annotation_id": "24948950", "url": "https://genius.com/24948950", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bad Morning", "line": "Leave ’em dead if he miss it Should have aimed when you shot it, don’t fuck with my bodies", "vault_lines": ["Should have aimed when you shot it, don't fuck with my bodies"], "meaning": "If The shooter miss the shot to kill the person with a hit-out on him will result in the shooter himself being murder. People that have in active hit usually have a high reward which can be very disappointing because they really want him dead or really want the money. Going on a hit can be very pricey , having high priced info for the target location , just finding someone with such info can be impossible.\ntime and patience itself can be irritating if missed ,most cold case is plotted/plan", "annotation_id": "24948868", "url": "https://genius.com/24948868", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bad Morning", "line": "One was dead in less than sixty We gon’ burn them forensics,", "vault_lines": ["All praise to Allah, one was dead in less than sixty"], "meaning": "“one was dead in less than sixty”\n\nSomeone dying almost immediately after suffer gunshot wounds in fatal parts usually headshot , Neck-shot or chest shot especially,\nIf used with high powered weapons such as 7.62 and 223/556 ( AR-15 handgun , Draco, Ak or a Ak-47 styled AR-15 ) .45 , .40 or 10mm ( Glocks , FN , S&W , PTR And HK )\n\n“We gon' burn them forensics”\n\nDestroy all evidence so detectives won’t know or have any type of leads ( Cold-case )\nsuch as bleaching or burn a car ( if the shooter’s were inside a car ) or picking up or having a shell Catcher.\nForensic team looks for cartridges to learn the position of the shooter just by learning that can lead to conviction , especially if they were in a car .\nFinding them cartridges can lead to them seeking video footage from Nearby stores or traffic cameras matching the time of death and possibility of cars related to this getaway", "annotation_id": "24948735", "url": "https://genius.com/24948735", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bad Morning", "line": "Real slime, that was my partner for a minute Contract from my brother when them hollows got up in it", "vault_lines": ["Real slime, that was my partner for a minute", "Contract from my brother when them hollows got up in it"], "meaning": "“That was my partner for a minute”\n\nGee money and youngboy were close friends for a while\n\n“real slime”\n\nWhile they were still friends YB And gee money was thuggin in the south but became Enemies.\n\n“when them hollows got up in it”\n\nGee money were killed and a parking lot due to gun violence\n\n “contract from my brother”\n\nSome say never broke again affiliate “big dump” put a hit out on gee money which is called a contract, money on head,bag on his head etc.", "annotation_id": "24948637", "url": "https://genius.com/24948637", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
