{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bad Morning", "line": "Dodgin’ bullets in the car when them shottas sent them in it", "vault_lines": ["Dodgin' bullets in the car when them shottas sent them in it"], "meaning": "This is likely alluding to the incident that took place in Miami in 2019, which resulted in the death of a bystander. A group of armed men attempted to murder Youngboy in front of the Trump Hotel, and Youngboy and his entourage returned fire. Youngboy’s girlfriend at the time was shot in the shoulder, but survived. None of Youngboy’s crew was charged for the death that resulted because it was determined they acted in self defense.", "annotation_id": "24043458", "url": "https://genius.com/24043458", "state": "pending", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bad Morning", "line": "But I don’t need her hand when I’m runnin’ up Benji’s", "vault_lines": ["But I don't need her hand when I'm runnin' up Benji's"], "meaning": "Youngboy is saying that he doesn’t need any woman when he has money, and that is exactly what he is doing, racking in the money. Youngboy was the third highest paid rapper in 2020, behind Drake and Post Malone.", "annotation_id": "24043454", "url": "https://genius.com/24043454", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
