{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Baddest Thing", "line": "Louis V bag made by Virgil, fuck nigga tried charging me sixty G’s", "vault_lines": ["Louis V bag made by Virgil, fuck nigga tried charging me sixty G's"], "meaning": "Virgil Abloh was an American designer, entrepreneur, and DJ who has been the artistic director of Louis Vuitton’s menswear collection since March 2018. Abloh is also the chief executive officer of the Milan-based label Off-White, a fashion house he founded in 2012.\n\nYounboy expresses his anger towards Virgil’s outrageous price of his Louis Vuitton bag, which he tried charging Youngboy $60,000\nfor.", "annotation_id": "24101518", "url": "https://genius.com/24101518", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Baddest Thing", "line": "Louis V bag made by Virgil, fuck nigga tried charging me sixty G’s", "vault_lines": ["Louis V bag made by Virgil, fuck nigga tried charging me sixty G's"], "meaning": "Virgil Abloh was an American designer, entrepreneur, and DJ who has been the artistic director of Louis Vuitton’s menswear collection since March 2018. Abloh is also the chief executive officer of the Milan-based label Off-White, a fashion house he founded in 2012.\n\nYounboy expresses his anger towards Virgil’s outrageous price of his Louis Vuitton bag, which he tried charging Youngboy $60,000\nfor.", "annotation_id": "24101448", "url": "https://genius.com/24101448", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Baddest Thing", "line": "You the baddest thing I seen in a while, ooh, my shorty, oh, she, oh", "vault_lines": ["You the baddest thing I seen in a while, ooh, my shorty, oh, she, oh"], "meaning": "Youngboy never broke again describes a woman he recently encountered as the one of the most beautiful woman he had seen in a long time. “Baddest” being an antonymy slang actually means the complete opposite.\n\nUrban dictionary definition of “baddest”:\n“Toughest, coolest.\n\nAlways used complimentary, unless used by someone who has poor grammar and does not know that the superlative form of “bad” is “worst”.\"\n\nUrban dictionary definition of “baddest bitch”:\n\n“a sexy original female who can have any man or object she desires who other women hate on cuz she “got it like that” she has a nice body, a cute face, with intelligence who knows how to get that money without being a gold digger”", "annotation_id": "24101445", "url": "https://genius.com/24101445", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
