{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bang In Atlanta (CHOPPAS SPRAY)", "line": "Atlanta", "vault_lines": ["It he tourin', we gon' bang 'em in Atlanta, huh"], "meaning": "Referring to Lousiana’s Atlanta, or Georiga’s Atlanta.\n\nPersonally, I believe it could be Georiga’s since he was officially charged in April 2019. In Fulton county, It was a hotel incident which led these charges back in February of 2019.\n\nSong details:\nERA: House Arrest 2019 (Better known to some people, Ai Yb2 era due to the fact, almost a lot of those songs were throwaways in the session for the album, and some of them made it to the album.)\n\nBasically, this could’ve been during his time in Georgia, or after.", "annotation_id": "38345837", "url": "https://genius.com/38345837", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
