{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bet", "line": "I got that bag on me", "vault_lines": ["Whole lot of chains around my neck, I got that bag on me"], "meaning": "NBA YoungBoy keeps a paper bag over his head, presumably because he’s ashamed of his appearance.\n\nI’m not saying he’s a hideous self-loathing freak, but he does have a song called ‘I Hate YoungBoy’ and has frequently called himself ugly in lyrics.\n\nHowever, some women clearly find him attractive, as he has 146 children.", "annotation_id": "37172239", "url": "https://genius.com/37172239", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
