{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Big Truck", "line": "Pop your top with .30s, up in surgery, can’t sew back together", "vault_lines": ["Pop your top with .30s, up in surgery, can't sew back together"], "meaning": "He’s most likely referring to 30mm ammunition. 30mm is a very lethal type of ammo and is used to penetrate through tough forces that regular bullets couldn’t, such as armored vehicles and bunkers and isn’t meant for use against the human body. The lethality of a 30mm is very great and would most likely cause fatal damage to a person and leave a wound that cannot be easily surgically sewn back up.", "annotation_id": "31092684", "url": "https://genius.com/31092684", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
