{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Big Truck", "line": "Sick of bitch niggas from the city with that rappin’ Huh, they know I make it happen, I ain’t rappin’", "vault_lines": ["Huh, they know I make it happen, I ain't rappin'"], "meaning": "“Sick of bitch niggas from the city with that rappin,” means that NBA youngboy is tired of people from a particular city, with their rapping. And the line “ Huh, they know I make it happen, I aint rapping,” means that he is not just about talk, and he is really about what he says, unlike other rappers when they rap.", "annotation_id": "28362387", "url": "https://genius.com/28362387", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
