{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bitch Yeah", "line": "Put yo’ bitch in VLONE", "vault_lines": ["Put yo' bitch in VLONE"], "meaning": "Here YoungBoy talks about how he can situate one’s significant other in a brand called “VLONE” The Vlone brand lives by the mantra “you live alone and die alone.” Vlone was founded by three people, A$AP Rocky and A$AP Bari of the hip hop group A$AP MOB, as well as Edison Chen of CLOT.", "annotation_id": "29508584", "url": "https://genius.com/29508584", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
