{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Black", "line": "And I went bought like thirty Rollies like a nigga Ric Flair (Yeah, yeah, like a nigga Ric Flair) Wait, hm, like a nigga Ric Flair, mm (Ah) And I want damn near thirty Rollies like a nigga Ric Flair Ha, haha, like a nigga Ric Flair, ha (You already know)", "vault_lines": ["And I went bought like thirty Rollies like a nigga Ric Flair (Yeah, yeah, like a nigga Ric Flair)", "Wait, hm, like a nigga Ric Flair, mm (Ah)", "And I want damn near thirty Rollies like a nigga Ric Flair", "Ha, haha, like a nigga Ric Flair, ha (You already know)"], "meaning": "Ric Flair is a professional wrestler that was active from 1972-2008 for the wrestling company    WWF (World Wrestling Federation) now WWE. He is also known for his “Woo” signature, and is considered one of the best professional wrestlers to ever step in the ring.", "annotation_id": "27507975", "url": "https://genius.com/27507975", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
