{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Boom", "line": "Ooh, boomed up, I’m in this bitch I just downed my cup, now I’m gon’ do my shit I get to crankin’, powered up, I get it poppin’ in this bitch We got them shots on all of us, we solve the problem when it hit", "vault_lines": ["Ooh, boomed up, I'm in this bitch", "I just downed my cup, now I'm gon' do my shit", "I get to crankin', powered up, I get it poppin' in this bitch", "We got them shots on all of us, we solve the problem when it hit"], "meaning": "Yb just had a drink and now he’s high and he’s got the energy to deal with the opps. The boom is the shots being fired.", "annotation_id": "21055436", "url": "https://genius.com/21055436", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
