{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bop", "line": "Bitch, we gon’ beat the last side, we’re still together, that’s how that go R.I.P. Dump, now I done seen this once before Yeah, ain’t no problem, I say", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, we gon' beat the last side, we're still together, that's how that go", "R.I.P. Dump, now I done seen this once before", "Yeah, ain't no problem, I say"], "meaning": "He is speaking of the beef in his earlier years with the TBG gang. Although NBA ultimately succeeded, he did however lost an important member, Big Dump. In his eyes, that was an important obstacle to overcome. In doing that among other things, any opposition he face, is just that, another obstacle.", "annotation_id": "30425413", "url": "https://genius.com/30425413", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
