{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "BossManeDlow", "line": "I pop my shit for free (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["I pop my shit for free (Yeah)"], "meaning": "YoungBoy interpolates T.I.’s “24’s” (2003), where he raps:\n\n“Money, hoes, (ah, and the)\nCars and clothes (why?)\nThat’s how all my niggas roll (how we ride shawty?)\nBlowin' dro (uh oh)\n24’s (woo)\nThat’s how all my niggas roll\nMoney, hoes, (ah and the)\nCars and clothes\nThat’s how all my niggas roll (ah, how they ride pimpin'?)\nBlowin' dro (uh oh)\n24’s (okay)\nThat’s how all my niggas roll”", "annotation_id": "37895986", "url": "https://genius.com/37895986", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
