{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "BossManeDlow", "line": "I’m number one, if he want it, I beat him about it, he better go workout his body", "vault_lines": ["I'm number one, if he want it, I beat him about it, he better go workout his body"], "meaning": "Lil Baby song Freestyle went #1 on charts, then one of YB songs took the spot. YoungBoy uses words to symbolize fighting when in reality he’s telling Lil Baby to work on his flow if he wants the #1 spot so bad.", "annotation_id": "37796052", "url": "https://genius.com/37796052", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "BossManeDlow", "line": "Lil’ shawty, she lovin’ the Tymer", "vault_lines": ["Look at the chain, these diamonds, they shine, they gon' blind 'em, lil' shawty, she lovin' the Tymer"], "meaning": "Tymer is slang for a musical artist that has collaborated on songs and albums, which would describe NBA YoungBoy.", "annotation_id": "37796041", "url": "https://genius.com/37796041", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "BossManeDlow", "line": "Boy, I get my whole percentage, what the fuck you talkin’ ’bout?", "vault_lines": ["Boy, I get my whole percentage, what the fuck you talkin' 'bout?"], "meaning": "YB is talking to 6ix9ine who said that Atlantic records owns almost all his percentages witch isn’t true because NBA YoungBoy is a independent artist", "annotation_id": "37795754", "url": "https://genius.com/37795754", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "BossManeDlow", "line": "Nigga, I’m a gangster, I’m not finna do this shit with y’all", "vault_lines": ["Nigga, I'm a gangster, I'm not finna do this shit with y'all"], "meaning": "Reference to the NLE Choppa diss songs that he released. He is saying that he is a gangster and he isn’t going back & forth with a fake gangster.", "annotation_id": "37784053", "url": "https://genius.com/37784053", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
