{"type": "song", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Brain (Get You Killed)", "status": "done", "targets": 0, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Youngboy-never-broke-again-brain-get-you-killed-lyrics", "genius_title": "Brain (Get You Killed)", "genius_id": 8029771, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Brand New", "line": "BNYX", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Benjamin Saint Fort (born April 23, 1995), professionally known as BNYX®, (pronounced Benny X), is a record producer from Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. He is known for his production for Drake, Yeat, Lil Uzi Vert, Travis Scott, and Lancey Foux, among others.\n\nBNYX® acquired his pseudonym as a result of taking his nickname, Benny, and attaching it to the letter X, which he describes stands for “extreme,” a quality that he strives to achieve when creating music.\n\nIn 2021, BNYX® signed to record label and production group, Working on Dying.\n\nI-I-I’m working on dying, BNYX", "annotation_id": "41572479", "url": "https://genius.com/41572479", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Brand New", "line": "BNYX", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Benjamin Saint Fort (born April 23, 1995), professionally known as BNYX®, (pronounced Benny X), is a record producer from Philadelphia, Pennsylvania. He is known for his production for Drake, Yeat, Lil Uzi Vert, Travis Scott, and Lancey Foux, among others.\n\nBNYX® acquired his pseudonym as a result of taking his nickname, Benny, and attaching it to the letter X, which he describes stands for “extreme,” a quality that he strives to achieve when creating music.\n\nIn 2021, BNYX® signed to record label and production group, Working on Dying.\n\nI-I-I’m working on dying, BNYX", "annotation_id": "41572468", "url": "https://genius.com/41572468", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
