{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Break or Make Me", "line": "Tell me, bae, now can we please stop fighting? I need you on side me", "vault_lines": ["Tell me, bae, now can we please stop fighting? I need you on side me"], "meaning": "Yb wants the fighting with his significant other to stop bc he needs her support through his hard times", "annotation_id": "41273167", "url": "https://genius.com/41273167", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Break or Make Me", "line": "Panic, I buy you a Patek, you better go tat it just like Nene too, uh", "vault_lines": ["Panic, I buy you a Patek, you better go tat it just like Nene too, uh"], "meaning": "His ex-girlfriend Jania Meshell, also known by the nickname “Nene” tattooed his name on her face while they were still together. He also got her name on his face, his hand, and her face on his chest.", "annotation_id": "40071532", "url": "https://genius.com/40071532", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Break or Make Me", "line": "It’s a cold, cold world outside, ain’t on the worst crew I ain’t got no one that I can trust, I got my guard up so high Can’t even be with you", "vault_lines": ["Can't even be with you"], "meaning": "Kentrell is saying that it is a dangerous world out there. The people he rides with are not the worst of the worst. But he can’t really trust anyone in his circle. Whoever this special person is he can’t even trust them or be with them. Trusting is dangerous.", "annotation_id": "26796195", "url": "https://genius.com/26796195", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
