{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "Throwin’ that NBA up, for me, set you up to bust your ass (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Throwin' that NBA up, for me, set you up to bust your ass (Yeah)"], "meaning": "When Youngboy said “Throwin that  NBA up” isn’t talking about NBA “National Basketball Association” but his gang “Never Broke Again”.", "annotation_id": "26852962", "url": "https://genius.com/26852962", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "I see souls, I’m with my kids Get them fuckin’ bodies out of here", "vault_lines": ["I see souls, I'm with my kids", "Get them fuckin' bodies out of here"], "meaning": "This is a clear instance of hallucination (by trauma, drug, or both) where Kentrell sees the people who have died in his life by his hand or otherwise. He is haunted by death in his daily life even when he desires peace, i.e. in the presence of his kids", "annotation_id": "26852937", "url": "https://genius.com/26852937", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "Make them people outline chalk ’em (Brr)", "vault_lines": ["Make them people outline chalk 'em (Brr)"], "meaning": "When a dead body is discovered, it’s a norm for law enforcement to outline chalk the body, or trace around the body with a piece of chalk. This is so they know the exact position the body was in when found, and where they found it.", "annotation_id": "26287330", "url": "https://genius.com/26287330", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "Kill that nigga, think he saw a gremlin how his body shook", "vault_lines": ["Kill that nigga, think he saw a gremlin how his body shook"], "meaning": "In Atlanta King von went to a club Quando Rondo and King von got into a fight outside the club and Tim shot at king von. Youngboy said that that because how King von body shook when he was being shot at", "annotation_id": "25550426", "url": "https://genius.com/25550426", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "Lil Dee, that’s my cousin, man", "vault_lines": ["Lil Dee, that's my cousin, man"], "meaning": "In reference to the previous bar, Youngboy’s cousin Lil Dee nickname is “Skully”", "annotation_id": "25509302", "url": "https://genius.com/25509302", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "Youngin weighed a hundred pounds, know he can’t control that (Yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Youngin weighed a hundred pounds, know he can't control that (Yeah)"], "meaning": "Youngboy is saying that the person wielding this large weapon only weighs 100 pounds, and he cannot control the recoil of this weapon. Large assault weapons are difficult to control when firing rapidly due to recoil.", "annotation_id": "25044003", "url": "https://genius.com/25044003", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "He in Miami and he hidin’ from this murder gang (He hidin’)", "vault_lines": ["He in Miami and he hidin’ from this murder gang (He hidin’)"], "meaning": "This is a fredo bang diss , fredo currently lives in Miami. Fredo bang reacted to this diss on instagram", "annotation_id": "24967564", "url": "https://genius.com/24967564", "state": "pending", "votes": 22, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "Right on him, leave a toe tag (Yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Right on him, leave a toe tag (Yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "When someone dies and is sent to the morgue, they will put a tag on their toe that states their information such as their date of death, name, height, weight, eye color, hair color, race, cause of death, etc to make it easier for the pathologist to identify the corpse.", "annotation_id": "24936031", "url": "https://genius.com/24936031", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "Utah, come here bitch, get hogtied, another died", "vault_lines": ["Utah, come here bitch, get hogtied, another died"], "meaning": "Youngboy is currently in house arrest in Utah but he’s saying that it won’t stop him from killing you if you pull up on him", "annotation_id": "24932597", "url": "https://genius.com/24932597", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "Like Chief Sosa say, “Better get your ass up outta here, Juwanna Mann” (Get out of here)", "vault_lines": ["Like Chief Sosa say, \"Better get your ass up outta here, Juwanna Mann\" (Get out of here)"], "meaning": "Double Entendre\nin chief keef Unreleased song Joker\nchief keef says “ get your ass up outta here , juwanna man ” Referring to the 2002 Jesse Vaughan film “juwanna mann”\n\n\n\n this is also NBA Youngboy Is Saluting Chief Keef one of his known influences\n\nNba youngboy & Chief keef also have a song called Fireman\n\nChief keef is also from O Block and was the first rapper to become popular in the projects", "annotation_id": "24914618", "url": "https://genius.com/24914618", "state": "pending", "votes": 36, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "He don’t give a fuck, he check up off the list, they squad", "vault_lines": ["He don't give a fuck, he check up off the list, they squad"], "meaning": "This bar is most likely a reference to Savannah rapper Lul Tim and his record “Off the List”.\n\nJust checked a new pussy nigga off the list\n\n\n\nLul Tim is an affiliate of NBA artist Quando Rondo and his 1027 JumpOut Gang crew, and was charged in the murder of Chicago rapper King Von in November 2020, and was released in March 2021.", "annotation_id": "24892758", "url": "https://genius.com/24892758", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "Inside the freezer, where them people put ’em ’fore they stitch his ass (Yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Inside the freezer, where them people put 'em 'fore they stitch his ass (Yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "He’s referring to the leak autopsy pictures of King Von that surfaced on the internet in late 2020. In the pictures, his body was stiched up at the morgue.", "annotation_id": "24872211", "url": "https://genius.com/24872211", "state": "pending", "votes": 40, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "Call that boy a dead man (Spin), name that boy Rudolph (Baow) When he see that red beam (Red), headshot, that’s a skully scene (Yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Call that boy a dead man (Spin), name that boy Rudolph (Baow)", "When he see that red beam (Red), headshot, that's a skully scene (Yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "Rudolph the Red Nose reindeer had a red nose and the YoungBoy is saying he calls the victim Rudolph once he points his Red dot laser at the victim’s nose, which is a part of the head. He says it is a skully scene because he shot him in the head and skully means skull.", "annotation_id": "24872168", "url": "https://genius.com/24872168", "state": "pending", "votes": 28, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "I got locked inside the penn’, but now I’m out", "vault_lines": ["I got locked inside the penn', but now I'm out"], "meaning": "He got locked up in March of 2021 and just got bail at the end of November and is serving house arrest for 2 gun charges, one for California and one for Baton Rogue.", "annotation_id": "24872150", "url": "https://genius.com/24872150", "state": "pending", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "With that stick, that be my fishin’ pole, another opp got hooked (Hooked)", "vault_lines": ["With that stick, that be my fishin' pole, another opp got hooked (Hooked)"], "meaning": "It’s a Double entendre the way he states brings the hook then 2 lines later say the hook is his pole/stick/gun but also when he says bring the hook he means the hook of the song.", "annotation_id": "24872135", "url": "https://genius.com/24872135", "state": "pending", "votes": 27, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "Pallbearers bring your body to the grave (Yeah, bring it to the grave, slime) We leave him slayed, nigga It ain’t a open case, we left his motherfuckin’ brain missin’ (Grr)", "vault_lines": ["It ain't a open case, we left his motherfuckin' brain missin’ (Grr)"], "meaning": "Pallbearers are funeral service workers who carry the coffin to the gravesite.\n\n Pallbearers carrying a coffin. \n\nA Closed casket is used when a person’s dead body is too unsightly for viewership by the funeral attendants.\n\nYoungBoy is implying that the victim’s face is in a gruesome state to look at after being shot in the head.", "annotation_id": "24872096", "url": "https://genius.com/24872096", "state": "accepted", "votes": 46, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "We leave out teddy bears right there where he bleed at", "vault_lines": ["We leave out teddy bears right there where he bleed at"], "meaning": "When someone dies usually on the scene or where they grew up at people surround it with teddy bears, flowers, and candles to show their condolences. So YB is saying when they kill whoever they gonna cause the victims friends and family to leave teddy bears on the scene because of them.", "annotation_id": "24872094", "url": "https://genius.com/24872094", "state": "pending", "votes": 29, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "He pray to the Devil, then that nigga pray to God", "vault_lines": ["He pray to the Devil, then that nigga pray to God"], "meaning": "This may be interpreted as a diss to King Von, King Von released a song called ‘Demon’ from his album Welcome to O’Block, that is why Youngboy is saying ‘he pray to the Devil’.\n\nKing Von was killed on November 6 2020, by a NBA Youngboy associate Lul Timm hence why Youngboy said ‘then that nigga pray to God’ alluding his unfortunate death.", "annotation_id": "24868389", "url": "https://genius.com/24868389", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bring The Hook", "line": "Nigga, this that Squid Game, O’Block pack get rolled up (Block) Murder what they told us, Atlanta boy get fold up (Fold up)", "vault_lines": ["Nigga, this that Squid Game, O'Block pack get rolled up (Block)", "Murder what they told us, Atlanta boy get fold up (Fold up)"], "meaning": "Here, YoungBoy Never Broke Again speaks about the late Chicago rapper, Davon Daquan Bennet, better known as King Von. Von had been shot and killed in a deadly shooting at a nightclub in Atlanta after an altercation with Quando Rondo and Lul Tim.\n\nQuando Rondo and Lul Tim are both signee’s apart of YoungBoy’s label, Never Broke Again.\n\nSquid Game is an East-Asian TV series that involves playing games fighting for your life. If you lose said games, you will be killed and elliminated.", "annotation_id": "24864548", "url": "https://genius.com/24864548", "state": "accepted", "votes": 129, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
