{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bruce Wayne", "line": "All black on like Batman, Batman, is it you? Batman", "vault_lines": ["All black on like Batman, Batman, is it you? Batman"], "meaning": "yb is literally saying he has all black on like batman", "annotation_id": "38519621", "url": "https://genius.com/38519621", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bruce Wayne", "line": "I’m in this bitch like I’m Robin, I got it", "vault_lines": ["I'm in this bitch like I'm Robin, I got it"], "meaning": "There’s a lot of backstory with DC comics in this verse. The 2nd Robin (Jason Todd) went to go kill the Joker alone without Batman, trying to prove that he can fight crime without Batman. The Joker killed Robin, but he was resurrected and controlled by the Scarecrow. His new alias was “Red Hood”, a villain (carrying out Scarecrow’s plans by destroying Gotham) —> anti-hero (turned against Scarecrow, defeated him, but became a lone vigilante because he knew he wouldn’t be seen as a hero anymore after his terror in Gotham.)\n\n“You wan’ be a Joker, I tear up your body”\n\n*Once Batman found out that Robin was killed by the Joker, Batman went out and killed him without knowing that Robin was being resurrected at that time. After Batman found out about everything Robin (Red Hood) did in Gotham, he forgave him, but Robin (Red Hood) still left because he felt as if he didn’t deserve forgiveness.", "annotation_id": "38453561", "url": "https://genius.com/38453561", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bruce Wayne", "line": "You wan’ be a Joker", "vault_lines": ["You wan' be a Joker, I tear up your body"], "meaning": "The Joker is Batman’s major enemy, so it’s like “don’t play villain/clown with me.”", "annotation_id": "38367406", "url": "https://genius.com/38367406", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bruce Wayne", "line": "In the Lamb’ like I’m Bruce Wayne", "vault_lines": ["In the Lamb' like I'm Bruce Wayne"], "meaning": "Lamborghini is a real luxury supercar brand, so it stacks the “billionaire” image.", "annotation_id": "38367385", "url": "https://genius.com/38367385", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Bruce Wayne", "line": "I’m with this shit, Backyardigan", "vault_lines": ["I'm with this shit, Backyardigan"], "meaning": "The Backyardigans is a kids’ show about imaginary adventures “in the backyard,” so he’s joking like he’s always “on adventures / missions.”", "annotation_id": "38367377", "url": "https://genius.com/38367377", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
