{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Cage Feeling", "line": "They took the soul from Boozilla Killed lil’ Dave when I was little", "vault_lines": ["They took the soul from Boozilla"], "meaning": "He’s paying respects to his cousin Boozilla (Keondrae Ricks) and close friend Lil Dave (David Cobb) and refers to their untimely death.\n\nBoozilla who was shot to death on Nebraska Street in early November of 2016 which later led To Youngboy retaliating and later being charged for Aggravated Assault, And Lil Dave killed after attending a party honoring teens who lost their life to gun violence late march in 2010. Both are mentioned in many songs by the artist.", "annotation_id": "25606366", "url": "https://genius.com/25606366", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
