{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Calling From Rio", "line": "Before you rat, we set a trap, informant ain’t gon’ make it back", "vault_lines": ["Before you rat, we set a trap, informant ain't gon' make it back"], "meaning": "Before someone goes to tell on YB and his crew about the crimes that they’ve committed, YB and his crew blocks them in by a fake scenario, or trap and silences them before they can go back to the police and tell everything.", "annotation_id": "38055887", "url": "https://genius.com/38055887", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
