{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Can’t Be Saved", "line": "On my soul, if I could, I’d kill him again (Uh)", "vault_lines": ["On my soul, if I could, I'd kill him again"], "meaning": "Since Kentrell already “killed him” he states if he COULD he would kill him again", "annotation_id": "27076863", "url": "https://genius.com/27076863", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Can’t Be Saved", "line": "Everybody postin’ shit that could put me in a cage That shit so hurtful, they gon’ drag me ’til they see me gone", "vault_lines": ["That shit so hurtful, they gon' drag me 'til they see me gone"], "meaning": "“Everybody postin' shit that could put me in a cage” Here he says the media such as TSR (The Shade Room) are posting certain things that can get Kentrell locked up.\n\n“That shit so hurtful they gon' drag me ‘til they see me go” This hurts Youngboy’s feelings and he feels as if until he goes to jail people are going to stay dragging his name.", "annotation_id": "27076847", "url": "https://genius.com/27076847", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Can’t Be Saved", "line": "Now, I can’t be saved (Saved) No matter what I do they say that I’m wrong (I’m wrong)", "vault_lines": ["No matter what I do they say that I'm wrong"], "meaning": "“Now I can’t be saved” This states that Kentrell says he can’t be saved anymore, and that he got too deep.\n\n“No matter what I do they say that I’m wrong” Here he saw that whenever he does something positive or stay out of anything, people always say that he’s in the wrong or he’s negative.", "annotation_id": "27076834", "url": "https://genius.com/27076834", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
