{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Can’t Be Saved", "line": "Fuck the media, and fuck the shaderoom too Bitch Broke ass motherfucker, ho", "vault_lines": ["And fuck the shaderoom too, bitch"], "meaning": "The Shade Room aka TSR is a media company, founded by Angelica Nwandu in March 2014. Instagram-based, The Shade Room offers celebrity and trending news on an hourly basis, predominantly within the African American community. Youngboy feels that the company immensely contributes the slander he gets via social media.", "annotation_id": "21540703", "url": "https://genius.com/21540703", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
