{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Can’t Be Saved", "line": "I don’t fuck with that ho, I don’t care ’bout that baby", "vault_lines": ["I don't fuck with that ho, I don't care 'bout that baby"], "meaning": "Youngboy has a son with a woman named Nia, she was only supposed to be a one night stand, so he’s saying that he never wanted to be in a relationship with her and they are no longer messing around. He is also saying that he doesn’t care about the baby she had which is named Kamron Gaulden and was born on March 19, 2017.", "annotation_id": "20882117", "url": "https://genius.com/20882117", "state": "pending", "votes": -5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Can’t Be Saved", "line": "When you givin’ attention, you killin’ yourself Stop respondin’, play the hand that you dealt", "vault_lines": ["Stop respondin', play the hand that you dealt"], "meaning": "Here he is referring to the videos Jania made in response to all the allegations made about her being in an abusive relationship with Nba Youngboy. He’s telling her to not pay attention to the media and that she shouldn’t need to clear anything up.", "annotation_id": "15527275", "url": "https://genius.com/15527275", "state": "pending", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
