{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Carry On", "line": "So she run into the blogs for money and a name", "vault_lines": ["I'm that nigga so she run into the blogs for money and a name (Name)"], "meaning": "NBA YoungBoy is probably talking about his baby mother Jania Meshell", "annotation_id": "34236929", "url": "https://genius.com/34236929", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Carry On", "line": "They killed my cousin, never thought that he would die", "vault_lines": ["They killed my cousin, never thought that he would die (Die)"], "meaning": "YB is referring to his cousin Boozilla🕊(full name Keondrae Ricks) who was murdered on Nov. 2, 2016, in South Baton Rouge. Hours later, YB, NBA Big B, Ben 10 and Joe retaliated by shooting at two men in South BR. He was later arrested at a show in Houston, TX, on Nov. 28, 2016.", "annotation_id": "32312475", "url": "https://genius.com/32312475", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Carry On", "line": "She don’t want KJ to come", "vault_lines": ["She don't want KJ to come, but then she try to FaceTime him with me"], "meaning": "this refers as if Floyd Mayweather Daughter Money YaYa didn’t want Kentrell Gaulden Jr to come over to YoungBoy’s house unless she came with him", "annotation_id": "31428180", "url": "https://genius.com/31428180", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
