{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Change", "line": "And I fuckin’ hate myself (Myself) And all of these choices I have to make (Yeah) And I don’t want no one else (No one else) But I have to be all alone for the change And I don’t want to hurt myself (Myself) But I have to make up my wrong for the change (Yeah) I swear I don’t want no one else (No one else) But I have to change for the heal of my pain", "vault_lines": ["I swear I don't want no one else (No one else)", "But I have to change for the heal of my pain"], "meaning": "YoungBoy frequently recalls to his past decisions and actions in songs. He has recently been contemplating suicide, which has stirred a lot of media attention towards him. YoungBoy saying that he doesn’t want to hurt himself may be way of showing that he doesn’t want to commit suicide, but at the same time he wants to clear himself of his dark and troubled past.", "annotation_id": "15291958", "url": "https://genius.com/15291958", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
