{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Clear", "line": "I might Wrangler the Jeep", "vault_lines": ["I might Wrangler the Jeep, take Maybach to the store"], "meaning": "“And my Wrangler is cheap”\n\n“I might [?] this G”\n\n“I’m a [?]”\n\nSounds like he says “Wrangler” which is a Jeep car, could make sense since it’s followed by “take Maybach to the store” which could mean that he brings back his car and basically exchanges it for a Jeep Wrangler. Idk tho I’ve tried listened closely to this 1 second lyric for about 20 minutes.", "annotation_id": "27516316", "url": "https://genius.com/27516316", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
