{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dangerous Love", "line": "I’m tryna leave the streets, you see, this life ain’t right", "vault_lines": ["I'm tryna leave the streets, you see, this life ain't right"], "meaning": "This isnt the first time NBA Youngboy has said he doesn’t want to be in the streets anymore. In the song 7 Days on the previous album The Last Slimeto, he states how he has been trying to calm down but he cant. Here he is saying the same, stating he knows it isnt the good thing to do but he is unable to.", "annotation_id": "28835563", "url": "https://genius.com/28835563", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dangerous Love", "line": "From Nawfside to livin’ large", "vault_lines": ["What you gon' do, eat or starve? From Nawfside to livin' large"], "meaning": "Youngboy is saying he has came a very long way, from living in the trenches fighting for his life and now living in wealth with everything he ever wanted.", "annotation_id": "28835553", "url": "https://genius.com/28835553", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
