{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dead Trollz", "line": "Wan’ get up with me, but I don’t fuck with you", "vault_lines": ["Wan' get up with me, but I don't fuck with you"], "meaning": "YB is talking to King Von and Jaydayoungan. Von was a fan of YB, footage of him rapping songs. Soon Von started trolling and dissing YB saying he has cap in his raps. YB responded with this song saying how he doesn’t even mess with Von. Jaydayoungan put his self on 1 of YB songs in which YB commented under and said take the post down bc he doesn’t even know how he got his song.", "annotation_id": "38042504", "url": "https://genius.com/38042504", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dead Trollz", "line": "Pussy nigga drove that he can’t get no feature", "vault_lines": ["Pussy nigga drove that he can't get no feature"], "meaning": "This was stated regarding King Von, who started throwing slick shots at YoungBoy, which is thought to be rooted in the fact that YoungBoy would not offer him a feature.", "annotation_id": "37949361", "url": "https://genius.com/37949361", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
