{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dead Trollz", "line": "Real dead man out in Valley Park, call them range killers", "vault_lines": ["Real dеad man out in Valley Park, call them range killers"], "meaning": "Valley Park is NBA Dump’s neighborhood.", "annotation_id": "29415255", "url": "https://genius.com/29415255", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dead Trollz", "line": "D-Rose, he way from the Bulls home", "vault_lines": ["D-Rose, he way from the Bulls home"], "meaning": "Derrick Rose or D-Rose for short, is a basketball player who got drafted to the Chicago Bulls and played with them from 2008-2016. Rose himself grew up in the Englewood area of a Chicago. This is a subtle diss to either Chicago rappers Lil Durk or King Von or both. When they both got famous, they decided to move to Atlanta to stay out of trouble in Chicago. So when YB says “He’s way from the Bulls home”, he’s pretty much saying both Durk and Von are out of their hometown and the area that they are used too.", "annotation_id": "28551643", "url": "https://genius.com/28551643", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dead Trollz", "line": "Plan on stainin’ somethin’ in Atlanta too", "vault_lines": ["Plan on stainin' somethin' in Atlanta too"], "meaning": "While it hasn’t been confirmed, there’s speculation that Youngboy put a hit out on Lil Durk’s artist King Von as Von was having sexual relations with YB’s ex girlfriend and mother of his son Kacey, Jania Meshell.\n\nWhile Von is from Chicago, after he got put on to Durk’s label, he decided to move down to Atlanta and he was public about the decision which is why Youngboy says he plans on “staining something in Atlanta”.\n\nEerily enough, Von would be murdered in Atlanta by Lul Timm, a friend of Youngboy’s artist Quando Rondo, just two months after the release of this album.\n\nHowever he could be dissing his long time (now ex) rival Fredo Bang as he frequently comes to Atlanta to record music as Atlanta is considered the pinnacle of music. Same thing with his other rival JayDaYoungan who came to Atlanta for the same reasons or even Foolio because again, Foolio came to Atlanta for the same reasons.", "annotation_id": "28056703", "url": "https://genius.com/28056703", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dead Trollz", "line": "I got a gift for you, Lil Top Claus (Baow-baow-baow), nigga, ho-ho", "vault_lines": ["I got a gift for you, Lil Top Claus (Baow-baow-baow), nigga, ho-ho"], "meaning": "It wordplay, yb call himself Santa claus just like Santa laugh “ho ho” yb call his opps hoes hoes", "annotation_id": "25706410", "url": "https://genius.com/25706410", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dead Trollz", "line": "Take your shit, I’m keepin’ that, niggas know I’m SooWoo", "vault_lines": ["Take your shit, I'm keepin' that, niggas know I'm SooWoo"], "meaning": "“SooWoo” is a word used by the Bloods (Bloodgang) for greeting each other.\n\nAllthough it is unclear if YB is actually a blood, he does have some lines verifying this question.\n-> (edit) He is a real blood, in his recent song “I Hate YoungBoy” he says:\n\nI’m a real blood and I’m screaming blatt!\n\nAt the end of his song “I-10” he said Blood gang or no gang, UBN or UB Out. He also says he is “throwing b’s”, which is another indication that he is a blood.", "annotation_id": "20927656", "url": "https://genius.com/20927656", "state": "pending", "votes": 23, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dead Trollz", "line": "I’m still sellin’ bar like I ain’t got no money", "vault_lines": ["Known disses and a nigga know I'm still sellin' bar like I ain't got no money"], "meaning": "“Bar” can mean two things in this case.\n\nBar is slang mostly for xanax bars, but also other prescription pills such as oxycontin, adderall and codeine pills.\n\nIt also refers to rap lines, called bars. Meaning YB is selling bars (verses) as well as prescription pills.", "annotation_id": "20927637", "url": "https://genius.com/20927637", "state": "pending", "votes": 28, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
