{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dear Dump", "line": "When we caught the lil’ bitch, shot him all in his neck Tried to hit in his head, they ain’t bringin’ him back I was slingin’ that fire Had a shootout with them niggas, the ones from ’cross of the track (Track) I’m loaded now, thinkin’ ’bout how real it is", "vault_lines": ["When we caught the lil' bitch, shot him all in his neck", "Tried to hit in his head, they ain't bringin' him back", "I was slingin' that fire", "Had a shootout with them niggas, the ones from 'cross of the track (Track)", "I'm loaded now, thinkin' 'bout how real it is"], "meaning": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again appears to be reflecting on a past drive-by shooting incident he was involved in back in November 2016. According to the report, YoungBoy was the shooter out of the three passengers in the vehicle and allegedly shot the driver of the opposing car in the neck, which caused them to crash, fleeing the scene.\n\nYoungBoy Never Broke Again was charged with two counts of attempted second-degree murder, along with a $200,000 bond. On December 7, 2016, he was free of charge until further investigation.", "annotation_id": "30227792", "url": "https://genius.com/30227792", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dear Dump", "line": "I had left When you died, I was on my way home", "vault_lines": ["When you died, I was on my way home"], "meaning": "Yb was out of town the day  big dump died", "annotation_id": "29699857", "url": "https://genius.com/29699857", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
