{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dear Dump", "line": "And that nigga did that to you It’s all good, we bust his head ’bout it (Talk to ’em)", "vault_lines": ["And that nigga did that to you", "It's all good, we bust his head 'bout it (Talk to 'em)"], "meaning": "The “nigga” Youngboy refers to is TBG rapper Blvd Quick. Blvd Quick is rumored to have been connected to the murder of Youngboy agent Big Dump. Youngboy is saying he slid for his partner.\n\n\n\nNBA Youngboy and Big Dump in 2018.", "annotation_id": "29651091", "url": "https://genius.com/29651091", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dear Dump", "status": "done", "targets": 4, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Youngboy-never-broke-again-dear-dump-lyrics", "genius_title": "Dear Dump", "genius_id": 7131684, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Death Enclaimed", "line": "Left her ring through the night My heart wouldn’t act right Trying to explain so she can leave Fucking with these bitches, tryna run you far from me", "vault_lines": ["My heart wouldn't act right", "Trying to explain so she can leave", "Fucking with these bitches, tryna run you far from me"], "meaning": "His ex-fiancee Iyanna Mayweather left him in May 2020. These lines suggest the reason for this was because he pushed her away with his cheating.", "annotation_id": "39969011", "url": "https://genius.com/39969011", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
