{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dirty Thug", "line": "Seen it wasn’t no angel in that girl, I lost my lust I don’t give no fuck about that field, I lost my girl", "vault_lines": ["Seen it wasn't no angel in that girl, I lost my lust", "I don't give no fuck about that field, I lost my girl"], "meaning": "Here NBA YoungBoy reflects on how he has now seen that the person he is with is not as perfect as he thought, because at the end of the day no one is perfect and she is not an angel.\n\nThis may be one of the reasons why YoungBoy says he has lost his “lust” , because he finds it hard to go around searching for a person he can consider perfect or “angel”.\n\nThat is just how it is, we are all searching for the right and perfect one, which is very hard to find.", "annotation_id": "28618161", "url": "https://genius.com/28618161", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
