{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dis & That", "line": "Man, tell that YouTuber or streamer whatever he is, “Stop playing wit’ me, bitch” (Stop playing wit’ me, bitch) You niggas ain’t layin’ like that, know them gunners layin’ wit’ me, bitch I ain’t got no Instagram, no social media, I wasn’t talkin’ to your bitch Old ugly ass bitch, you disgusting, man, y’all niggas make me sick", "vault_lines": ["Man, tell that YouTuber or streamer whatever he is, \"Stop playing wit' me, bitch\" (Stop playing wit' me, bitch)", "You niggas ain't layin' like that, know them gunners layin' wit' me, bitch", "I ain't got no Instagram, no social media, I wasn't talkin' to your bitch", "Old ugly ass bitch, you disgusting, man, y'all niggas make me sick"], "meaning": "This is a diss at Twitch streamer / YouTuber Adin Ross.\n\nAdin Ross was upset that NBA Youngboy liked his girlfriend’s  Instagram post with his burner  account. After that, Adin Ross was seen on an Instagram live with one of Youngboy’s baby Mamas, Jania Meshell.\n\nYoungboy is saying that he doesn’t use Instagram nor Social Media so he didn’t even like the post, aswell as threatening Adin not mess with him or there will be violent consequences  hence , ‘know them gunners layin wit me bitch’\n\nhttps://youtu.be/-rHfb5Q2VSE", "annotation_id": "24673225", "url": "https://genius.com/24673225", "state": "pending", "votes": 44, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
