{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Don’t Care (Almost Free)", "line": "They can say that I’m broke, they can say I’m a killer They can say I’m a cheater and a woman beater", "vault_lines": ["They can say that I'm broke, they can say I'm a killer", "They can say I'm a cheater and a woman beater"], "meaning": "Just as in his song, “I Am Who They Say I Am' just explains that anyone can say who he is and the person he claims to be, but in reality, they can talk all they want even though they don’t even know the real him, until they talk to him and know him personally.\n\nSame idea here, they can say anything what people spread rumours about him and claim what to do.", "annotation_id": "39428992", "url": "https://genius.com/39428992", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
