{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Don’t Rate Me", "line": "Upgraded all my hollows to them blue tips (Suu)", "vault_lines": ["Upgraded all my hollows to them blue tips (Suu)"], "meaning": "In this line Quavo refers to two kinds of bullets: hollow-points (rounds which expand on impact) and blue tips, which in U.S. military color-coding would indicate an incendiary round. However, Quavo could also be referring to a variant on the regular hollow-point munition which replaces the usual tip with a distinctive blue polymer tip.\n\n\n\nIt’s not clear which munition type Quavo refers to, but the “upgrade” is indicative of an increase in his wealth.", "annotation_id": "26440906", "url": "https://genius.com/26440906", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
