{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Double My Cup", "line": "Workin’ so hard and I cannot pretend to the feedback", "vault_lines": ["Workin’ so hard and I cannot pretend to the feedback"], "meaning": "He’s too focused to really act like he can’t say anything about the feedback, or he’s tired where the feedback doesn’t matter because it’s not what he wants. It can also mean that he worked so hard that the feedback doesn’t match what he really wants to hear.", "annotation_id": "39267905", "url": "https://genius.com/39267905", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
