{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Double My Cup", "line": "They gon’ go off emotion, I say I forgive ‘em ‘Cause I really feel they don’t mean that", "vault_lines": ["They gon’ go off emotion, I say I forgive ‘em", "‘Cause I really feel they don’t mean that"], "meaning": "its like if your friend screams at you cause they’re mad and its something just disrespectful, like damn, thats what you think of me? at the same time they might be a empath where they feel like they didn’t mean to say that to you, so YoungBoy’s still got a good heart to think they didn’t really mean it, giving them a second chance.", "annotation_id": "39267829", "url": "https://genius.com/39267829", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Double My Cup", "line": "Drivin’, finna wreck, I’m reminiscin’ Thinkin’ about all the times she was different All real intentions, all real intentions, all real intentions", "vault_lines": ["Drivin’, finna wreck, I’m reminiscin’", "Thinkin’ about all the times she was different", "All real intentions, all real intentions, all real intentions"], "meaning": "He’s not focused on driving but thinking about the girl who, how she was different and unique from any other girls. This just how you do risky stuff after you lose a close one and it could affect your life, be careful and safe out there man.", "annotation_id": "39267816", "url": "https://genius.com/39267816", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Double My Cup", "line": "Makin’ choices off my feeling’ (Emotions)", "vault_lines": ["Makin’ choices off my feeling’ (Emotions)"], "meaning": "You do something based how you feeling atm, if you got to work on some project, you do it if you feel happy and motivated, if you feel sad, upset, you might not even wanna do it.\n\nTip: Be careful and aware of how you make choices in life with this, it can probably fuck it up in the long run, so double think it and to be sure, shit, even think it third.", "annotation_id": "39267807", "url": "https://genius.com/39267807", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
