{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Down Chick", "line": "I walked in with 2K, we on that three shit", "vault_lines": ["I walked in with 2K, we on that three shit (On that three shit, yeah)"], "meaning": "YoungBoy says he walked in with 2k (2 thousand dollars). But this also references video game NBA 2K, because “three shit” references a 3 pointer. NBA\n2K may also be a reference his mantra, NBA Youngboy. He is also rapping with 3Three.", "annotation_id": "38595263", "url": "https://genius.com/38595263", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Down Chick", "line": "I’m fresh as hell, I got on all this Supreme shit", "vault_lines": ["I'm fresh as hell, I got on all this Supreme shit (Supreme, Supreme)"], "meaning": "Supreme is an American streetwear brand that was founded in in April 1994.\n\n\n\nSupreme is also known for having expensive items, which in this line YoungBoy is referring to himself as fresh with this expensive brand.", "annotation_id": "19478278", "url": "https://genius.com/19478278", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
