{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Drawing Symbols", "line": "He say he cannot trust a girl, he got no love for his momma And he got used while he was up, he feel he back at the bottom", "vault_lines": ["He say he cannot trust a girl, he got no love for his momma", "And he got used while he was up, he feel he back at the bottom"], "meaning": "In these lines, Youngboy is telling the audience more about this boy, “he”, who is really himself. He is saying that “he” cannot trust a girl due to emotional wounds, stemming from his painful relationship with his mom.\n\nYoungboy is also talking about the relationship struggles and trials that go with making it to the top. While he was up there, the people around him used him, enough so that he would have to fall back to where he came from but its just how he feels inside.", "annotation_id": "36204353", "url": "https://genius.com/36204353", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Drawing Symbols", "line": "They say go get that out his hand, he on the porch with a choppa They say he took like seven Xans, he say it’s helpin’ his problems", "vault_lines": ["They say go get that out his hand, he on the porch with a choppa", "They say he took like seven Xans, he say it's helpin' his problems"], "meaning": "Here Youngboy is displaying a situation where “he”, which is really a reflection and reference to himself, is on the porch of his house paranoid of an attack and has an assault rifle (maybe Ak-47) in his hand. On top of that, he has took several Xanax pills and hopes that they alleviate his mental affliction even though people are talking about him popping pills and getting high.", "annotation_id": "36204337", "url": "https://genius.com/36204337", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Drawing Symbols", "line": "I say I’m drawin’ symbols in the sand ’til my pain gone, baby", "vault_lines": ["I say I'm drawin' symbols in the sand 'til my pain gone, baby"], "meaning": "Quite simple but went over my head the first time. Youngboy often talks about “He, Him, The boy” etc in his songs, referring to an image of a broken, lonely child in a system designed to keep people stuck at the bottom. Here, this is one of the first songs where he explains that “He” refers to himself and all the things he hears about him from “They” as he says in the song is his thoughts getting to him and him not having anyone to go to run to.", "annotation_id": "35913953", "url": "https://genius.com/35913953", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Drawing Symbols", "line": "He had a shootout in the south, his friend got hit with that heat", "vault_lines": ["He had a shootout in the south, his friend got hit with that heat"], "meaning": "YB is likely referring to the November 2016 drive-by shooting he was involved in. He and friends shot at some people in Da Bottom of South Baton Rouge. It’s been said it was retaliation for the murder of YB’s cousin BBG Boozilla that occured hours earlier.", "annotation_id": "33890046", "url": "https://genius.com/33890046", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Drawing Symbols", "line": "They say his misstress walked in on him, he was playin’ with some fire", "vault_lines": ["They say his misstress walked in on him, he was playin' with some fire"], "meaning": "In this song Youngboy is talking about himself. His misstress or girlfriend walked in on him and he was messing around or “playing” with “some fire” (referencing a firearm) likely due to experiencing suicidal ideation.", "annotation_id": "31093880", "url": "https://genius.com/31093880", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
