{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Drawing Symbols", "line": "They say that girl not on his side because he gave her herpes", "vault_lines": ["They say that girl not on his side because he gave her herpes"], "meaning": "NBA Youngboy has said in multiple songs that he has the STD herpes. In his song can’t be saved he said “Herpes in my blood and that shit got me crying” his girlfriend came out and said she had it too. He is saying this is what people say about him, that she isn’t on his side because he gave her herpes.", "annotation_id": "21032133", "url": "https://genius.com/21032133", "state": "pending", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Drawing Symbols", "line": "He got one tatted by his eye, it symbolizes Nene", "vault_lines": ["He got one tatted by his eye, it symbolizes Nene"], "meaning": "Nene is YoungBoy’s nickname for his girlfriend Jania. Back in February of 2018, YoungBoy and his girlfriend Jania got matching tattoos over their eyebrows. YoungBoy’s reads Jania, while Jania’s reads Kentrell.", "annotation_id": "15217088", "url": "https://genius.com/15217088", "state": "accepted", "votes": 44, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
