{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dream", "line": "[Chorus]", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "In this song youngboy never broke again mentions in the chorus of the song that he had to make money in case there was ever a time he would “end up on a t,” which means getting shot.  people can either win or lose when they’re trying to make money from the streets and youngboy had the dream and strength to win. He also mentions that many people are trying to shoot at him to try and bring him down, yet youngboy doesn’t care and will do his best to defend himself.", "annotation_id": "28783799", "url": "https://genius.com/28783799", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dream", "line": "Shoutout to that lil’ nigga got hit up at 16 It’s a shame, he ain’t get to live his dream", "vault_lines": ["It's a shame, he ain't get to live his dream"], "meaning": "Youngboy is referring to one of the people he knew when he was younger that got killed. Youngboy is saying how much of a shame it is that he wasn’t able to record any music and chase after his dream of being a rapper.", "annotation_id": "28783785", "url": "https://genius.com/28783785", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dream", "line": "You can win or lose when you thuggin’ in these streets", "vault_lines": ["You can win or lose when you thuggin' in these streets"], "meaning": "Being in the streets is like gambling, you can either make it or lose, where lose can mean getting killed or getting jail.\n\nThe thug life does not often end well, even if you are succesful. It becomes an addiction, like gambling, and in the end you always lose. By leaving the streets you get a chance to feel real success, like YoungBoy and many other rappers did.", "annotation_id": "25820853", "url": "https://genius.com/25820853", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Dream", "line": "Gotta get that moolah ’fore you end up on a T", "vault_lines": ["Gotta get that moolah 'fore you end up on a T"], "meaning": "Moolah means money, you gotta be succesful before you get put on a T-shirt, which happens when you die.", "annotation_id": "25820838", "url": "https://genius.com/25820838", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
