{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Drug Addiction", "line": "Rep where I’m from, I’m a 38 Baby", "vault_lines": ["Rep where I'm from, I'm a 38 Baby"], "meaning": "“38” stands for the street that YoungBoy was raised: 38 Chippewa Street in Baton Rouge. In addition to this, 38 Baby 2 is the name of YoungBoy’s previous album before Top.", "annotation_id": "20843908", "url": "https://genius.com/20843908", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Drug Addiction", "line": "Never give up, try again like Plankton", "vault_lines": ["Never give up, try again like Plankton"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is referring to Plankton who is a character from the cartoon SpongeBob SquarePants.\n\n\n\nPlankton’s main goal in the show is to obtain the\nKrabby Patty Secret Formula from his restaurant competitor across the street known as the Krusty Krab.\nThroughout the show, Plankton has made many frivolous attempts to steal the Krabby Patty Secret Formula. Even though he has failed every attempt, he never gives up.", "annotation_id": "20793149", "url": "https://genius.com/20793149", "state": "accepted", "votes": 52, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
