{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "FREEDDAWG", "line": "Can’t come how I’m comin’, I was a youngin when they tried that shit", "vault_lines": ["Can't come how I'm comin', I was a youngin when they tried that shit"], "meaning": "Here NBA Youngboy is talking about how he was young when his opps started messing with him. This is most likely true as Youngboy has gotten into lots of legal trouble as little as age 12.", "annotation_id": "28765438", "url": "https://genius.com/28765438", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
