{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "FWYT", "line": "I’m tryna see what’s under your clothes, like my Tahoe, I’m liftin’ up the hood", "vault_lines": ["I'm tryna see what's under your clothes, like my Tahoe, I'm liftin' up the hood"], "meaning": "That’s a slick double meaning: “lift the hood” is car talk, but he’s really talkin’ about undressing her. The Tahoe line keeps the car theme running while he makes it sexual.", "annotation_id": "38379052", "url": "https://genius.com/38379052", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "FWYT", "line": "Got dope all in my Levi’s", "vault_lines": ["Got dope all in my Levi's"], "meaning": "He’s literally carryin’ drugs in his jeans. It keeps the verse grounded in that “still in the street mindset” even while he’s flexin’.", "annotation_id": "38379043", "url": "https://genius.com/38379043", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
