{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "FWYT", "line": "Fuckin’ with lil’ whatchamacallit I fucked her with no whatchamacallit (What?) Called me and she told me she whatchamacallit, hold on I told that bitch go do that whatchamacallit", "vault_lines": ["I fucked her with no whatchamacallit (What?)", "Called me and she told me she whatchamacallit, hold on", "I told that bitch go do that whatchamacallit"], "meaning": "He was messing with an unknown girl (possibly Mellow Rackz as she disappeared and popped back up recently in the music video for Resume – another song off slime cry.), and he did it without a condom, she then called and told him she was pregnant with a baby, in which he responds by telling her to get an abortion.", "annotation_id": "38324910", "url": "https://genius.com/38324910", "state": "pending", "votes": -4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "FWYT", "line": "Rollin’ off them whatchamacallits", "vault_lines": ["Rollin' off them whatchamacallits"], "meaning": "He was rollin off drugs, other drugs he mentions in this album frequently is Molly, perhaps this is the drug he was referring to in this line.", "annotation_id": "38324908", "url": "https://genius.com/38324908", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
