{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Factor", "line": "I told that bitch that I’m a trapper, factor, no actor (That I’m a trapper, no actor) I count my money backwards I count my money faster", "vault_lines": ["I told that bitch that I'm a trapper, factor, no actor (That I'm a trapper, no actor)", "I count my money backwards", "I count my money faster"], "meaning": "His twist on his inspiration, Lil Phat’s, lyrics\n\n“I like to count my money backwards, it’s faster\nI’m not a rapper, I’m a trapper, no actor.”", "annotation_id": "38346127", "url": "https://genius.com/38346127", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Factor", "line": "I told her I’m a factor (Factor) I said, “I count my money backwards” (Hey) I chase money fast, I chase that money bad, every day (Oh) I ain’t come in with no bag, I can’t lay (She want me to see her)", "vault_lines": ["I ain't come in with no bag, I can't lay (She want me to see her)"], "meaning": "His twist on his inspiration, Lil Phat’s, lyrics\n\n“I like to count my money backwards, it’s faster\nI’m not a rapper, I’m a trapper, no actor\nWe weighed her up, and, then, we wrap her, go ask her\nAnd, watch, we move her, like Casper, it’s Mr.”", "annotation_id": "38346093", "url": "https://genius.com/38346093", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
