{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fish Scale", "line": "I’m in Atlanta, a hundred somethin’ sticks on a nigga, they know not to run up on me Spotted him, I sent a pic to that nigga to show him I’m only lettin’ him breathe (Breathe)", "vault_lines": ["I'm in Atlanta, a hundred somethin' sticks on a nigga, they know not to run up on me", "Spotted him, I sent a pic to that nigga to show him I'm only lettin' him breathe (Breathe)"], "meaning": "This is a two-way diss\n\nFirst this a clear shot at Otf because he states “im in Atlanta hundred some stick on a Nigga they know not to run up on me” because of king von run up on quando and lost his life by a gun , meaning every knows when someone run up on a 4kt member they gone die like last time so people gone think twice\n\nSecond this a diss to someone who be in atl on dead trolls he rap “I got pictures of you lil pussy bitch so im staining some in Atlanta too”so that’s why he raps spotted him and sent him a pic. it’s tricky but clever first line about king von and the second line only works with the first line because he mentions Atlanta.\n\nby the way he always do this when he dissing he diss two people at once in makes it hard to understand if you not the one he’s dissing very talented", "annotation_id": "24967590", "url": "https://genius.com/24967590", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fish Scale", "line": "Hole in his head, tryna see all his brain He gon’ blatt, bah, bah if you think ‘bout playin’ games Bought a cutter on my hand that we wrapped in whole things Still got gray just like the road for to blow your nose and veins, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Hole in his head, tryna see all his brain", "He gon' blatt, bah, bah if you think 'bout playin' games", "Bought a cutter on my hand that we wrapped in whole things", "Still got gray just like the road for to blow your nose and veins, yeah"], "meaning": "This Pre-Chorus has a similar flow to Future’s 2nd verse on the Super Slimey opening track w/ Young Thug “No Cap”\nWhen Future raps “My little brother keep a stick on the seat\nHe gone brrrt, brrrt, brrrt ‘til your heart stop beating\nI’m a Zone 6 n**** and I’m riding in a foreign\nFuck a bad yellow bitch anytime I get bored” I see similarities between that opener and this pre-chorus", "annotation_id": "24884077", "url": "https://genius.com/24884077", "state": "pending", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
