{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Foolish Figure", "line": "You gotta carry on and don’t fail They know that I get it on by myself", "vault_lines": ["They know that I get it on by myself"], "meaning": "YoungBoy often meets obstacles that makes it harder for him. He always move on no matter what happens.\nHe also dont have very much help, a big part of the media inside hip-hop is against him for several reasons. He’s outside of the industry and does everything by himself and with the few people he works with.", "annotation_id": "24901209", "url": "https://genius.com/24901209", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Foolish Figure", "line": "Just got a family, I ain’t curve her She know just hit me if you need me, I ain’t never left", "vault_lines": ["Just got a family, I ain't curve her", "She know just hit me if you need me, I ain't never left"], "meaning": "This is also about Yaya. He’s letting her know that he didn’t turn her down, he just has a family now (his girlfriend Jazz and daughter Love). He also lets it be known that if Yaya needs him, he’s there!", "annotation_id": "24853863", "url": "https://genius.com/24853863", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
