{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Footstep", "line": "Just like WWE, I walk ’round with that masterpiece", "vault_lines": ["Just like WWE, I walk 'round with that masterpiece"], "meaning": "Wordplay with double entendre\n\nChris masters is wwe wrestler his nickname was the “”masterpiece”\n\n masterpiece is also a gun brand (masterpiece arms)", "annotation_id": "24665042", "url": "https://genius.com/24665042", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Footstep", "line": "Money on my head so I be walking with my gat on me", "vault_lines": ["Money on my head so I be walking with my gat on me"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is stating how he has a bounty on his head so he has to walk around with his “gat” AKA a gun.", "annotation_id": "24119547", "url": "https://genius.com/24119547", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Footstep", "line": "Top back in New York, hoodie on just like I’m Highbridge (Highbridge)", "vault_lines": ["Top back in New York, hoodie on just like I'm Highbridge (Highbridge)"], "meaning": "Here, YoungBoy Never Broke Again refers to the chart-topping, Highbridge, New York native A Boogie wit da Hoodie, one of the most distinguished rappers from New York.\n\nBoth YoungBoy and A Boogie have collaborated with each other several times — on September 8, 2017, YoungBoy appeared on A Boogie’s “Beast Mode” alongside PnB Rock. Just a month following the duo’s first collaboration, on October 26, 2017, A Boogie appeared on YoungBoy’s, “GG (Remix),” a remix of YoungBoy’s August 2017, “GG.”\n\nFurthermore, on September 26, 2019, on YoungBoy’s “House Arrest Tingz,” YB rapped a similar lyric:\n\nTired of the bayou, I wan' take it out to New York\nAnd live a high life like a nigga signed with Highbridge\n\n\n\nPictured: YoungBoy Never Broke Again and A Boogie wit da Hoodie in the “GG (Remix)” music video", "annotation_id": "24059929", "url": "https://genius.com/24059929", "state": "accepted", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
