{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "For You", "line": "Got no lighter in your cell, I could show you how to create fuel", "vault_lines": ["Got no lighter in your cell, I could show you how to create fuel"], "meaning": "There’s many methods of making fire in jail.\n\nBatteries and foil to make a lighter type conductor or using a socket and a pencil or other items to make the stinger, then you use toilet paper to catch the fire and use either to burn ink or smoke something.", "annotation_id": "38343139", "url": "https://genius.com/38343139", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "For You", "line": "Cobain, you know I smoke the cig", "vault_lines": ["Cobain, you know I smoke the cig"], "meaning": "Kurt Cobain killed himself with a gun to the head and since Young Boy smokes cigarettes he’s saying he takes cigarettes to the head like Cobain", "annotation_id": "38343073", "url": "https://genius.com/38343073", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "For You", "line": "Had more head than Jonathan Wigs", "vault_lines": ["Had more head than Jonathan Wigs"], "meaning": "It sounds like he said “had more head than Johnny did wigs”\n\nWhich is a reference either to the Johnny style of hair which men use as a popular style of wigs or Johnny Depp using so many wigs in his acting career like Pirates of Caribbean, Blow, Willy Wonka.\n\nBut it could also be a reference to iam_jonathan_ on Instagram a celebrity stylist.", "annotation_id": "38333347", "url": "https://genius.com/38333347", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "For You", "line": "Baby, SuWoop", "vault_lines": ["I like red and she like blue, I say, \"Baby, SuWoop\""], "meaning": "SuWoo comes from the slang of the Bloods. It’s basically a war cry or shout used among members to show loyalty or affiliation", "annotation_id": "38317477", "url": "https://genius.com/38317477", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
