{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "For a Reason", "line": "And everything happen, a blessing man I notice that", "vault_lines": ["And everything happen a blessing man I notice that"], "meaning": "This just shows how to be grateful.\nEverything in life that happens to us, can teach us a lot in life, and to thank for it to bring a vision we never ever saw and how it can help us in life.", "annotation_id": "38767970", "url": "https://genius.com/38767970", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
