{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Forgiato", "line": "Free Lil Ten", "vault_lines": ["Okay, pop a ten, free Lil Ten, killin'"], "meaning": "Here, YB talks about NBA Ben 10 aka Ten aka Lil Ten who is a close friend of YB’s  and NBA affiliated.\n\nIn March 2020,YB dropped the music video of the song “Ten Talk” on YouTube, which is a reference to his friend and currently sits at more than 100m views. Also, on one of YB’s latest project “Richest Opp”, NBA Ben 10 is the only feature on the song “Chopstick”.", "annotation_id": "31981012", "url": "https://genius.com/31981012", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
