{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Forgiato", "line": "Reppin’ off of one body, Top got over seven gone Once that nigga add three, then I’m gon’ start counting on my toes", "vault_lines": ["Reppin' off of one body, Top got over seven gone", "Once that nigga add three, then I'm gon' start counting on my toes"], "meaning": "Top is saying he has more then 7 bodies and once you add 3 hes gonna start counting  on his toes. he clearly is a menace to society he knocked off at least 11 opps.", "annotation_id": "24219021", "url": "https://genius.com/24219021", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Forgiato", "line": "Reppin’ off of one body, Top got over seven gone Once that nigga add three, then I’m gon’ start counting on my toes", "vault_lines": ["Reppin' off of one body, Top got over seven gone", "Once that nigga add three, then I'm gon' start counting on my toes"], "meaning": "Youngboy wrote this song in the midst of a Call of Duty game with his friends, one of his peers kept blabbering on over a singular kill (again I cannot stress this enough, this is in the video game call of duty) whilst youngboy (aka top as he refers to himself in third person) had been racking up the kills, accumulating a grand total of 7 with no intentions of stopping. He states once he adds three he will run out of fingers to keep track of his (entirely fictional and in game) kills and will have to resort to toes to count.", "annotation_id": "24027210", "url": "https://genius.com/24027210", "state": "pending", "votes": 21, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
