{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Free Dem 5's", "line": "I’m holdin’ my own, they callin’ my phone, I’m hittin’ decline I’m on top of they neck, I’m pressure, they cannot recline", "vault_lines": ["I'm on top of they neck, I'm pressure, they cannot recline"], "meaning": "Yb is very Known for doing numbers with no promo holding his self down No help needed and just like Dj ak said a lot of rappers was hitting Ak up to work with Yb but yb not answering they calls Yb outshine these lil puppies when he drops making it that others can’t relax when they drop", "annotation_id": "26441491", "url": "https://genius.com/26441491", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
