{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Free Dem 5's", "line": "38 baby, duckin’ murder cases Pallbearer, keep a mask like Jason .223 and it hold the casings", "vault_lines": ["38 baby, duckin' murder cases", "Pallbearer, keep a mask like Jason", ".223 and it hold the casings"], "meaning": "Murder case will go cold with out any credible evidence a mask is no face no case and a .223 that hold casings is a shell catcher. if the shooter hide his identity with a mask and no shells casing is left behind what lead can detectives start with?", "annotation_id": "26441426", "url": "https://genius.com/26441426", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
