{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Free Meechy", "line": "Murder until we get even That’s on God, got my bitch behind me Plenty sticks inside this car, I pray the law don’t get behind me Gon’ send me straight to Rikers Island Said, lil’ bitch, I’m ’bout it You ain’t kill shit, you ain’t whack nothin’, know we got plenty bodies", "vault_lines": ["That's on God, got my bitch behind me", "Plenty sticks inside this car, I pray the law don't get behind me"], "meaning": "Rikers Island is an island in the East River of New York. The island is home to the infamous Rikers Island jail complex which houses medium to maximum-security prisoners due to the severity of their crimes.\n\nYoungBoy notes that due to the horrific magnitude of his crimes — which considers several murders — he will be sent to Rikers Island due to its extremely high violence rates, resulting in several dead prisoners.\n\n\n\nPictured: The Rikers Island jail in the East River\n\nIn November 2020, on the surprise “Whitey Bulger,” YoungBoy rapped a similar lyric regarding the notorious Alcatraz Federal Penitentiary:\n\nGravedigger, yeah, they know what it is\nThey gon' send me to that island for real", "annotation_id": "29348505", "url": "https://genius.com/29348505", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Free Meechy", "line": "Watch me swerve the Rolls Know I’m in this bitch right now, okay Chopper with a knife, get slayed Massacre, masquerade Rockstar motherfucker, make the crowd go up in a rage", "vault_lines": ["Watch me swerve the Rolls", "Know I'm in this bitch right now, okay", "Chopper with a knife, get slayed", "Rockstar motherfucker, make the crowd go up in a rage"], "meaning": "YoungBoy used a similar flow in Syracuse:\nTwenty-five minutes on stage (Yeah)\nGot the whole crowd in a rage (Top, top), bitch give me top\nMassacre pivot, masquerade\nWatch how I surf, I’m in a rave", "annotation_id": "28531330", "url": "https://genius.com/28531330", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Free Meechy", "line": "I’m on three R’s, call that Reese’s Pieces", "vault_lines": ["I'm on three R's, call that Reese's Pieces"], "meaning": "The line “I’m on three R’s, call that Reese’s Pieces” is a clever wordplay used by NBA YoungBoy in the song. It is a play on words referencing both the candy brand Reese’s Pieces and the three R’s.\n\nIn this context, the three R’s stand for “Revenge, Respect, and Riches.” These are common themes in NBA YoungBoy’s music, reflecting his desire to seek revenge on his enemies, earn respect in the rap industry, and accumulate wealth.\n\nBy comparing himself to Reese’s Pieces, a popular candy consisting of small, colorful, and peanut butter-filled chocolate candies, NBA YoungBoy cleverly conveys that he is “on” or focused on these three R’s, just like the individual pieces of the candy. It’s a creative way of expressing his dedication to his goals and ambitions.", "annotation_id": "28515291", "url": "https://genius.com/28515291", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Free Meechy", "status": "done", "targets": 3, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Youngboy-never-broke-again-free-meechy-lyrics", "genius_title": "Free Meechy", "genius_id": 7687401, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Free Sex", "line": "Since she takin’ my soul Now this bitch, she gotta go I’m a man, I need control Feelin’ like I’m dying slow And she don’t even seem to know", "vault_lines": ["Since she takin' my soul", "Now this bitch, she gotta go", "I'm a man, I need control", "Feelin' like I'm dying slow", "And she don't even seem to know"], "meaning": "In the bridge we see a change in tone from Youngboy, he explains a need for a change and a lack of control in his life . As females and drugs are draining him , and she doesn’t even notice he’s changing/ dying slow is exactly why he needs control , as she’s taking his soul (using him) and doesn’t care", "annotation_id": "30791823", "url": "https://genius.com/30791823", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Free Sex", "line": "K2", "vault_lines": ["This K2 got me started"], "meaning": "K2 or Spice is a mixture of herbs, spices or shredded plant material that is typically sprayed with synthetic compounds known as cannabinoids that are chemically similar to THC, the psychoactive ingredient in marijuana. Although these products are often marketed as “safe” alternatives to marijuana, they may affect the brain much more powerfully than marijuana. Their effects can be unpredictable and severe.", "annotation_id": "30163730", "url": "https://genius.com/30163730", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
