{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fresh Prince Of Utah", "line": "I put this ho inside the trunk, she tried to diss Big Dump bitch, yeah", "vault_lines": ["I put this ho inside the trunk, she tried to diss Big Dump bitch, yeah"], "meaning": "Big Dump is YoungBoy’s deceased friend who died in 2018 in a shooting. YoungBoy has mentioned Dump in many songs and even has a few dedicated to him such as\n\nRIP Dump\nhttps://genius.com/Youngboy-never-broke-again-rip-dump-lyrics, and\n\nLetter To Big Dump\n\nhttps://genius.com/Youngboy-never-broke-again-letter-to-big-dump-lyrics. In this line YoungBoy, threatens to stuff someone in a trunk for dissing his late friend.", "annotation_id": "29175027", "url": "https://genius.com/29175027", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fresh Prince Of Utah", "line": "Ten just got three hoes, and bottom back from Valero And FaceTime me on my phone, and let me watch while you take ’em down", "vault_lines": ["Ten just got three hoes, and bottom back from Valero", "And FaceTime me on my phone, and let me watch while you take 'em down"], "meaning": "Youngboy’s friend “ten” picked up three women from Valero gas station. He then facetimes Youngboy so Youngboy can watch him fuck the three women", "annotation_id": "28751125", "url": "https://genius.com/28751125", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
