{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Da Industry", "line": "Yeah, I got slimes that bang that fire, but still gon’ shoot for free", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, I got slimes that bang that fire, but still gon' shoot for free"], "meaning": "Yb saying he has some gunners that always charge to air it out but for him, they’ll waive the fee. Yb saying this to flex his power, the influence and how his name holds weight to the point gunners will kill and risk it all for him just because of loyalty. Bottom line Yb saying he’s the Don dada.", "annotation_id": "37492043", "url": "https://genius.com/37492043", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Da Industry", "line": "Yeah, he been killin’ shit, but still can’t fuck with me", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, he been killin' shit, but still can't fuck with me"], "meaning": "Yb saying Lil Durk been dropping good music but no where near as good as his music. Lil Durk got a name in the streets but no where near Yb’s name. Yb saying he’s bigger than Lil Durk in music and in the streets. Lil Durk can’t fuck with him.", "annotation_id": "37491912", "url": "https://genius.com/37491912", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Da Industry", "line": "Felon that still deal with copes, still gon’ send them fuckin’ hitters", "vault_lines": ["Felon that still deal with copes, still gon' send them fuckin' hitters"], "meaning": "Yb saying he’s a convicted felon that’s being watched and investigated by the law while he’s trying to cope with some very difficult personal stuff. He’s got a lot on his mind but it won’t stop him from sending them gunners to go handle business.", "annotation_id": "37491647", "url": "https://genius.com/37491647", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Da Industry", "line": "He say he don’t give a fuck about it, just give him the guap (Nah, for real)", "vault_lines": ["He say he don't give a fuck about it, just give him the guap (Nah, for real)"], "meaning": "Yb is saying he’s a hitman, and he’s not afraid to do a hit or go on a hit. No matter the difficulty, intensity and danger. The marked man/men can be outside the police station or in sight of cctv with many witnesses in broad daylight and Yb will not give a fuck about all of that. Getting paid is the only thing he gives a fuck about.\n\nHe may be talking about his shooter or talking about him as the shooter. Can not determine but it’s one of them.", "annotation_id": "37491276", "url": "https://genius.com/37491276", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
