{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Da Industry", "line": "Dior fit straight out the stores, still look like I’m out them trenches", "vault_lines": ["Dior fit straight out the stores, still look like I'm out them trenches"], "meaning": "This is just like the previous line. NBA Youngboy is saying he wears all this expensive stuff but still looks like he is from the trenches. He states that no matter what, he will always be a demon baby.", "annotation_id": "28835715", "url": "https://genius.com/28835715", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
