{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Da Industry", "line": "He wan’ be just like that nigga Yeezy, he want Rolls, huh? (He want Rolls)", "vault_lines": ["He wan' be just like that nigga Yeezy, he want Rolls, huh? (He want Rolls)"], "meaning": "This line refers to hip-hop artist Kanye West better known as Ye. Yeezy is his shoe brand founded by himself and established in 2009. Although Kanye owns a shoe company — he also has many hit singles on his hands, which has amassed him a fortune amount of money.\n\n\n\nPictured: Adidas Yeezy Boost 350 V2 Orange\n\nUltimately, NBA YoungBoy mentions an unnamed person who sees themselves purchasing a luxury vehicle  ─ specifically a Rolls Royce,  attempting to emulate Ye’s rich lifestyle.", "annotation_id": "26462974", "url": "https://genius.com/26462974", "state": "accepted", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Da Industry", "line": "He wan’ just be like his cousin Meechy, real fuckin’ slime", "vault_lines": ["He wan' just be like his cousin Meechy, real fuckin' slime"], "meaning": "Shout out to his cousin, Louisiana based artist & 4KT affiliate, NBA Meechy Baby.", "annotation_id": "26451908", "url": "https://genius.com/26451908", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
