{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Niggaz", "line": "In a Cutlass like my cousin with them straps inside that bitch, boy", "vault_lines": ["In a Cutlass like my cousin with them straps inside that bitch, boy"], "meaning": "YoungBoy references the track “Cutlass” by Meechy Baby, his cousin. A Cutlass is a classic car whose production lasted from 1961–1999.\n\n“Straps” is slang for guns. These lyrics also tie with his September 2020 arrest, where during the music video shooting for his 2020 track “Chopper City,” YoungBoy and his entourage were seen flexing their guns whiles riding in a Cutlass:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/azW_lMnst90?si=Vxof5tDAnZFHEPLN&t=59", "annotation_id": "30811362", "url": "https://genius.com/30811362", "state": "accepted", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
