{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck The Drugs", "line": "Audemars, stainless steel, in the place we lived was plenty tears", "vault_lines": ["Audemars, stainless steel, in the place we lived was plenty tears"], "meaning": "Audemar Piguet is a high value watched mentioned by many other rappers including youngboy.In this lyric youngboy says the place he used to live in they shed plenty tears and now he has a 60,000+ on his wrist.", "annotation_id": "37676909", "url": "https://genius.com/37676909", "state": "accepted", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck The Drugs", "line": "Fuck this drank, been havin’ a nigga tryna compromise the truth Fuck these pills, been havin’ a nigga wan’ pull up, put this pipe on you Fuck you and your maker, nigga, play ’round, spill this drank on you", "vault_lines": ["Fuck this drank, been havin' a nigga tryna compromise the truth", "Fuck these pills, been havin' a nigga wan' pull up, put this pipe on you", "Fuck you and your maker, nigga, play 'round, spill this drank on you"], "meaning": "Mental and emotional torment, likely from trauma and substance use. Frustration with the drugs, because while they numb him, they also make him dangerous. He feels close to breaking down or snapping and if someone plays with him, he might not hold back. This is him delving deeper into his rehabilitation trying to be a better man and etc", "annotation_id": "36366433", "url": "https://genius.com/36366433", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck The Drugs", "line": "Take off, you gon’ turn up that ho, she gon’ break out Takin’ off on you, you thought she was for you, and now, you look dumb", "vault_lines": ["Take off, you gon' turn up that ho, she gon' break out", "Takin' off on you, you thought she was for you, and now, you look dumb"], "meaning": "Talking to Kodak Black telling him he looks dumb because he really thought Mellow Racks was gonna be loyal to him and now he looks dumb because she’s with his opp NBA YoungBoy", "annotation_id": "36360553", "url": "https://genius.com/36360553", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
