{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Ya!", "line": "Fifty chains around my neck, makin’ sure my son ain’t goin’ through slavery, nigga", "vault_lines": ["Fifty chains around my neck, makin' sure my son ain't goin' through slavery, nigga"], "meaning": "Youngboy is stating that now that he has made it up out of the ghetto, he will make sure that his son lives a lavish life, not working till the day he dies.", "annotation_id": "29894336", "url": "https://genius.com/29894336", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
