{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Ya!", "line": "Watching Forensic Files all day tryna figure out how to get rid of ’em", "vault_lines": ["Watching Forensic Files all day tryna figure out how to get rid of 'em"], "meaning": "Youngboy never broke again states that he watches “Forensic Files” all day trying to figure out how to “get rid” of his enemies, meaning take their life without being caught. Forensic Files is a TV Series (1996–2011) created by Paul Dowling featuring detailed accounts on how notable crimes and diseases were solved through forensic science.", "annotation_id": "23220560", "url": "https://genius.com/23220560", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Ya!", "line": "When I’m shooting, just call me Vince", "vault_lines": ["When I'm shooting, just call me Vince"], "meaning": "He is referring to NBA legend Vince Carter who is mostly known for his dunking but actually was great shooter too.\nhttps://youtu.be/Fi8GdPohCN8?t=3", "annotation_id": "22770593", "url": "https://genius.com/22770593", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Ya!", "line": "Bitch, I’m gangster of the year, fuck you talkin’ ’bout?", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm gangster of the year, fuck you talkin' 'bout?"], "meaning": "Fredo Bang, an enemy of NBA Youngboy, has questioned his authenticity multiple times this year. Youngboy’s album and this line serves as a rebuttal.", "annotation_id": "21064847", "url": "https://genius.com/21064847", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Ya!", "line": "Tellin’ ’em I got hatred for somebody so much I should Emmett Till ’em", "vault_lines": ["Tellin' 'em I got hatred for somebody so much I should Emmett Till 'em"], "meaning": "Emmett Louis Till was a 14-year-old African American who was lynched in Mississippi in 1955, after being accused of offending a white woman in her family’s grocery store. They beat him up so bad that you couldn’t even recognize his face.", "annotation_id": "20959356", "url": "https://genius.com/20959356", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Fuck Ya!", "line": "In that Tesla like I’m Shawn Carter When I’m shooting, just call me Vince", "vault_lines": ["In that Tesla like I'm Shawn Carter", "When I'm shooting, just call me Vince"], "meaning": "Shawn Carter is Jay-Z’s real name. Jay-Z has been seen with Beyonce driving a Tesla Model X.\n\n\n\n Youngboy is saying that he will shoot someone with the precision of former NBA Player & eight-time All-Star Vince Carter.", "annotation_id": "20819679", "url": "https://genius.com/20819679", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
