{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Funds", "line": "Tell the detective I upgraded my necklace, I’m keepin’ it clea", "vault_lines": ["Tell the detective I upgraded my necklace, I'm keepin' it clean (I'm keepin' it clean)"], "meaning": "Possibly referring to the situation he had where he got arrested at a hotel, the entire arrest video got put on YouTube and there’s a moment where he gets very serious about the handling of his necklace.\n\nTrying to make sure they didn’t break it while taking it off of him and to make sure it goes in good hands.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hBOSftyMQQ4", "annotation_id": "26094125", "url": "https://genius.com/26094125", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Funds", "line": "I popped that boy, and mad I ain’t finish", "vault_lines": ["I popped that boy, and mad I ain't finish"], "meaning": "An allusion to someone Youngboy shot at but didn’t kill. He mentions this in multiple other songs as well.", "annotation_id": "22911435", "url": "https://genius.com/22911435", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Funds", "line": "Drugs keep a nigga calm from the shit I seen", "vault_lines": ["Drugs keep a nigga calm from the shit I seen"], "meaning": "Youngboy is saying that all of the drugs he takes, from weed to drinking lean and popping pills, he does this because it keeps him calm from all of the terrible things he has seen in the past.", "annotation_id": "22911424", "url": "https://genius.com/22911424", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Funds", "line": "Layin’ on my gravedigger chain where a hit at", "vault_lines": ["Layin' on my gravedigger chain where a hit at (Uh-huh)"], "meaning": "Youngboy is referring to his gravedigging chain, one of many in his collection. This chain features a large casket in the middle of the pendant with two large assault rifles on the side. The clasp for this chain also are caskets that open up with another assault rifle inside.", "annotation_id": "22911401", "url": "https://genius.com/22911401", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
