{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Games of War", "line": "[Chorus] I been gettin’ money, I been gettin’ money I been gettin’ money, I been gettin’— ayy I been gettin’ money, I been gettin’ money I been gettin’ money, I been gettin’ money", "vault_lines": ["I been gettin' money, I been gettin' money", "I been gettin' money, I been gettin'— ayy"], "meaning": "This chorus pays a homage to rapper OJ da Juiceman’s 2008 track “I’m Gettin Money”. The “Ayy” adlib is also a famous saying from OJ. https://youtu.be/4l6IG7l0ZnE?si=gJ8leSGEZvvqBcmh", "annotation_id": "37640579", "url": "https://genius.com/37640579", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
