{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Games of War", "line": "Jay Leno", "vault_lines": ["Baby, I'm Jay Leno, told 'em look at my garage"], "meaning": "PROPOSED SUGGESTION:\n\nJay Leno is a famous comedian who is also known for being a devout car enthusiast, hosting the “Jay Leno’s Garage” TV show from 2014 to 2022 and currently drives and reviews different automobiles on the “Jay Leno’s Garage” YouTube channel, which has almost 4 million subscribers.", "annotation_id": "36348838", "url": "https://genius.com/36348838", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Games of War", "line": "Nigga, ’fore I was sixteen, I been left a stain", "vault_lines": ["Nigga, 'fore I was sixteen, I been left a stain"], "meaning": "Since the age of 16 Youngboy has been something not to play with. An individual not to be taken lightly. If you cross him, do him dirty, play him anything where he’s gonna take a lose. He will not let it slide. He will do something to you about it. Either through just plane violence, he might do something that’s gonna effect your money, something that’s gonna require you to close up shop permanently or temporarily and cost you money or he might get it back in blood, leaving blood stained clothes with bullets holes.", "annotation_id": "37374236", "url": "https://genius.com/37374236", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Games of War", "line": "Big dirty rod, pop out by the house and then just, baow", "vault_lines": ["Big dirty rod, pop out by the house and then just, baow"], "meaning": "If you turn out to be a serious threat with enough money to do some damage to Youngboy and the crew, Then he’ll pay a large amount of money to have them smackers in your bushes and the side of your house. Then when you walk out them smackers gonna pop out with dirty firearms and just open fire and last thing you’ll hear is “BAOW!”.", "annotation_id": "37374048", "url": "https://genius.com/37374048", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Games of War", "line": "All that rah-rah shit, nigga, we don’t play ’bout, we play", "vault_lines": ["All that rah-rah shit, nigga, we don't play 'bout, we play games of war"], "meaning": "Youngboy is saying if you’re coming at him and the crew talking reckless, barking, you gotta be serious about it, you better make sure you bite because him and the crew don’t play that barking stuff. They bite straight away. They play games of war by taking any violent situation very serious like it’s a gang war in the streets. To go to war in the streets you must have enough money to hide your family in a different state or fly them out the country, enough money to pay for smackers to go handle the situation and some to stay posted around your place and street making sure no suspicious vehicles or people stalking or waiting for you to one out so they can do the job. enough money to have 24/7 protection where your staying and 24/7 protection where your family is staying. Enough money to buy multiple bulletproof vehicles to move around if needed. You gotta be able to do all that if you wanna disrespect him or beef with him. Doing all that barking shit and making threats and your not prepared and equipped to go to war, your gonna be on a stretcher dead or in critical condition.", "annotation_id": "37373764", "url": "https://genius.com/37373764", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Games of War", "line": "All that tough shit, nigga, we’ll stretch ’bout, meet me at the park", "vault_lines": ["All that tough shit, nigga, we'll stretch 'bout, meet me at the park"], "meaning": "Youngboy is saying if you approach him with that tough guy shit, you’re gonna end up on a stretcher, dead or in critical condition.", "annotation_id": "37373680", "url": "https://genius.com/37373680", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
