{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Games of War", "line": "They know you cannot run, baby Like I’m bad boy, frrt, frrt", "vault_lines": ["Like I'm bad boy, frrt, frrt"], "meaning": "This here is a double entendre:\n\nYB calls the person he’s talking to a “baby” as they’re too afraid to run from him since he’s a “bad boy”\n\nYB possibly uses the famous baby in the Bad Boy Records logo to strengthen this comparison, as he’s the “bad boy” to the other person’s “baby”", "annotation_id": "37286657", "url": "https://genius.com/37286657", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
