{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Games of War", "line": "Herm got two guns", "vault_lines": ["Herm got two guns"], "meaning": "This is a reference to Herm tha Blacksheep, Youngboy’s close friend.\n\nIn the bar, youngboy says that he doesn’t have a firearm, and implies he handed it to Herm.", "annotation_id": "36542366", "url": "https://genius.com/36542366", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
