{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Games of War", "line": "I got mansions all around Utah that’s paid for, I’m that boy", "vault_lines": ["I got mansions all around Utah that's paid for, I'm that boy"], "meaning": "The flex in this line is he doesn’t need a pension or a mortgage, he can just buy the mansion when he wants, prepaid. And he does have multiple mansions\n\n\nPictured here is his mansion in salt lake city, Utah. Which is listed for sale for $5 million.", "annotation_id": "36477112", "url": "https://genius.com/36477112", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Games of War", "line": "I get nine fifty for one show, mama, I’m a star", "vault_lines": ["I get nine fifty for one show, mama, I'm a star"], "meaning": "NBA YoungBoy is projected to earn $45 Million from his US tour, with 45 shows, expected to earn him a million per show on average, so him saying “nine fifty” is not a stretch, since he can earn $950,000 from a show", "annotation_id": "36477101", "url": "https://genius.com/36477101", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
