{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Games of War", "line": "That’s two million-dollar rings on my main thing", "vault_lines": ["That's two million-dollar rings on my main thing"], "meaning": "NBA YoungBoy wears a lot of special rings that cost a lot of money, one of his most iconic is the 30 ctw diamond ring that he bought for his engagement, and he has a diamond encrusted ring with the text “38 baby”, referencing his early mixtape\n\n\n\n(NBA YoungBoy’s engagement ring closeup)", "annotation_id": "36477088", "url": "https://genius.com/36477088", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
