{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Gangsta", "line": "Been down for all this time, so I been tryna see what Heaven like", "vault_lines": ["Been down for all this time, so I been tryna see what Heaven like"], "meaning": "Alluding to Hell. Hell is downwards and Heaven is upwards. He has been through hell (down) so he wants to see brighter days.", "annotation_id": "37861308", "url": "https://genius.com/37861308", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
