{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Gangsta Fever", "line": "Gangster fever", "vault_lines": ["Think I'm gettin' the gangster fever"], "meaning": "Gansta fever happens when you feel that you are better by yourself. You no longer require the need of love or any sort of company. You just wanna thug it out alone.", "annotation_id": "37220418", "url": "https://genius.com/37220418", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Gangsta Fever", "line": "I gotta show this ho now, bitch, I ain’t playin’ Same niggas talk that shit, they don’t know nothin’ ‘bout bein’ a man", "vault_lines": ["I gotta show this ho now, bitch, I ain't playin'", "Same niggas talk that shit, they don't know nothin' 'bout bein' a man"], "meaning": "Youngboy is aggressively guarding his respect and he acknowledges that the same men who talk down on him, have no clue what it means to truly be called a man. The same ones who talk about him and disrespect him have never been able to understand true manhood.", "annotation_id": "28185259", "url": "https://genius.com/28185259", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Gangsta Fever", "line": "Made nigga got plenty figures, what I wouldn’t do for my child Painted that image like I ain’t shit, but I’ma burn it up now", "vault_lines": ["Made nigga got plenty figures, what I wouldn't do for my child", "Painted that image like I ain't shit, but I'ma burn it up now"], "meaning": "Youngboy is saying he has a substantial amount of money now, so for his child he won’t forfeit anything. I believe he is also talking about the news blogs and criticism he gets for being himself, the image they make of him, but he’s gonna burn it up and show hes built different .", "annotation_id": "28185238", "url": "https://genius.com/28185238", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Gangsta Fever", "line": "Stand-up guy, never sit quiet, I could say I always tried But now I don’t want nobody around and they wonder why", "vault_lines": ["Stand-up guy, never sit quiet, I could say I always tried", "But now I don't want nobody around and they wonder why"], "meaning": "Although youngboy feels like he holds himself accountable and always tries to tell the truth, he realized other people dont do that. He now realizes because of this, he doesnt want anyone around him due to them probably not doing the same but yet they act confused as to why.", "annotation_id": "26647514", "url": "https://genius.com/26647514", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
