{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Genie", "line": "Had to tell her I’m a genie, I can answer wishes, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Had to tell her I'm a genie, I can answer wishes, yeah"], "meaning": "The Genie is a fictional Jinn appearing in Walt Disney Pictures' 31st animated feature film Aladdin,\nThe genie can answer 3 wishes.\n\nYb compare himself to the genie and say he can answer to all his girl wishes if she loyalty to him", "annotation_id": "25707265", "url": "https://genius.com/25707265", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Genie", "line": "Had to tell her I’m a genie, I can answer wishes, yeah, yeah (Can answer wishes, slime)", "vault_lines": ["Had to tell her I'm a genie, I can answer wishes, yeah, yeah (Can answer wishes, slime)"], "meaning": "The Genie is a fictional Jinn appearing in Walt Disney Pictures' 31st animated feature film Aladdin.\nThe genie can answer 3 wishes\n\nYb compare himself to the genie and say he can answer to all his girl wishes", "annotation_id": "25707255", "url": "https://genius.com/25707255", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Genie", "line": "Free Kodak, everything gettin’ slayed", "vault_lines": ["Free Kodak, everything gettin' slayed"], "meaning": "Throughout this song, as well as others on the album, YoungBoy reflects on prison, and the hardship that it brings with it.\n\nRecently, fellow rapper and friend, Kodak Black was sentenced to 364 days in prison. Knowing how prison is, as he has been sentenced multiple times for his crimes, YoungBoy would never wish it upon anyone else, especially not a friend. Therefore he, like many others is saying “Free Kodak” as a way to protest his sentence.\n\nKodak also has a song called “Slayed” on his album “Lil B.I.G Pac”", "annotation_id": "14913660", "url": "https://genius.com/14913660", "state": "accepted", "votes": 32, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Genie", "line": "Zoe life to the end, tell them free the main sniper (Tell ’em free Kodak)", "vault_lines": ["Zoe life to the end, tell them free the main sniper (Tell 'em free Kodak)"], "meaning": "This is another shoutout to Kodak Black and his gang, Zombies on Earth, which is shortened to Zoe. In Call You, Kodak raps:\n\nI know I’m a zombie on Earth, I’m a Zoe", "annotation_id": "14301113", "url": "https://genius.com/14301113", "state": "accepted", "votes": 38, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Genie", "line": "We get pulled over, no, you ain’t going to do no time for me", "vault_lines": ["We get pulled over, no, you ain't going to do no time for me"], "meaning": "At the time of writing YoungBoy was 18 years old with four children and has not had the smoothest of relationships. YoungBoy’s recent girlfriend is an Instagram girl going by the name of Jania Bania, who it most likely directed at, as they have been on and off. The whole ‘ride and die’ relationship could come into the picture as he says, “…you ain’t going to do no time for me”\n\nIt could simple just be him talking about getting in trouble with the police and the passenger snitches on him because they do not want to go jail for YoungBoy NBA. This bar is really about loyalty and who has got his back when the going gets tough.\n\n A lot of speculation has gone on if there is domestic violence involved and she has denied it saying:\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/Bfb7fM5j6AU/?hl=en&taken-by=janiabaniaa\n\nKidnapped? Fuck no! … has he ever put his hands on me? Fuck no! … we 18, what do y'all expect? What do y'all expect?‘ she said. 'We good, I promise you that – y'all think I would stay somewhere I was getting abused? Fuck no! We’re good, trust me", "annotation_id": "14251540", "url": "https://genius.com/14251540", "state": "accepted", "votes": 45, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
