{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Ghost", "line": "Put on that jersey, on back, it say “Kemp” Swerve in that ’Burban with burners on him I had to wire a fifty at her I got the gunners on top of the rim, know that they all gon’ dunk on something", "vault_lines": ["Put on that jersey, on back, it say \"Kemp\"", "Swerve in that 'Burban with burners on him", "I had to wire a fifty at her"], "meaning": "Youngboy is referring to NBA Basketball player Shawn Kemp. He was well known for his crazy dunks and athleticism. He later refers to his “gunners” dunking on the competition.\n\nHe is wearing his jersey here", "annotation_id": "26556388", "url": "https://genius.com/26556388", "state": "verified", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
