{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Green Boy", "line": "Ma, I might not make it", "vault_lines": ["Certified green boy, ma, I might not make it"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is telling his mama how he might not make it due to the image of ruthless, reckless, and evilness he has portrayed and done throughout his career. All the disses, shootings, and possibly more might eventually catch up to him. Yes, he’s ran into trouble. But, by the grace of God, he’s still here.", "annotation_id": "39737719", "url": "https://genius.com/39737719", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Green Boy", "line": "Certified green boy", "vault_lines": ["Certified green boy, ma, I might not make it"], "meaning": "YB is referring to himself as a certified green boy. Now we don’t for surely know what this means, but with the little knowledge we do have, he could possibly be talking about how “slime” he is, and how he’s stamped in the streets for his reputation for being about that business when the time comes.", "annotation_id": "39737717", "url": "https://genius.com/39737717", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
