{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Head Blown", "line": "I was just on the news For some stupid lil’ shit, I ain’t trippin’ on that", "vault_lines": ["For some stupid lil' shit, I ain't trippin' on that"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is referring to an incident back in February 2019 where him and his baby mama Starr Thigpen were arrested at an Atlanta Hotel after Starr attacked one of the maids. He was also charged with marijuana possession.\n\nIn this bar YoungBoy details the situation as stupid and minor.", "annotation_id": "23760011", "url": "https://genius.com/23760011", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
