{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Head Blown", "line": "Ned up in jail from that boy, free Choppa Boy and RIP Dave", "vault_lines": ["Ned up in jail from that boy, free Choppa Boy and RIP Dave"], "meaning": "Lil' Dave Thompson is one of Youngboy NBA’s closest friends who died in a car accident in 2010.\n\nYoungBoy raps about him in many of his songs like “Better Man”, “Pour One”, “Murder”, “Like Me”, “Lonely Child” and more.", "annotation_id": "19629836", "url": "https://genius.com/19629836", "state": "accepted", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
