{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Head Shot", "line": "Shoot the whole club up, don’t cost us nothin’, you seen in there Interstate, from the back, tear the trunk up (Baow), bitch, you better not have no kids in there I’m a millionaire, don’t throw our position, nigga, then say we ain’t pick ’em fair Nigga, fuck that, know he dead, we ain’t even carin’, should’ve caught your ass in there", "vault_lines": ["Shoot the whole club up, don't cost us nothin', you seen in there", "Interstate, from the back, tear the trunk up (Baow), bitch, you better not have no kids in there", "I'm a millionaire, don't throw our position, nigga, then say we ain't pick 'em fair", "Nigga, fuck that, know he dead, we ain't even carin', should've caught your ass in there"], "meaning": "He’s talking about King Von since Von got killed outside a night club in November of 2020. By the last line he’s basically saying how he doesn’t care Von died and how they really should’ve caught Durk there instead of Von😂😂", "annotation_id": "35042196", "url": "https://genius.com/35042196", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
