{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Heard Of Me", "line": "We grab them sticks, it’s time to kill, play Jackie Neal, that’s how we roll", "vault_lines": ["We grab them sticks, it's time to kill, play Jackie Neal, that's how we roll"], "meaning": "Jackie Neal was an American blues singer and songwriter from Baton Rouge, Louisiana.\n\nIn this bar Youngboy is referencing one of her hit singles “The Way We Roll” https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ap4PDG-zao0", "annotation_id": "39583547", "url": "https://genius.com/39583547", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
