{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Heart & Soul", "line": "Daughter born, I had to listen while sittin’ on the phone First time got her in my arms like, “I can’t leave you alone” With all these thoughts on top my dome", "vault_lines": ["Daughter born, I had to listen while sittin' on the phone", "First time got her in my arms like, \"I can't leave you alone\"", "With all these thoughts on top my dome"], "meaning": "Jail is an emotionally and physically draining period of anyone’s life. This is displayed here as YB was not able to see his daughter be born because he was behind bars. Once he was released, the important things became clearer and he describes the effort he is putting in to become a better person for himself and for his kids.", "annotation_id": "40353717", "url": "https://genius.com/40353717", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Heart & Soul", "line": "She ain’t into me, yeah Havin’ you, you don’t know what it meant to me It ain’t get to me, nah, every time you said that you ain’t shit to me", "vault_lines": ["She ain't into me, yeah", "Havin' you, you don't know what it meant to me", "It ain't get to me, nah, every time you said that you ain't shit to me"], "meaning": "real", "annotation_id": "38476264", "url": "https://genius.com/38476264", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Heart & Soul", "line": "Intimate, not no consistency", "vault_lines": ["Or into me, intimate, not no consistency"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is saying long as we’re very close and know how good our relationship is behind closed doors, we don’t have to be consistent in talking to each other. Long as we both know we’re still close friends", "annotation_id": "35585500", "url": "https://genius.com/35585500", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Heart & Soul", "line": "Can’t take no pill but I’m rollin’ now Can’t drink no lean but I’m focused now Can’t smoke no dope but I’m loaded now Can’t tote no gun but I’m strapped right now Lil Top on top of the map right now Been dead but nigga, I’m back right now", "vault_lines": ["Can't take no pill but I'm rollin' now", "Can't drink no lean but I'm focused now", "Can't smoke no dope but I'm loaded now", "Can't tote no gun but I'm strapped right now", "Lil Top on top of the map right now"], "meaning": "he’s talking about his bounce back. he can’t do dis but he still do dis which means ain’t nothing stopping him.", "annotation_id": "31385683", "url": "https://genius.com/31385683", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
