{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Hiding Pounds", "line": "Young nigga, take off, I do it Now they around tryna run up they money Soak up they fame, and give them a name", "vault_lines": ["Young nigga, take off, I do it", "Now they around tryna run up they money", "Soak up they fame, and give them a name"], "meaning": "NBA Youngboy is most likely referring to Deceased TBG Members Gee Money & Blvd Quick, who were very critical of NBA Youngboy’s career and even dissed him on multiple songs and interviews after NBA Youngboy signed his deal with Atlantic Records.", "annotation_id": "30140099", "url": "https://genius.com/30140099", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
