{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Highlights", "line": "On my grind for fam, buy whatever they want, I won’t sleep behind this shit", "vault_lines": ["I'm on my grind for fam, buy whatever they want, I won't sleep behind this shit"], "meaning": "Yb is indicating that he’s grinding and doing everything for his family and won’t sleep on it", "annotation_id": "40814291", "url": "https://genius.com/40814291", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Highlights", "line": "I sit and watch this bitch playin’ with her highlights while she playin’ my songs", "vault_lines": ["I sit and watch this bitch playin' with her highlights while she playin' my songs"], "meaning": "Underneath the bravado is an emotionally isolated, transactional vibe. He touches on family anxieties—like waiting for his brother to come home from prison—and cynical, surface-level romantic interactions (“I sit and watch this bitch playin' with her highlights while she playin' my songs”). It gives the track a hollow, nighttime feel where relationships are fleeting and trust is virtually non-existent.", "annotation_id": "40584561", "url": "https://genius.com/40584561", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Highlights", "line": "I woke up, feel my wife, then tend to two bad bitches, huh", "vault_lines": ["I woke up, feel my wife, then tend to two bad bitches, huh"], "meaning": "He married Jazlyn Mychelle in 2023, but he doesn’t exactly hide that he has a harem of other women.", "annotation_id": "40365093", "url": "https://genius.com/40365093", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
