{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Hold 13", "line": "We hunt you down about that money", "vault_lines": ["We hunt you down about that money"], "meaning": "Youngboy has grown up in the Northside of Baton Rouge, Louisiana, a place he is often reffering to and where he grew up at his grandmas house. The family consisting of him, his brother, his sister and his grandma as almost every other person in the hood had no money and were struggling financially.\n\nLater in his teenage years, Youngboy joined a local blood set that his brother got him into. He met first friends like Billy aka. Big B and Ray. With is friends he commited several crimes and stole things. Later on in 2016 Youngboy was charged with two counts of first degree attempted murder and ended up serving 6 months jail time.\n\nLong story short, Youngboy and his friends will no matter what get money wether if they need it or not.", "annotation_id": "22951288", "url": "https://genius.com/22951288", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Hold 13", "line": "I got experience, no degrees", "vault_lines": ["I got experience, no degrees"], "meaning": "Youngboy is a self-proclaimed “rich fuckin' dropout”: in 2014, he quit high school while in ninth grade to pursue his dream of becoming a rapper. Two years later, Youngboy dropped his breakout song “38 Baby” in August 2016.\n\nNotwithstanding the fact that he never graduated, Youngboy’s experience with life is rather substantial for a 20 year-old. The rapper served six months behind bars for robbery at the age of 14, was charged with attempted first-degree murder in 2016 and had to deal with depression, breakups, pressure and fame at a young age. As of the writing, Youngboy also has five children with four mothers.", "annotation_id": "20673867", "url": "https://genius.com/20673867", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
