{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Hold It", "line": "Tote that Gen, they’ll think I’m Timm soon as I’m poppin’ out that truck", "vault_lines": ["Tote that Gen, they'll think I'm Timm soon as I'm poppin' out that truck"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is saying the opps will think he’s Lul Tim the way he’s hopping out that truck. Referring to the death of the rapper King Von who Lul Timmy (Whose real name is Timothy Leeks also known as Lul Timm) killed after seeing Von beat up his best friend who is an African-American rapper known as Quando Rondo.", "annotation_id": "36334446", "url": "https://genius.com/36334446", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
