{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Horsepower", "line": "Fuck them hoes, on them, I ran out, tell them I’m someone trophy", "vault_lines": ["Fuck them hoes, on them, I ran out, tell them I'm someone trophy"], "meaning": "He’s saying he’s completely drained his interest or “ran out” of time and patience for anyone outside of his main relationship. He’s officially checked out of the “streets” or the casual dating scene.\n\nBy calling himself a “trophy,” he’s saying his partner “won” him, and he’s proud to be the prize in her life rather than being available to everyone else.", "annotation_id": "39629646", "url": "https://genius.com/39629646", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
