{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "House Arrest Tingz", "line": "(Drum Dummie) (Drum Dummie made the beat and I’m gon’ kill it)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "Drum Dummie is a producer from Shiloh, Georgia who got his start uploading beats on SoundCloud and YouTube. When he first started, Tevin Revell was making beats on a little Casio piano in his aunt’s house. Today he collaborates with top rappers Kodak Black, Youngboy NBA and Rodwave. His influences and inspiration range from the Isley Brothers to Tupac and Jeezy.", "annotation_id": "28623592", "url": "https://genius.com/28623592", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
