{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Hustler", "line": "Nigga, fuck ’em, I’ll cancel out the whole tour,", "vault_lines": ["Nigga, fuck 'em, I'll cancel out the whole tour, nigga knowin' 'bout how Top do it"], "meaning": "Kentrell does not give a fuck about his tour, his 10 baby mommas, or Austin J. Stirling’s plans to attend his tour this September.\n\nThe goat seems to suggest cancelling not just one, but all 43 of his upcoming tour dates and concerts.\n\nStay tuned as more scheduling news becomes apparent in the coming weeks!", "annotation_id": "36564507", "url": "https://genius.com/36564507", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
