{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Admit", "line": "Bitch wanna kill theyself, then I let her", "vault_lines": ["Bitch wanna kill theyself, then I let her"], "meaning": "Nicki is a saying to the people that still go against her despite the warning and Nicki is pretty much saying if you wanna take that risk I’ll let you but going up against her is pretty much suicide due to the weight her name holds and how longs she’s been in the game. Not the first time she has said this in Roman reloaded re up track called “freedom” she says\n\nIf you are my rival then that means your suicidal”\n\nIf you go against nicki you must want your career to end.", "annotation_id": "28176546", "url": "https://genius.com/28176546", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
