{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Am Who They Say I Am", "line": "I’m all who you say I am, yeah-eh-eh", "vault_lines": ["I'm all who you say I am, yeah-eh-eh"], "meaning": "Youngboy is referred to as a “Pussy” “Fake gangster” and many other harsh words by those who oppose him, or how the positive things people know him as, “The realest” and every good thing he’s known for.\nOverall he is just telling those people, “I’m what you think and say who the type of person I am”\nIn other words, he is trying to ignore what people say about him because he knows himself truly and deeply as a person.\n\nHe is trying to basically tell those people who think he’s this, that, whatever, stick to it then, I don’t care.\n\nWe all go through similar experiences such as people creating false rumors, people think we are bad people or maybe due to a possible image that was created (People change for the better) or don’t live up to our words, being a good person and our actions.\n\nIn summary, we are all know who we are as our self only and what we do, and to ignore those who oppose us for who are truly are despite the hate they bring by lying on your name.", "annotation_id": "34815958", "url": "https://genius.com/34815958", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Am Who They Say I Am", "line": "I’m all who you say I am, yeah-eh-eh", "vault_lines": ["I'm all who you say I am, yeah-eh-eh"], "meaning": "Ybs basically saying everything you say about him,thats who he is and that represents him", "annotation_id": "30179378", "url": "https://genius.com/30179378", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
