{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Am Who They Say I Am", "line": "Told my bae, “I wish I woulda found you back when I was bummin’”", "vault_lines": ["Told my bae, \"I wish I woulda found you back when I was bummin'\""], "meaning": "He is saying that he wishes she would have found him and been with him when he was at his lowest point before the fame , kinda like she would have helped up through the tough times quicker", "annotation_id": "21785656", "url": "https://genius.com/21785656", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Am Who They Say I Am", "line": "RIP to Quahfee, know my nigga at them Heaven gates", "vault_lines": ["RIP to Quahfee, know my nigga at them Heaven gates"], "meaning": "Quahfee Murphy was Quando’s friend and made role model. They met while serving time in juvenile detention. Quahfee was murdered in 2014 during an alleged gun transaction. \n\nQuando mentions Quahfee in numerous songs, like “I Remember,” “Paradise,” and “Ride For Me.”", "annotation_id": "16272102", "url": "https://genius.com/16272102", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Am Who They Say I Am", "line": "She ain’t never really made love, I’m him just like Kevin Gates", "vault_lines": ["She ain't never really made love, I'm him just like Kevin Gates"], "meaning": "A shoutout to collaborator Kevin Gates.\n\n“I’m Him” is a slogan that Kevin Gates likes to use, even selling shirts with the slogan on them.\n\n“Never really made love” is the line repeated in the chorus of Kevin Gates hit song, “Satellites”.", "annotation_id": "15316592", "url": "https://genius.com/15316592", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
