{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Came Thru", "line": "I’m too slimy for to be up on some hurtin’ shit", "vault_lines": ["And I'm too slimy for to be up on some hurtin' shit"], "meaning": "NBA Youngboy uses the line “I’m too slimy for to be up on some hurtin' shit” to mean that he is too street-smart and calculating to act out of raw, emotional heartbreak.\n\nHe breaks this down as follows:\n“Slimy”: In this context, it refers to being cunning, deceptive, or playing the streets smartly (he knows how to protect himself and can’t be easily manipulated).\n\n“Hurtin' shit”: Reacting out of wounded pride, heartbreak, or distress.The Translation: He is saying he is too experienced and guarded to let his emotions control him or make him act recklessly over a betrayal.\n\nInstead of crying or making foolish moves out of pain, he stays focused on his money, his crew, and getting even.", "annotation_id": "40059547", "url": "https://genius.com/40059547", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Came Thru", "line": "A hundred flyin’, comin’ through", "vault_lines": ["Well bitch, we steppin' on you, a hundred flyin', comin' through"], "meaning": "A hundred bullets coming your way for messing with NBA YoungBoy.", "annotation_id": "37466615", "url": "https://genius.com/37466615", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Came Thru", "line": "My niggas drivin’, that’s some shit I don’t do", "vault_lines": ["My niggas drivin', that's some shit I don't do"], "meaning": "NBA Youngboy could be referring to a few different things with this bar. The first is a drive by, however Youngboy was involved in a 2017 Louisiana drive by.\n\nhttps://www.thefader.com/2016/12/12/nba-youngboy-drive-by-shooting-baton-rouge-attempted-murder-report/amp\n\nAnother, doubtful, reference is that YB doesn’t have a drivers license. However this is false, as he is seen driving cars in music videos and making his car collection very public on social media.", "annotation_id": "34667351", "url": "https://genius.com/34667351", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Came Thru", "line": "Nigga play, we shoot another film", "vault_lines": ["Nigga play, we shoot another film"], "meaning": "Youngboy goes back to the “make him blow it and choke it” line, now saying that if his opps didn’t learn their lesson the first time, and mess with Youngboy again, he will film an adult video with them, aka “shoot a film”. It can be inferred that Youngboy is not looking for consent either.", "annotation_id": "32447424", "url": "https://genius.com/32447424", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
