{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Can’t Take It Back", "line": "Go A to Z on one tour bus, I ain’t flying on Lears Real 38 baby on certain occasions, young nigga earned him seven kills I say fuck ‘em if they hate me, but speakin’ on cases get you drilled", "vault_lines": ["Go A to Z on one tour bus, I ain't flying on Lears", "Real 38 baby on certain occasions, young nigga earned him seven kills", "I say fuck 'em if they hate me, but speakin' on cases get you drilled"], "meaning": "Ok this is another tricky mix up I love when he does this\n\nFirst line\nis about the hook in the song “Hold on, tryna pop his shit ‘bout Top, gon’ pop soon as I see him” he’s talking about someone from outside his state maybe a rapper talking down on him that’s why he do tour bus and don’t fly planes because he keeps guns around him at all time and you not bringing a gun on the plane so they drive to every show\n\nLine two\nIs about TBG 4kt is responsible for 5 deaths of TBG. He saying they can keep hating but if they keep talking about any deaths in this war can get them killed", "annotation_id": "24959327", "url": "https://genius.com/24959327", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
