{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Choose You", "line": "It hurts, wish I never said “I love you” first I just wanna give you the world", "vault_lines": ["It hurts, wish I never said \"I love you\" first"], "meaning": "NBA YoungBoys relationships have been constantly tumultuous for a multitude of reasons. This song could be referencing the women in his life who have left him because of his own issues with the law, drugs, violence and cheating. This hurts Youngboy as he is still in love with the girl he references in this line but she doesn’t want anything to do with him and has instead found a new man.", "annotation_id": "20058438", "url": "https://genius.com/20058438", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
