{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Don’t Like It", "line": "She ain’t wanted me to stay up in her house ‘cause I stay in trouble and be smokin’ weed", "vault_lines": ["She ain't wanted me to stay up in her house 'cause I stay in troublе and be smokin' weed"], "meaning": "𝒮𝒽ℯ 𝒶𝒾𝓃𝓉 𝓌𝒶𝓃𝓉ℯ𝒹 𝓂ℯ 𝓉ℴ 𝓈𝓉𝒶𝓎 𝓊𝓅 𝒾𝓃 𝒽ℯ𝓇 𝒽ℴ𝓊𝓈ℯ 𝒸𝒶𝓊𝓈ℯ 𝒾 𝓈𝓉𝒶𝓎 𝒾𝓃 𝓉𝓇ℴ𝓊𝒷𝓁ℯ 𝓃 𝒷ℯ 𝓈𝓂ℴ𝓀𝒾𝓃 𝓌ℯℯ𝒹", "annotation_id": "31402498", "url": "https://genius.com/31402498", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
