{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Don’t Talk", "line": "Talk to my brother violent, but Herm got him clapped, and I cop that", "vault_lines": ["Talk to my brother violent, but Herm got him clapped, and I cop that"], "meaning": "YB is likely referring to the January 2022 verbal argument between his right-hand man NBA Ben 10 and rapper Truebleeda on Clubhouse. The NBA/4KT-Bleedas beef in Baton Rouge is well-known. On the song Soul Snatcher with Big B, YB’s close friend Herm Tha Blacksheep dissed Truebleeda and other bleedas.", "annotation_id": "32068169", "url": "https://genius.com/32068169", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Don’t Talk", "line": "Ain’t takin’ care of her body, she skinny as the fuck, her parents fat", "vault_lines": ["Ain't takin' care of her body, she skinny as the fuck, her parents fat"], "meaning": "Girl having eating disorder", "annotation_id": "29656906", "url": "https://genius.com/29656906", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Don’t Talk", "line": "Kelly and a Birkin bag even though the bitch still do me bad", "vault_lines": ["Kelly and a Birkin bag even though the bitch still do me bad"], "meaning": "In this line, Youngboy is likely referring to two things:\n\n\n“Kelly” could be a reference to the luxury brand Hermès, specifically the Kelly bag, which is a highly sought-after designer handbag known for its exclusivity and high cost.\n“Birkin bag” is another reference to a luxury designer handbag, the Hermès Birkin bag. It’s one of the most expensive and iconic handbags in the world.\n\n\n\nWhen he says, “even though the bitch still do me bad,” he seems to be expressing that despite giving someone expensive gifts like these designer bags (Kelly and Birkin), the person is still treating him poorly or negatively. It reflects a common theme in hip-hop and rap music where artists discuss lavish spending and material possessions while also addressing personal relationships and challenges.", "annotation_id": "29656878", "url": "https://genius.com/29656878", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Don’t Talk", "line": "Phone ring, it’s K, pick up my phone, “KD just got gunned down”", "vault_lines": ["Phone ring, it's K, pick up my phone, \"KD just got gunned down\""], "meaning": "NBA Youngboy’s got a call from his Manager Montana that his friend, NBA KD, one of Youngboy’s closest friends was shot in 2019 and was left paralyzed.", "annotation_id": "29592958", "url": "https://genius.com/29592958", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
