{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Forgive Them", "line": "He was playin’ ’round with the B, I fucked around and had him mossed", "vault_lines": ["He was playin' 'round with the B, I fucked around and had him mossed"], "meaning": "He was playing around with the Bloods which is the gang that YoungBoy reps so YB had him mossed. Mossed in football terms is headtapped aka when you get caught on. In streets terms, headtapped is when you get shot in the head. And YB is not talking about football.", "annotation_id": "37210889", "url": "https://genius.com/37210889", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
