{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Forgive Them", "line": "[Chorus] Break a rule, you kill me, need to run, divide Behind enemy lines, what the fuck to find? Oh, Lord Oh, I forgive them, watch over thy children Let you know, if you beef with me, my bros, they’ll try to kill them Survive in the game, we all deal cocaine Officer, again, we don’t give no names Oh, Lord Oh, I forgive them, watch over thy children Know the soldier mind way, I had to bust for my nigga, oh, yeah", "vault_lines": ["Survive in the game, we all deal cocaine", "Officer, again, we don't give no names", "Know the soldier mind way, I had to bust for my nigga, oh, yeah"], "meaning": "Whole Chorus isn’t word for word Kevin Gates Chorus on “The Way I Am” but it does pay tribute to the chorus.", "annotation_id": "36782778", "url": "https://genius.com/36782778", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
