{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Got This", "line": "Herm caught his girl cheating and took her back, motivation to me", "vault_lines": ["Herm caught his girl cheating and took her back, motivation to me"], "meaning": "Youngboy takes this to consideration to not take back a girl who was caught cheating, and taking it to mind to see into his woman, and making sure she’s the right one with no trust issues. Sadly sometimes people don’t realize cheating is bad and forgives the person because of the deepness that they are in love and are blinded by love. Later youngboy states “Like, bitch, you cheat on me, you will never get forgiveness from me”\n\nSo no, he doesn’t mean that it’s a motivation to him to do the exactly thing what herm did", "annotation_id": "34894258", "url": "https://genius.com/34894258", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Got This", "line": "I done slept up on his couch Just wanna see him and my mama smile", "vault_lines": ["I done slept up on his couch", "Just wanna see him and my mama smile"], "meaning": "Montana and Youngboy go way back and has been mentioned in tons of songs and be called “k” or “kk”\nIn untouchable By youngboy, he has stated,\n\n“And I say Montana too because Montana give me anything. I got money, but I walk in the mall and still ask Montana to buy me this and he’ll buy it. “\n\nIt is the lyrics mentioning montana and his litttke brother and shows how youngboy truly respects the people around him no matter what, and would always be there for them.", "annotation_id": "34866727", "url": "https://genius.com/34866727", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
