{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Got This", "line": "And I know that I can leave any day (I can leave) I’ll be gone on my way (On my way)", "vault_lines": ["And I know (I know)"], "meaning": "He is stating that he can leave any day meaning that he can get his life gone because of his past since it crawls up to people if they don’t change, or he means that he can just move on in life, adding “i’ll be gone on my way” could also symbolize that whatever happens to him, he knows that he will be on his way and gone. Not to say he will or not but in my point of view, he trying to say that he can leave the earth any day due to his possible drug abuses or past can follow up.", "annotation_id": "34866618", "url": "https://genius.com/34866618", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
