{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Got This", "line": "You got my brothers Ben, Big B, KD, Herm, Baby Joe Even if I’m— if I’m forgetting the rest, you got all them to call on So please just know that you don’t have to do none of this It’s forever, 4L NBA 4KTrey You can stand on that, but please don’t bang", "vault_lines": ["You got my brothers Ben, Big B, KD, Herm, Baby Joe", "Even if I'm— if I'm forgetting the rest, you got all them to call on", "So please just know that you don't have to do none of this", "You can stand on that, but please don't bang"], "meaning": "Youngboy is naming some of this friends that his kids could call on if he isn’t there and how he doesn’t want them to live the life he lived or is currently living", "annotation_id": "25058515", "url": "https://genius.com/25058515", "state": "pending", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Got This", "line": "You ain’t gotta live this way I done stacked too much money, man You’ll disappoint me if you get off into some shit like this", "vault_lines": ["You ain't gotta live this way", "I done stacked too much money, man", "You'll disappoint me if you get off into some shit like this"], "meaning": "This whole outro is about his 9 kids! He’s letting them know that they don’t ever have to struggle to get where he’s at or to get the money that he has. He’s letting them know to always stay prayed up and wherever he’s at, he’s prayed up too. If he ever leaves this world, they will always have someone to count on, no matter what. They got his brothers, his dad(s), and each other. They can stand on NBA/4KTrey, but he never wants them to gangbang because it’ll disappoint him. His kids will never have to want for a thing.\n\nTo: Kayden, Taylin, Kamiri, Kacey, Armani, Kodi, Kentrell Jr, Kaell, and Love.\n\nFrom: Kentrell, Lil Top, NBA Youngboy, but most importantly, DAD ❤️🤞🏾.", "annotation_id": "24945795", "url": "https://genius.com/24945795", "state": "pending", "votes": 36, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
