{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Hate YoungBoy", "line": "You know where I stay, don’t let me find your home", "vault_lines": ["You know where I stay, don't let me find your home (Don't let me find you, fuck you)"], "meaning": "YoungBoy’s old address in Utah is public: 4544 S Abinadi Rd, Millcreek (Salt Lake City), UT 84124 he’s said in other songs like “My Address Public” in his “Decided 2” album released on 11/10/2023 that: “My address public cause I got a chopper round this motherfucker” and on his “Return of Goldie” single released on 11/1/2023 that: “I got guards inside the front yard and the back yard ‘case they play, bitch you gon’ die inside of this yard we gon’ drag you to your grave” Also in the bodycam video of his 4/16/24 mansion raid arrest for his alleged prescription drug fraud ring his security guards had AR-15’s the police confiscated and one of whom is an ex Navy Seal so he’s telling Lil Durk that he’s not scared if he knows where he lives and telling Lil Durk that he knows he keeps his primary residence address private even from his close friends and threatening to not let YoungBoy find out where it is since the rapper Lul Timm signed to his Never Broke Again record label shot and killed the rapper King Von signed to Lil Durk’s OTF music label in Atlanta at Monaco hookah lounge following an altercation between King Von and Quando Rondo another rapper signed to YoungBoy’s Never Broke Again music label.", "annotation_id": "41788603", "url": "https://genius.com/41788603", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
