{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Hate YoungBoy", "line": "Starr don’t wanna drop my son off, know somebody might get whacked (Whacked)", "vault_lines": ["Starr don't wanna drop my son off, know somebody might get whacked (Whacked)"], "meaning": "In this line, NBA YoungBoy is referring to Starr Dejanee, the mother of his son Kamari Gaulden. He suggests that Starr is hesitant to drop off their son, possibly because of the dangerous environment surrounding him. “Whacked” is a slang term that means getting killed or harmed, implying that there’s a potential threat or risk of violence that Starr is aware of. YoungBoy is highlighting the dangerous lifestyle he’s involved in, and the concern for his son’s safety even in seemingly mundane situations, such as drop-offs.", "annotation_id": "34842952", "url": "https://genius.com/34842952", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
