{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Hate YoungBoy", "line": "“YoungBoy, they gon’ kill you, you better stop dissin’ them” Tell them niggas, “Fuck ’em,” and they know that I ain’t scared of them (Scared of them)", "vault_lines": ["Tell them niggas, \"Fuck 'em,\" and they know that I ain't scared of them (Scared of them)"], "meaning": "People on the internet thought that lil durk and o’block members were gonna kill youngboy because of the king von shooting. Youngboy says he ain’t scared of them.", "annotation_id": "31508621", "url": "https://genius.com/31508621", "state": "pending", "votes": 14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Hate YoungBoy", "line": "Chinese Kitty don’t wanna be my girl, she like them folks (Them)", "vault_lines": ["Chinese Kitty don't wanna be my girl, she like them folks (Them)"], "meaning": "Chinese Kitty is an artist who blushed when she appeared on an episode of “Off The Record” and blushed when the host phone called Youngboy. Conisdering Youngboy has previously sent shots at the industry with tracks like “F**k the industry,” he’s most likely alluding that Chinese Kitty is no longer interested in him and attracted to people who are favored by the industry.", "annotation_id": "30097756", "url": "https://genius.com/30097756", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
