{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Hate YoungBoy", "line": "He got Rolls, my McLaren, he got Maybach and Range Rover (Yeah, bow, bow)", "vault_lines": ["He got Rolls, my McLaren, he got Maybach and Range Rover (Yeah, bow, bow)"], "meaning": "Ever since Youngboy Never Broke Again moved to Utah on house arrest, he’s famously previewed his McLaren, Maybach, and Range Rover on his music videos.", "annotation_id": "30097610", "url": "https://genius.com/30097610", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Hate YoungBoy", "line": "I be turnt up with my baby mamas, I ain’t got no fuckin’ friends (Hah, hah, bow, bow)", "vault_lines": ["I be turnt up with my baby mamas, I ain't got no fuckin' friends (Hah, hah, bow, bow)"], "meaning": "NBA Youngboy lives in a low-populated area with only 3 visitors allowed in addition to his producer, business manager, and his wife so, it’s no surprise why he mostly spends time with his wife and lacks friends.", "annotation_id": "30097484", "url": "https://genius.com/30097484", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Hate YoungBoy", "line": "Ain’t got no fuckin’ mind, tell ’em, “Free Baba, that’s my evil twin” (My twin)", "vault_lines": ["Ain't got no fuckin' mind, tell 'em, \"Free Baba, that's my evil twin\" (My twin)"], "meaning": "“Baba,” is NBA Youngboy’s close friend. Baba is currently in prison for an alleged murder.", "annotation_id": "30097413", "url": "https://genius.com/30097413", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
