{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Hate YoungBoy", "line": "And my brother let that stick blow (Stick blow)", "vault_lines": ["And my brother let that stick blow (Stick blow)"], "meaning": "NBA Youngboy could be referencing several people considering he has multiple friends who allegedly “let that stick blow” (shot something or someone.) However, considering this song is a diss track to Lil Durk, he’s most likely referring to Lul Tim, an artist who k*lled Lil Durk’s close friend and collaborator, King Von.", "annotation_id": "30097170", "url": "https://genius.com/30097170", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
