{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Is That", "line": "He say if somebody snatch his chain, he be claimin’ that he gon’ do this and do that That nigga a ho, when they reach for his neck, he ain’t let off the strap, he just went to the ’Gram", "vault_lines": ["He say if somebody snatch his chain, he be claimin' that he gon' do this and do that", "That nigga a ho, when they reach for his neck, he ain't let off the strap, he just went to the 'Gram"], "meaning": "this is a diss to jaydayoungen when his chain was snatched jay didn’t do anything but when to ig (what a bitch) 🤦🏾", "annotation_id": "28446199", "url": "https://genius.com/28446199", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
