{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Know", "line": "Just one look, I see the whole world in your eyes Combination on my heart, no one could get inside", "vault_lines": ["Just one look, I see the whole world in your eyes", "Combination on my heart, no one could get inside"], "meaning": "Here Youngboy pictures how difficult it is to look at someone you loved, because the world you mentally created of you leaving your life with them comes back to mind. And it makes any other life seem impossible, putting  a « combination » on your heart that won’t let you love anyone else as you can’t get over that world with your ex.", "annotation_id": "30740844", "url": "https://genius.com/30740844", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Know", "line": "I need someone to hold me, keep me safe in this world", "vault_lines": ["I need someone to hold me, keep me safe in this world"], "meaning": "He is saying that he regrets losing his ex, and he needs somebody (preferably her) to keep him safe and keep him company, much like the peter_grinding tiktok account.", "annotation_id": "30430920", "url": "https://genius.com/30430920", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
