{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "I Know", "line": "Half a ticket Richard Mille", "vault_lines": ["Half a ticket Richard Mille"], "meaning": "“Ticket” refers to $1,000,000. Considering the price of this watch is “half a ticket,” Nba Youngboy is most likely referring to a “Richard Mille RM011.”\n\n\n\nAverage price: $200,000 – $700,000", "annotation_id": "29175484", "url": "https://genius.com/29175484", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
