{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Is You Down", "line": "Slap you every time you cry Never let ’em see your weakness", "vault_lines": ["Slap you every time you cry, never let ‘em see yo’ weakness"], "meaning": "As someone does something, slapping them shocks them because it’s unexpected. At the time of the moment, the person stops what they are doing and realises what just happened, causing Youngboy to not let anyone see their weakness and keep them in check / wake up in the moment.\n(Literal meaning just telling you to stop showing your weakness to everyone)", "annotation_id": "38942332", "url": "https://genius.com/38942332", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
