{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "It Ain’t Over", "line": "(Dmac on the fucking track)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "This is the official producer tag for David McDowell, otherwise, known as Dmac.\n\nDmac has produced for many artists such as Dave East, BlocBoy JB, and TrenchMobb.\n\nDmac’s most popular tracks are, “No Stylist” by Dave East, “Left Right” by BlocBoy JB, and this track.", "annotation_id": "38469180", "url": "https://genius.com/38469180", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "It Ain’t Over", "line": "Chasin’ money, I ain’t chasin’ your bullshit I’ma take the steppin’ to a whole ’nother level I can tell you I ain’t the one you wan’ do You done ran off, buy a whole ‘nother Bezel, we ain’t never makin’ up, you done ruined it “Still reminiscin’,” what you told me Coverin’ up my feelings with the codeine Acceptin’ collect calls from the nosebleed", "vault_lines": ["You done ran off, buy a whole 'nother Bezel", "We ain't never makin' up, you done ruined it", "Still reminiscin' what you told me", "Coverin' up my feelings with the codeine", "Acceptin' collect calls from the nosebleed"], "meaning": "Im gay", "annotation_id": "27614398", "url": "https://genius.com/27614398", "state": "pending", "votes": -14, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
