{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "It’s Whateva", "line": "If I want you, that pain I lose", "vault_lines": ["If I want you, that pain I lose"], "meaning": "if they get with youngboy he loses the pain because he wants them cause he loves them , just like how we are with our significant other, we tend to lose track of time and forget the bad we have going on because they make it better; just like family and friends , we also have a good time forgetting about our problems.", "annotation_id": "35438502", "url": "https://genius.com/35438502", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
