{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Jingle Bells", "line": "Hold on, jingle bell, jingle bell, who gon’ die today? Hold on, my 5's come, ain’t nobody safe, take your face off with my K It’s 4KTrey", "vault_lines": ["Hold on, my 5's come, ain't nobody safe, take your face off with my K"], "meaning": "A violent twist on one of the most famous Christmas holiday songs, 1992’s “Jingle Bells”:\n\nOh, jingle bells, jingle bells\nJingle all the way\nOh, what fun it is to ride\nIn a one-horse open sleigh, hey\n\nA “K” refers to an AK-47 or a similar firearm, such as a Draco.\n\n4KTrey is a brand/lifestyle with several meanings. “4KT” is often seen to stand for “Four Killer Team” or “Forever Killing Them,” while others believe it stands for “For Kentrell,” with “KT” being initials of YoungBoy’s first name.\n\nMore commonly, the term is used interchangeably with his record label, Never Broke Again, but it usually refers to YoungBoy himself and his close associates.\n\n2022’s “4KT Baby” directly references the term as part of a gang affiliation:\n\nThat’s a 4KTrey baby\nWalk up on ‘em, lay shit down\nThat’s them 4KTrey babies\nKeep his flag, you know he bangin’ green\n4KTrey baby", "annotation_id": "37948184", "url": "https://genius.com/37948184", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Jingle Bells", "line": "I’m on them bars like they Now and Laters", "vault_lines": ["Shit what it is? I ain't got no chill, I'm on them bars like they Now and Laters"], "meaning": "he is did a word play kind of “I’m on them bars” (xans) like they now and laters (candy)", "annotation_id": "37869440", "url": "https://genius.com/37869440", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Jingle Bells", "line": "Send the police up to my place, by the next day, your daddy dead, mm-mm", "vault_lines": ["Send the police up to my place, by the next day, your daddy dead, mm-mm"], "meaning": "this is a diss to one of his baby mamas. (Arcola whatever her name is diss)", "annotation_id": "37869421", "url": "https://genius.com/37869421", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Jingle Bells", "line": "Them Goblins run down, now they aiming at your head, bitch, what you said?", "vault_lines": ["Them Goblins run down, now they aiming at your head, bitch, what you said?"], "meaning": "when he said “Goblins” he is talking about bway (his brother) gang.", "annotation_id": "37869412", "url": "https://genius.com/37869412", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
