{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Kamikaze", "line": "Young nigga live like kamikaze, might die to get you murked", "vault_lines": ["Young nigga live like kamikaze, might die to get you murked"], "meaning": "The Kamikaze crew were Japanese fighter pilots in World War II who would intentionally crash into the enemy targets and bases to kill the enemy while also killing themselves for their country.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SM2esx5Ov5g&ab_channel=BritishPath%C3%A9\n\nHere, YoungBoy Never Broke Again explains how his crew will sacrifice their lives to kill their opposition—all while intertwining it with the World War II fighters.\n\nBeatrice Garland’s poem “Kamikaze” further explains the war crew and their sacrifices.", "annotation_id": "26451125", "url": "https://genius.com/26451125", "state": "accepted", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Kamikaze", "line": "Look, niggas cliquin’ up like hoes, huh", "vault_lines": ["Look, niggas cliquin' up like hoes, huh"], "meaning": "Here, YoungBoy Never Broke Again is most likely referring to his and Quando Rondo’s altercation with the late King Von and Lil Durk causing a violent divide in the rap industry.\n\nOn November 6, 2020, King Von was shot and killed outside of an Atlanta nightclub by Quando and YoungBoy’s close friend and affiliate, Lul Timm causing a split in the industry due to artists choosing sides between NBA YoungBoy and Lil Durk.\n\nIn early 2022, the situation was more prominently spoken on by both YoungBoy and Durk in their music, especially in “I Hate YoungBoy,” YB’s response to Durk’s “AHHH HA.” In the diss-track, YoungBoy made it clear that he doesn’t appreciate artists in the industry such as Gucci Mane and Lil Baby for picking Durk’s side despite their history together, all while encouraging artists to pick a side.", "annotation_id": "26450942", "url": "https://genius.com/26450942", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
