{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Kentucky St.", "line": "Early morning on Kentucky St., shots fired Niggas say that I was dead, but I didn’t die", "vault_lines": ["Niggas say that I was dead, but I didn’t die"], "meaning": "Referring to the incident, where he had tried to allegedly, retaliate for his cousin, Boozilla, and was rumored that YoungBoy was the one who got shot in his neck.\n\nhttps://www.wafb.com/story/34016597/teen-rapper-nba-youngboy-arrested-for-case-connected-to-series-of-shootings-in-br-neighborhood/", "annotation_id": "40203899", "url": "https://genius.com/40203899", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
