{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Know Like I Know", "line": "What she say? What she say, she say ”Big 4L”? (Lil Top) Ayy, ayy, I ain’t even finna get on your ass", "vault_lines": ["Ayy, ayy, I ain't even finna get on your ass"], "meaning": "https://youtu.be/xUhX7Vz9ywk?t=25\nThis was a shot at King Von’s sister Kayla B who felt some way after hearing the song. In response to the song Kayla sent out multiple tweets going at Kentrell.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/6D5cIZ2BPbY?t=11", "annotation_id": "25000006", "url": "https://genius.com/25000006", "state": "pending", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Know Like I Know", "line": "I don’t give a fuck, my nigga, just like your friend, you’ll bite the dust, nigga", "vault_lines": ["I don't give a fuck, my nigga, just like your friend, you'll bite the dust, nigga"], "meaning": "This is another diss to NLE Choppa on this song, while also being another sneak diss to King Von, who was friends with NLE. YoungBoy is saying just like Von, who died after an altercation with Quando Rondo, NLE could face the same fate.", "annotation_id": "24940681", "url": "https://genius.com/24940681", "state": "pending", "votes": 24, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Know Like I Know", "line": "I don’t give a fuck ‘bout how you treat your body, give a fuck about your cleanin’", "vault_lines": ["I don't give a fuck 'bout how you treat your body, give a fuck about your cleanin'"], "meaning": "NLE Choppa underwent a spiritual awakening in mid-2020, and preached about cleaning his body and eating healthy.", "annotation_id": "24920147", "url": "https://genius.com/24920147", "state": "pending", "votes": 40, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Know Like I Know", "line": "I bet your mama be destroyed, nigga When we send your stupid ass to God For makin’ statements, choosin’ sides About my beef with them lil’ boys I could say I saw it, you could say I was your favorite, nigga", "vault_lines": ["For makin' statements, choosin' sides", "About my beef with them lil' boys", "I could say I saw it, you could say I was your favorite, nigga"], "meaning": "NBA YoungBoy is referring to NLE Choppa and his comments made pertaining to the ongoing beef between YoungBoy and Lil Durk, warning him of potential consequences, if he doesn’t stay out of it.\n\nNLE’s mother Angela Potts is NLE’s manager, which makes NLE the “product” or breadwinner for the two considering his huge successes since blowing up. YoungBoy uses this to say if NLE gets killed she’d hit rock bottom in the business on top of the loss of her son, essentially as he said, she’d be destroyed.\n\nNLE Choppa and his mother Angela Potts\nRight after that, YoungBoy calls out NLE Choppa again, this time for tweeting a response to Lil Reese’s tweet,\n\nhttps://twitter.com/LilReese300/status/1481380110137794566?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\n\nwhere he was replying to DJ Akademiks saying YB was on demon time in his previous track “Bring The Hook,” where he dissed the late King Von with the line,\n\nNigga, this that Squid Game, O'Block pack get rolled up\nMurder what they told us, Atlanta boy get fold up\n\n Leading to NLE, marking his approval of Lil Reese’s response.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/nlechoppa1/status/1481438175776030720?lang=enas\n\nEnding the lyrical assault, NBA Youngboy lets NLE Choppa know that he doesn’t care if he’s his favorite or not, he could still get hurt from this beef. NLE has stated that YoungBoy was his favorite rapper on multiple occasions, even going as far as to make a song called “Free Youngboy” back in 2019.", "annotation_id": "24920137", "url": "https://genius.com/24920137", "state": "accepted", "votes": 74, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
