{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "L.O.V.E.H.A.T.E", "line": "A piece of shit, I hate myself, but make sure my wife want for nothin’ (Nah)", "vault_lines": ["A piece of shit, I hate myself, but make sure my wife want for nothin' (Nah)"], "meaning": "“A piece of ****, I hate myself, but make sure my wife won’t for nothin'”\n\nWhile YoungBoy feels terrible about himself and feel he’s not good for anything, he wants to make sure his wife won’t for anything she does in life.", "annotation_id": "39959739", "url": "https://genius.com/39959739", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
