{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "LED My Lights (LED Lights)", "line": "Less too much", "vault_lines": ["I had to reread my receipt (Reread my—), I told the jeweler, \"Less too much\""], "meaning": "suggests that simplicity, minimalism, or doing less can result in higher quality, reduced stress, and increased efficiency, defying the desire for excess.", "annotation_id": "38720720", "url": "https://genius.com/38720720", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "LED My Lights (LED Lights)", "line": "Bruh drop off 450 CC, the car shop with my bike", "vault_lines": ["Bruh drop off 450 CC, the car shop with my bike"], "meaning": "CC” stands for Cubic Centimeters and refers to the engine displacement of a motorcycle. It represents the total volume of air and fuel that the engine’s cylinders can hold, playing a crucial role in determining the bike’s power, speed, and performance.", "annotation_id": "38260320", "url": "https://genius.com/38260320", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "LED My Lights (LED Lights)", "line": "Security invoiced ninety-thousand, bitch, you playin’ with my money?", "vault_lines": ["Security invoiced ninety-thousand, bitch, you playin' with my money?"], "meaning": "An invoice scam occurs when a threat actor sends you a fake invoice, attempting to trick you into seeking a refund for a product or service you never paid for. The scammer often impersonates a legitimate payment or document service to make the invoice appear credible.", "annotation_id": "38260313", "url": "https://genius.com/38260313", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
