{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Letter to Big Dump", "line": "Givin’ all this shit back to my city and they system plannin’ to kill me, it’s a dirty world", "vault_lines": ["Givin' all this shit back to my city and they system plannin' to kill me, it's a dirty world"], "meaning": "Regardless to how YoungBoy was back in his section, he tries to pay back for his actions, just like how sometimes you wanna pay for you sins for doing good deeds like, helping those who counted on you, helping homeless people, etc.\n\nBut his city trying to build a case that YoungBoy might have a relation in, which could put him into prison for life.", "annotation_id": "39256526", "url": "https://genius.com/39256526", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
