{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Life", "line": "Been through some shit I had it hard, no I ain’t lying", "vault_lines": ["Been through some shit I had it hard, no I ain't lying"], "meaning": "he had it hella hard as a youngin, his own cousins passing, grandma, family problems , financially, close friends passing, just to much he had to deal with, that’s why most of the time you can see him taking stuff to calm down, all yb fans still care and show love for him no matter what, they care bout him truly and have been telling him to not over do it.", "annotation_id": "35122823", "url": "https://genius.com/35122823", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Life", "line": "This shit got crazy when Lil Dave died", "vault_lines": ["This shit got crazy when Lil Dave died"], "meaning": "Lil dave also known as “David cobb” was nba youngboy cousin and was close to yb , he thought him everything needed in this life that he is now looking at yb happy he made it, he died in a gun shooting and was held a memorial, By journalist “Naomi Martin” She made a journal entry, on 7/29/10, she stated ,\n\n“David Cobb, 16, was shot during a party at a BREC park on Woodpecker Street on March 27, 2010. A fight broke out and bullets started flying, one of which hit Cobb in his spine. He later died in a hospital.\n\nThe party had attracted hundreds of people over several hours, Gertrude Cobb said. Despite the potential for eyewitnesses, the case has gone cold in the Baton Rouge Police Department’s file.\n\n“There were too many people out there not to know what happened,” Cobb said, her voice breaking.”\n\nYoungboy has ton of released and unreleased songs that mention him, such as a unreleased one name “RIP LIL DAVE” All of his songs show how much he meant to him as a early beginning of his life in baton rouge .", "annotation_id": "35122788", "url": "https://genius.com/35122788", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
