{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Life Support", "line": "Comme des Garçons", "vault_lines": ["Comme des Garçons, she say she like on me"], "meaning": "Comme des Garçons, also CDG for short, is a Japanese fashion label based in Paris, founded by Rei Kawakubo. Its French flagship store is located in Paris, while its other physical retail stores are in London, Berlin, Melbourne, Seoul, Hong Kong, New York City and in the Aoyama district of Tokyo.", "annotation_id": "32884465", "url": "https://genius.com/32884465", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
