{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Lights Go Down", "line": "’Cause when it’s down, even, and up, it’s still murder, nigga (Murder)", "vault_lines": ["'Cause when it's down even and up it's still murder, nigga (Murder)"], "meaning": "Even when we’re down on the score, even, or up, it’ll always still be murder in the streets. Score is the count of how many people died on both sides. And side by side like a scoreboard, they keep count of who all scored (got killed) on each side.", "annotation_id": "41513097", "url": "https://genius.com/41513097", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
