{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Like Me", "line": "I go to Houston just to fuck with Johnny", "vault_lines": ["I go to Houston just to fuck with Johnny"], "meaning": "NBA Youngboy is talking about Johnny Dang, a popular celebrity jeweler from Houston, known especially for his grills among other jewelry. Here is a pic of “TV Johnny” holding Terror Squad chains made for Fat Joe and his crew.", "annotation_id": "10831394", "url": "https://genius.com/10831394", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
