{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Lil Top", "line": "(Khris James, what the fuck?)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "This is the producer tag of Khris James, who is a rising rapper, producer, and engineer from Baton Rouge, Louisiana.\n\nKhris is a long time producer for NBA Youngboy with him producing songs such as “No Mentions”, “I Admit”, & “Umm Hmm”, amongst others.", "annotation_id": "35733104", "url": "https://genius.com/35733104", "state": "accepted", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Lil Top", "line": "I say this new Bentley a go-kart, drive this bitch like Herbie", "vault_lines": ["I say this new Bentley a go-kart, drive this bitch like Herbie"], "meaning": "NBA Youngboy draws a similie between his rolls royce to the famous “Herbie Volkswagen Beetle,” a vehicle popularized by it’s guest appearance in the Disney movie “Herbie: The Love Bug.”", "annotation_id": "29291689", "url": "https://genius.com/29291689", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Lil Top", "line": "I came through, I was swervin’", "vault_lines": ["I just threw one of them thangs back, I came through, I was swervin'"], "meaning": "This line interpolates “I Came Thru,“ Youngboy’s 2018 song where he raps:\n\n“Nigga, I came through swervin'\nI was thuggin', gettin' loaded, gettin' dirty.”", "annotation_id": "29291664", "url": "https://genius.com/29291664", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Lil Top", "line": "I just pulled up in that black Maybach, you can’t see in (Skrrt)", "vault_lines": ["I just pulled up in that black Maybach, you can't see in (Skrrt)"], "meaning": "Maybach Motorenbau is a German car brand that today exists as a part of Mercedes-Benz. With a starting price of over $170,000, it counts as a luxury car today.\n\nYoungboy is saying that no one can see him because he’s riding in a dark coloured maybach", "annotation_id": "19673474", "url": "https://genius.com/19673474", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
