{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Lo", "line": "I took off his mind, this pussy-ass nigga was focused on rappin’,", "vault_lines": ["I took off his mind, this pussy-ass nigga was focused on rappin', ha, ha, slime"], "meaning": "Even though YoungBoy himself is a rapper he takes pride in the fact that he will shoot off his opposition who are too focused on rapping. YoungBoy is implying that he has never solely focused on the rap game, rather he is focused on other things such as having as many kids as humanely possible.", "annotation_id": "37357384", "url": "https://genius.com/37357384", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Lo", "line": "And ain’t no trippin’ ’bout no friends just like I lean on me (Lean)", "vault_lines": ["And ain't no trippin' 'bout no friends just like I lean on me"], "meaning": "YoungBoy uses a double entendre here. He is referring to the infamous drink “lean”, he states that he keeps the lean on him implying that he is still a useless junkie. YoungBoy also states that he is not worried about his lack of friends to lean on, rather he can rely on himself and keep his own ground.", "annotation_id": "37357374", "url": "https://genius.com/37357374", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
