{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Lose Me", "line": "Suicidal, kamikaze, bitch, forever I’m thuggin’", "vault_lines": ["Suicidal, kamikaze, bitch, forever I'm thuggin'"], "meaning": "Being risky and willing to take on something that can affect them, possibly taking their life aswell.\n\nIn a way, this just means someone risks themselves in a way to gain or lose something, no matter the consequence or state it can put themselves in.", "annotation_id": "39255232", "url": "https://genius.com/39255232", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Lose Me", "line": "I been roamin’ round them trenches where they don’t show no love", "vault_lines": ["I been roamin' round them trenches where they don't show no love"], "meaning": "It depends where your from, but there is often places where everyone gets this mindset of not helping others or really talking them. It’s more often of a ego since everyone wouldn’t have enough money, so they focus a lot on themselves rather  than to care about someone.", "annotation_id": "39255215", "url": "https://genius.com/39255215", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
