{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Lost Brotha (Hard Knock)", "line": "Run up, you gon’ feel that fire Sit that boy face on the side (Bitch) Fuck that boy with all that rappin’, pussy-bitch, I don’t never stop (Bitch, I don’t never stop)", "vault_lines": ["Run up, you gon’ feel that fire", "Sit that boy face on the side", "Fuck that boy with all that rappin’"], "meaning": "“Run up, you gon' feel that fire / Sit that boy face on the side,” meaning if Jay runs up on YB, he will get shot up by YoungBoy and YB will leave his shot-up body on the side of the pavement.\n\n“Fuck that boy with all that rappin', pussy-bitch, I don’t never stop (Bitch, I don’t never stop)” YB is dismissing JayDaYoungan and all the diss songs he was making, essentially saying, “Fuck you and your rapping—I’m not stopping.” By “I don’t never stop,” YB is saying JayDaYoungan’s dissing doesn’t scare him, and neither Jay nor his gang will make him back down. He’s saying he will keep targeting them until they’re all dead.", "annotation_id": "41618871", "url": "https://genius.com/41618871", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Lost Brotha (Hard Knock)", "line": "Make sure you take off his top (Huh?)", "vault_lines": ["Make sure you take off his top, this that life of a hard knock"], "meaning": "Another diss toward JayDaYoungan. YB is telling his members to make sure they kill him when they see him.", "annotation_id": "41618858", "url": "https://genius.com/41618858", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Lost Brotha (Hard Knock)", "line": "And that’s on Dump, bitch, I’ma make his mama cry (And that’s on Dump) And we gon’ hang his ass just like he up in trial (Gang) Son on the way, I bet the bitch won’t see his child (For my man’s) We catch the bitch, we let the Draco hit until it click, nigga (Bah)", "vault_lines": ["And we gon’ hang his ass just like he up in trial", "Son on the way, I bet the bitch won’t see his child (For my mans)", "We catch the bitch, we let the Draco hit until it click, nigga"], "meaning": "A diss toward JayDaYounngan, with YB threatening to make Jay’s mother cry by killing him. “Hang his ass just like he up in trial” is a violent play on the language of a trial: “hang” evokes execution by hanging, while “trial” connects to the phrase “hung jury,” giving the line a double meaning.\n\nThe next lines make the diss more specific. At the time this song was recorded, JayDaYoungan had a son on the way. YB says, “Son on the way, I bet the bitch won’t see his child,” implying that if they caught Jay before his son was born, they would kill him before he could meet his child. He then says, “We catch the bitch, we let the Draco hit until it click,” meaning they would shoot him with a Draco until the gun stops firing/clicks, implying the magazine had been emptied.", "annotation_id": "41618714", "url": "https://genius.com/41618714", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
