{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Louie V", "line": "And I don’t give not one fuck ’bout what these niggas think at all", "vault_lines": ["And I don't give not one fuck 'bout what these niggas think at all (Nah)"], "meaning": "Since the start of his career YoungBoy has displayed his unbothered character.\n\nAround 2018 when he barely had any industry support and was highly hated online he grew to not care about critics. He does not own any social media except his Instagram account (which is most of the time deactivated) which could be a result of him being tired of online critics and drama.\n\nLately he is embracing being different and openly talks about being outside the industry.\n\nThis line more specifically refers to him not caring about peoples’ thoughts on his new style, for instance him wearing black nail polish.", "annotation_id": "27516031", "url": "https://genius.com/27516031", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
