{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Love Is Poison", "line": "CashMoneyAP", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "It’s a beat Tag from a French record producer ALEX CHRISTIAN JEAN PETITE known as “CashMoneyAP”\nHis name originates from the name of the label CASH MONEY RECORDS  and his initials (“AP” ALEX PETITE).\n\nHe started by producing “type beats” in YouTube, Till now AP has produced beats for artists such as Roddy Ricch, Lil Skies, Gucci Mane, NLE Choppa, Megan, Lil Tjay, YoungBoyNBA and more.", "annotation_id": "29987126", "url": "https://genius.com/29987126", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
