{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mask On", "line": "Put that boy on a shelf", "vault_lines": ["Hall of fame, for real, highlight with the steel, yeah, put that boy on a shelf (Shelf)"], "meaning": "Referring to a cremation, usually after someone is cremated their ashes are put in a container or vase on a shelf somewhere in a house.", "annotation_id": "22911346", "url": "https://genius.com/22911346", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mask On", "line": "That Drac’, it need a drum up under", "vault_lines": ["That Drac', it need a drum up under"], "meaning": "Youngboy is saying that if he has a Draco (AK-47) he needs a drum magazine with it. Usually these magazines hold anywhere from 50 to 100 rounds in them.", "annotation_id": "22911335", "url": "https://genius.com/22911335", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
