{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mask and Gloves", "line": "Rappin’-ass nigga, I ain’t got no lyrics, old weird-ass boy, I’m a realicist", "vault_lines": ["Rappin'-ass nigga, I ain't got no lyrics, old weird-ass boy, I'm a realicist"], "meaning": "3rd nle diss", "annotation_id": "41213343", "url": "https://genius.com/41213343", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mask and Gloves", "line": "Criss-cross applesauce, make a bitch sit down, old pussy-ass boy, you a nemesis", "vault_lines": ["Criss-cross applesauce, make a bitch sit down, old pussy-ass boy, you a nemesis"], "meaning": "nle diss again", "annotation_id": "41213338", "url": "https://genius.com/41213338", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mask and Gloves", "line": "My gun jammed, I started runnin’, AJ tried put that bitch up on me (Oh, oh)", "vault_lines": ["My gun jammed, I started runnin', AJ tried put that bitch up on me (Oh, oh)"], "meaning": "YoungBoy recounts a chaotic street shootout where his weapon malfunctioned, prompting his close friend AJ to step in and try passing him a different gun (referred to as “that bitch”) so he could keep firing. This visceral memory serves as a grim tribute to AJ, whose life was tragically cut short in August 2018. Following a YoungBoy concert in Austin, Texas, AJ was fatally shot by local police who alleged he was running through an alley with a handgun a devastating loss that YB has heavily mourned throughout his career.", "annotation_id": "38740877", "url": "https://genius.com/38740877", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mask and Gloves", "line": "Know I’ma hit they phone up like, “Pick your partner up” when we walk him down", "vault_lines": ["Know I'ma hit they phone up like, \"Pick your partner up\" when we walk him down"], "meaning": "In street terminology, “walking someone down” refers to pursuing an enemy on foot to shoot them at close range, guaranteeing a fatal hit rather than relying on a less accurate drive-by. YoungBoy escalates the disrespect here by claiming he’ll literally call the victim’s crew right after the deed is done, morbidly taunting them to come collect their friend’s body off the pavement. This kind of post-hit psychological warfare perfectly captures the ruthless, deeply personal nature of the feuds he frequently documents in his music.", "annotation_id": "38740863", "url": "https://genius.com/38740863", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mask and Gloves", "line": "Niggas know how I get when I’m fiendin’, I’m a demon, they just leave me ’lone", "vault_lines": ["Niggas know how I get when I'm fiendin', I'm a demon, they just leave me 'lone"], "meaning": "When he’s in that mindset, he feels uncontrollable. Calling himself a “demon” is him saying he moves reckless and people know not to test him.", "annotation_id": "38740773", "url": "https://genius.com/38740773", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mask and Gloves", "line": "Okay, I got one more pussy bitch just for to kill behind Lil Dave Once it’s still, this shit get sealed, then I’m gon’ take it to my grave", "vault_lines": ["Okay, I got one more pussy bitch just for to kill behind Lil Dave", "Once it's still, this shit get sealed, then I'm gon' take it to my grave"], "meaning": "He said “Once instilled, this shit get sealed, then I’m gon' take it to my grave,” meaning once he kills the anonymous behind his deceased friend Lil Dave, everything will be instilled (sort of established), sealed (closing that rivalry for good), and he’s going to keep that secret with him ‘til his death.", "annotation_id": "38437733", "url": "https://genius.com/38437733", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
