{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mistakes", "line": "Gotta think smart about these chances I take Thug with my niggas, separate from the fake", "vault_lines": ["Thug with my niggas, separate from the fake"], "meaning": "Youngboy relates to taking smart choices, we’re as in we think of the consequences with risks and the benefits, it is the major factor of success. He thugs, which can be interpreted as he makes a smart choice of interacting with his true close people, excluding from those who aren’t trustworthy, and not loyal to him but fake. Thugging/thug could also mean another term.", "annotation_id": "34551789", "url": "https://genius.com/34551789", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
