{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mr Gaulden", "line": "They been tryna find out where you been, Mr. Gaulden", "vault_lines": ["They been tryna find out where you been, Mr. Gaulden"], "meaning": "As to this, NBA Young boy has been absent from instagram ever since he’s been into it with the law & he rarely is seen to have his own personal page up for everyone to monitor, which brings up the question… “ where you been, Mr. Gaulden “ ? It’s also a callback reference to lil Wayne’s song, Mr.Carter by Lil Wayne.", "annotation_id": "28342538", "url": "https://genius.com/28342538", "state": "pending", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
