{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mr. Crazy", "line": "I was sippin’ fours on some 4s on some caret plates", "vault_lines": ["I was sippin' fours on some 4s on some caret plates"], "meaning": "“Sippin' four”: Drinking four ounces of lean.\n\n“On some 4s”: Riding on massive 24-inch custom rims.\n\n“On some carat plates”: He is talking about diamond-encrusted center caps or faceplates on his rims. “Carat” refers to the diamond weight, and “plates” refers to the heavy metal/chrome face or custom inserts of the wheels. – Gemini AI", "annotation_id": "40429432", "url": "https://genius.com/40429432", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
