{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mr. Grim Reaper", "line": "Lil Tug died", "vault_lines": ["Boozila died, Lil Tug died"], "meaning": "Tug was a friend of Youngboys along side Jordan, and has been referenced in a handful of songs such as Hold me down\n\n“I’m with Jordan, my lil' partner, skippin' school for to watch us\nMe and Tug in the Nawf, ain’t a dime in our pocket\nBut now both of them dead and it fuck with my head”\n- Hold Me Down – Youngboy Never Broke Again – Sincerely, Kentrell", "annotation_id": "26456486", "url": "https://genius.com/26456486", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mr. Grim Reaper", "line": "AJ", "vault_lines": ["AJ and Three got shot but only one is still alive"], "meaning": "AJ was friend of Youngboy and apart of BBG a group affiliated with NBA, he was shot by police in 2018 at one of Youngboys shows in Texas. Police claim he charged at them with a weapon.", "annotation_id": "26456479", "url": "https://genius.com/26456479", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
