{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mr. Grim Reaper", "line": "But I’m like Mr. Grim Reaper (Mr. Grim Reaper) I do not mean to disturb your time (Your time) I just wan’ ask you, “Can you leave my family out?” (Family) You got it hard and most of all my niggas laying up in a graveyard", "vault_lines": ["I do not mean to disturb your time (Your time)", "I just wan' ask you, \"Can you leave my family out?\" (Family)", "You got it hard and most of all my niggas laying up in a graveyard"], "meaning": "youngboy asks the grim reaper to leave his family out of the reaping (don’t let them die)", "annotation_id": "25858926", "url": "https://genius.com/25858926", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
