{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Mr. Grim Reaper", "line": "Father, I am a shotta, got bodies to show for it So please forgive your son ’cause I know where I’m going", "vault_lines": ["So please forgive your son 'cause I know where I'm going"], "meaning": "Father is another way to address god. This is  Youngboy saying that he has killed people and sinned and is asking for forgiveness before he goes to hell.", "annotation_id": "25233750", "url": "https://genius.com/25233750", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
