{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Ms. Alinda", "line": "’Cause you can upgrade from any person or situation", "vault_lines": ["'Cause you can upgrade from any person or situation"], "meaning": "You can improve from something in your life, specifically affecting you and how you think with the new knowledge. Just like how if people in love don’t end up working or end in bad or good terms, you learn a valuable lesson such as knowing how love works and how you can do it for the next person. Or maybe you get fired from your job or you are in a financially responsible state, you are able to learn and make sure to not cause those mistakes again, maybe even in sports where you don’t perform well and learn you can’t let yourself down and make sure to train.\n\nBasically any event on how we feel and think helps us learn to not do the same mistakes and knowing what to do for the next time with the newer knowledge", "annotation_id": "35102021", "url": "https://genius.com/35102021", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
