{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Address Public", "line": "Tell him that I’m on ’em", "vault_lines": ["Tell him that I'm on 'em, my address public"], "meaning": "DJ Akademiks asked Durk to mediate and help repair his own relationship with YoungBoy on a 2023 episode of Off The Record with DJ Akademiks.\n\nDurk’s answer, “Who? Gimme the address,” reframed that mediation request as something closer to a threat than a favor. YoungBoy takes that and flips it back at him: he uses Akademiks the same way Akademiks was used as a go-between in the original exchange, telling him to relay to Durk that he’s already aware and moving on him.\n\nThe hook’s next line, “my address public,” is the direct inversion of Durk’s ask: instead of the address being leverage against him, he publicizes it himself and strips it of the threat.", "annotation_id": "41233171", "url": "https://genius.com/41233171", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Address Public", "line": "My address public", "vault_lines": ["Tеll him that I'm on 'em, my address public"], "meaning": "his address got leaked and hes telling his opps to o come if they really bout that", "annotation_id": "39426807", "url": "https://genius.com/39426807", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Address Public", "line": "Tell ’em that I’m slime", "vault_lines": ["Who that is that's callin'? Tell 'em that I'm slime"], "meaning": "YB said “Tell ‘em that I’m snappin’” https://m.youtube.com/shorts/n8nFdlzYdLw", "annotation_id": "34196563", "url": "https://genius.com/34196563", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Address Public", "line": "Two-four-seven gettin’ it, I been tryna make a way", "vault_lines": ["Two-four-seven gettin' it, I been tryna make a way"], "meaning": "He’s saying he getting that money 24/7 no days off", "annotation_id": "33763079", "url": "https://genius.com/33763079", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Address Public", "line": "Friends posted some years later, I’m happy who ain’t fuck with me And bitch, you better not fuck with me, you know I got this gun on me, hmm", "vault_lines": ["Friends posted some years later, I'm happy who ain't fuck with me", "And bitch, you better not fuck with me, you know I got this gun on me, hmm"], "meaning": "Youngboy is now thankful for the friends who never believed in him and tells them I stay on that side", "annotation_id": "32700756", "url": "https://genius.com/32700756", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Address Public", "line": "M a savage like my daddy, I get active, yeah, you heard me", "vault_lines": ["I'm a savage like my daddy, I get active, yeah, you heard me"], "meaning": "YBs Father is currently serving a 52 year sentence in prison", "annotation_id": "32700728", "url": "https://genius.com/32700728", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Address Public", "line": "Poured up off that codeine, I’m strapped, I’m movin’ slowly", "vault_lines": ["Poured up off that codeine, I'm strapped, I'm movin' slowly"], "meaning": "‘moving slowly’ (feeling drowsy or tired) is common effect from taking codeine .\nEspecially when it’s taken in form of “lean”\nThis is a drink that rappers have clinged on to", "annotation_id": "30535944", "url": "https://genius.com/30535944", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
