{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Body", "line": "I just wonder, is this really real or you got somebody teachin’ you?", "vault_lines": ["I just wonder, is this really real or you got somebody teachin' you?"], "meaning": "Like if there’s someone else that also loves them, basically if she’s experienced cause there’s someone fucking with her too.", "annotation_id": "39554753", "url": "https://genius.com/39554753", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Body", "line": "Why you keep me ’round and you feel like I ain’t shit to you? And you knowin’ that my love rare, you just treat it like it’s beneful", "vault_lines": ["Why you keep me 'round and you feel like I ain't shit to you?", "And you knowin' that my love rare, you just treat it like it's beneful"], "meaning": "why tf you using me for my materials and not my heart fool🤦🏽‍♂️", "annotation_id": "37850324", "url": "https://genius.com/37850324", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Body", "line": "Out the blue, you get a cold stare, when I think of shit, I sing to you", "vault_lines": ["Out the blue, you get a cold stare, when I think of shit, I sing to you"], "meaning": "Yb makes lots of songs about females. His lady likely heard the painful lyrics he wrote for her, didn’t think much of it, then later realized what he was trying to say. This is common among youngboy songs, a deeper message beneath the lyrics", "annotation_id": "37850302", "url": "https://genius.com/37850302", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Body", "line": "Tell me if you love somebody, I do Tell me if you for somebody, I don’t know She don’t really love my body, oh, no She just wanna keep me from somebody, I know", "vault_lines": ["Tell me if you love somebody, I do", "Tell me if you for somebody, I don't know", "She don't really love my body, oh, no", "She just wanna keep me from somebody, I know"], "meaning": "Maybe she love me, maybe she don’t. What we do know is that Youngboy struggles with trust, that’s why he asks these questions, to verify that love. Youngboy never had that strong supportive love, he got fake love growing up; being a famous rapper didn’t make it better. He isn’t sure what his shorty wants, and he can’t see through his old trauma to figure it out", "annotation_id": "37850280", "url": "https://genius.com/37850280", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Body", "line": "Got that Xanax yesterday, ran out by this morning", "vault_lines": ["Got that Xanax yesterday, ran out by this morning"], "meaning": "Xanax is an antidepressant, as shown by the lyrics he’s hurting and has been hurting for a while. This song was made during his K2 era, when he was heavily under the influence of drugs. Here he references a drug related to his current emotions, pain and heartbreak.", "annotation_id": "37850269", "url": "https://genius.com/37850269", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Body", "line": "Somehow, you made me complete, but I’m scared of you havin’ my heart", "vault_lines": ["Somehow, you made me complete, but I'm scared of you havin' my heart"], "meaning": "While this is a very deep statement, there’s 1 clear meaning behind this.\n\nBefore all the gang shit youngboy did, he was a child, just like we all were; grew up poor and lived with his grandmama. When his grandma suffered a heart attack, it drove him insane. For real, all youngboy wanted was to be loved by someone like his grandmama loved him, but nobody gave him that. Every time the hoes would just break his heart. Now his new shorty, he sees the love he’s needed all this time but he doesn’t want to get hurt again.", "annotation_id": "37850245", "url": "https://genius.com/37850245", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Body", "line": "Fuck around and catch me in that Rolls with some tissue", "vault_lines": ["Fuck around and catch me in that Rolls with some tissue"], "meaning": "Here youngboy is discussing one of the most brought up topics among his song; Money, but for what? In songs like Dangerous Love he delves deeper, all this money but his heart never healed from his trauma.", "annotation_id": "37850236", "url": "https://genius.com/37850236", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Body", "line": "You don’t have to think again, I’m all for you Deeply love you and I miss you, I miss touchin’, I miss fuckin’ And I tatted up my face again, I’m already ugly And you my bitch, you pretty, I don’t want you in public", "vault_lines": ["You don't have to think again, I'm all for you", "Deeply love you and I miss you, I miss touchin', I miss fuckin'", "And I tatted up my face again, I'm already ugly", "And you my bitch, you pretty, I don't want you in public"], "meaning": "it means he love you", "annotation_id": "32260552", "url": "https://genius.com/32260552", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
