{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Brothers", "line": "In the streets, it’s any way it can go And I’ll be patiently waitin’ right here with my pole until you call my phone", "vault_lines": ["And I'll be patiently waitin' right here with my pole until you call my phone"], "meaning": "YB acknowledges how when in this street life, anything can happen, whether it’s good or bad. And is talking to God when he says that last line, telling God he will be patiently waiting to go to Heaven when God is ready for him while outside toting on a gun of his own.", "annotation_id": "40702824", "url": "https://genius.com/40702824", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
