{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Grave", "line": "Tell ’em all this shit that’s on my mind, they’ll make me out a patient", "vault_lines": ["Tell 'em all this shit that's on my mind, they'll make me out a patient"], "meaning": "All of the stuff that be going through YB’s mind will make people think that he’s mentally ill with all of his insane thoughts running around.", "annotation_id": "38859314", "url": "https://genius.com/38859314", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Grave", "line": "Feet came from Loub’", "vault_lines": ["Feet came from Loub', ain't no rollin' in no honorable, keep guns like the troop"], "meaning": "“Loub’” = Christian Louboutin shoes (luxury). He’s mixing fashion flex with street code, saying even in expensive stuff, he isn’t “honorable” in a soft way  he still keeps it militant.", "annotation_id": "38384114", "url": "https://genius.com/38384114", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Grave", "line": "I can let you have a peak, this plan ain’t never gon’ be beat", "vault_lines": ["I can let you have a peak, this plan ain't never gon' be beat"], "meaning": "He’s saying people can see the outline but not the full strategy. “Peak” (peek) is a slick phrasing letting someone glimpse it without ever catching up.", "annotation_id": "38384102", "url": "https://genius.com/38384102", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Grave", "line": "It’s gon’ be a holiday the day I fuckin’ leave", "vault_lines": ["It's gon' be a holiday the day I fuckin' leave"], "meaning": "This is bleak: he imagines his death like an event day. It could mean his opps will celebrate or that he’ll finally get peace both readings fit his tone, and the lyric leaves it open.", "annotation_id": "38384092", "url": "https://genius.com/38384092", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Grave", "line": "In a 911, this my memory of the Twin Towers", "vault_lines": ["In a 911, this my memory of the Twin Towers"], "meaning": "911 is a Porsche model, but it’s also emergency slang tied to 9/11. He connects riding in a “911” to the Twin Towers memory wordplay that mixes luxury flex with traumatic history.", "annotation_id": "38384068", "url": "https://genius.com/38384068", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Grave", "line": "Name engraved in the street", "vault_lines": ["I'm a real gang baby, name engraved in the street"], "meaning": "In Baton Rouge, Louisiana, 3800 Chippewa street, or 2801, “Nawf” 38th street where Youngboy grew up and people from that area knows about his old and rumoured crimes committed throughout the years.", "annotation_id": "38333333", "url": "https://genius.com/38333333", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Grave", "line": "Lil Dave", "vault_lines": ["Where the fuck been my Lil Dave? Why I'm talkin' and you don't talk back?"], "meaning": "David Cobb, who passed away in 2010, Youngboy’s cousin who died, but looks up to, retaliate, remembering, doing everything for him by mentioning him in songs.", "annotation_id": "38311325", "url": "https://genius.com/38311325", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Grave", "line": "Create that hate in me", "vault_lines": ["Or support me, that's that fake shit, create that hate in me"], "meaning": "people make you realise how much anger and hate can build up when people are just around leeching.\n\n as he mentions “Tryna take all of money, It’s always someone who ain’t pay shit” following up with no support by them being fake", "annotation_id": "38311277", "url": "https://genius.com/38311277", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
