{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Life I Apologize", "line": "I can’t make you out my wife", "vault_lines": ["I can't make you out my wife"], "meaning": "Basically, saying no matter how much his baby mamas love him & how much love he has for them. He can’t make them his wife. YB is married Jazz.", "annotation_id": "38323388", "url": "https://genius.com/38323388", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Life I Apologize", "line": "Somebody need to whoop my ass, just look at what I did to you", "vault_lines": ["Somebody need to whoop my ass, just look at what I did to you"], "meaning": "From this line, YB is living in regret as back in February 24, 2018. YoungBoy found himself barricaded in another legal dispute, stemming from an alleged report made by TMZ about a physical altercation between him and his now baby mother, Jania Jackson.", "annotation_id": "38304478", "url": "https://genius.com/38304478", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Life I Apologize", "line": "Kacey, can you put in a good word for me?", "vault_lines": ["Kacey, can you put in a good word for me?"], "meaning": "Kacey can you put in a good word for me.\n\nKacey is his son with social media influencer Jania Meshell. He’s asking his son to put in a good word for him with Jania so they could be good/together again.", "annotation_id": "38302482", "url": "https://genius.com/38302482", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Life I Apologize", "status": "done", "targets": 5, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Youngboy-never-broke-again-my-life-i-apologize-lyrics", "genius_title": "My Life I Apologize", "genius_id": 12980149, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Love", "line": "Blue face Rolly", "vault_lines": ["Ooh, blue face Rolly"], "meaning": "A “Blue-Faced Rolex” refers to a Rolex watch with a blue dial (the face of the watch). Rolex offers several models with blue dials, often considered stylish and luxurious. Blue dials can be found in various Rolex collections, including the Submariner, Datejust, Day-Date, and Oyster Perpetual, among others.\n\nThese watches are known for their precision, craftsmanship, and durability. The blue dial is often paired with different materials for the watch case and bracelet, such as stainless steel, gold, or platinum. The choice of a blue dial is typically for aesthetic preference, adding a distinct and elegant touch to the timepiece.", "annotation_id": "32319316", "url": "https://genius.com/32319316", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Love", "line": "’shrooms", "vault_lines": ["We got Percs, we got X, we got 'shrooms"], "meaning": "“Shrooms” is a common slang term for psilocybin mushrooms, which are fungi containing the psychedelic compounds psilocybin and psilocin. When ingested, these compounds can cause hallucinations, altered perceptions of time and space, and changes in thought and mood.\n\nPsilocybin mushrooms have been used historically in spiritual and religious rituals and are sometimes consumed recreationally for their mind-altering effects. The experience, often referred to as a “trip,” can vary greatly depending on the dose, the individual’s mental state, and the environment in which they are taken.\n\nWhile many users report profound and positive experiences, there are potential risks, including anxiety, paranoia, and, in some cases, psychotic episodes. The legality of psilocybin mushrooms varies by country and region, with many places classifying them as illegal substances.", "annotation_id": "32319310", "url": "https://genius.com/32319310", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Love", "line": "X", "vault_lines": ["We got Percs, we got X, we got 'shrooms"], "meaning": "“X” is a common slang term for MDMA (3,4-methylenedioxymethamphetamine), also known as ecstasy or molly. It is a synthetic drug that acts as a stimulant and hallucinogen, producing feelings of increased energy, pleasure, emotional warmth, and distorted sensory and time perception. MDMA is often used recreationally, especially in party and nightclub settings.\n\nWhile some users seek the euphoric effects, MDMA can have serious health risks, including dehydration, hyperthermia, heart problems, and serotonin syndrome. Long-term use can lead to cognitive deficits and mental health issues. Additionally, MDMA sold on the street can be adulterated with other harmful substances.", "annotation_id": "32319309", "url": "https://genius.com/32319309", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Love", "line": "Percs", "vault_lines": ["We got Percs, we got X, we got 'shrooms"], "meaning": "Percocets are a prescription medication that combines oxycodone, an opioid pain reliever, and acetaminophen, a non-opioid pain reliever. They are used to treat moderate to severe pain. Due to the presence of oxycodone, Percocets can be addictive and have a high potential for abuse and dependency. Common side effects include drowsiness, dizziness, constipation, and nausea. Misuse can lead to serious health issues, including overdose and death.", "annotation_id": "32319306", "url": "https://genius.com/32319306", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My Love", "line": "Push-start in the street", "vault_lines": ["Push-start in the street with a new rod, outside, firin' it"], "meaning": "This refers to a new car, as newer cars have push start engines instead of key turning.", "annotation_id": "32319304", "url": "https://genius.com/32319304", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
