{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "My’ya", "line": "Aw, damn, a nigga caught up, caught up in a two-way love affair", "vault_lines": ["Aw, damn, a nigga caught up, caught up in a two-way love affair"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is talking about being in love with Iyanna Mayweather (Yaya) & Jazlyn Mychelle at the same time\n\nYoungBoy is also referring to a famous line that goes like this\n\n“I’m trapped (Trapped)\nI’m caught up (Caught up)\nIn the middle of a 2 way love affair (In the middle of a 2 way love affair)”", "annotation_id": "36578876", "url": "https://genius.com/36578876", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
