{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Never Lie", "line": "Why I gotta fake my smile? Oh, she can’t see that I’m tryin’", "vault_lines": ["Why I gotta fake my smile? Oh, she can't see that I'm tryin'"], "meaning": "Youngboy is asking why he has to act happy in front of everyone but get questioned for it. This girl he’s talking about, can’t see that he is trying his best to be happy but she should know why he has to fake it.", "annotation_id": "26713114", "url": "https://genius.com/26713114", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
