{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Never Stopping", "line": "Oh, bitch, slow down, told her get her roll on Please don’t call YoungBoy phone, uh They thought the legal beat me, bitch, I’m rich, he can’t catch up", "vault_lines": ["Oh, bitch, slow down, told her get her roll on", "Please don't call YoungBoy phone, uh", "They thought the legal beat me, bitch, I'm rich, he can't catch up"], "meaning": "On the “Don’t call YoungBoy phone” line, he refers to his baby momma, I don’t know her name, but he gave her money for child support but she ain’t use it for that.", "annotation_id": "33978403", "url": "https://genius.com/33978403", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
