{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Never Stopping", "line": "The runnin’ man", "vault_lines": ["Get them bands and do the runnin' man, my bitch gon' bring my food, huh"], "meaning": "The Running Man dance is a move that creates the illusion of running in place. It became popular in the late 1980s and 1990s, particularly in hip-hop culture. The dancer alternates lifting their knees while sliding their feet back in a way that mimics a stationary running motion, often accompanied by arm movements that simulate running.", "annotation_id": "32048951", "url": "https://genius.com/32048951", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Never Stopping", "line": "Bitch just want my money, she ain’t gon’ spend it on my baby", "vault_lines": ["Bitch just want my money, she ain't gon' spend it on my baby"], "meaning": "The baby momma won’t use the child support money on the child.", "annotation_id": "32043891", "url": "https://genius.com/32043891", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
