{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Never Stopping", "line": "I’ll see some shit ’bout church on TV, then I turn it off I ain’t talkin’ money, I walk straight off, I ain’t tryna hear that at all", "vault_lines": ["I'll see some shit 'bout church on TV, then I turn it off", "I ain't talkin' money, I walk straight off, I ain't tryna hear that at all"], "meaning": "NBA YoungBoy turns off the TV because typically, the pastors and sermons on TV are hypocrites and are out for their congregation’s money\n\nJust as clarification for any future satanic allegations\n\nHe also says this about churches because he hasn’t been to one ever since his grandma passed away.", "annotation_id": "31052465", "url": "https://genius.com/31052465", "state": "pending", "votes": 19, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
