{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Nicki Minaj", "line": "When I turn into slime, she gon’ stop that When a nigga write her, she don’t write back Right here with her where the life at Statement on me, she ain’t type that", "vault_lines": ["When I turn into slime, she gon' stop that", "When a nigga write her, she don't write back"], "meaning": "Youngboy is saying that the woman of his dreams, which is a play on the rapper Nicki Manaj who he has openly fetishized in interviews jokingly, will calm him down when he gets angry (slime mode). He is also saying that the woman in question will not respond when men try to make advancements towards her. He wants a life where it’s just him and her chilling. Lastly, if there is an indictment or police statement written about him, he is certain she’s not the one that wrote it.", "annotation_id": "36885100", "url": "https://genius.com/36885100", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Nicki Minaj", "line": "When I go and I’m gone too long and if I don’t call Best believe she calling me She always gon’ go hard for me She don’t like when hoes be stalking me And she don’t never trip ’bout nothing if I don’t want talk She gonna tell stop calling me", "vault_lines": ["When I go and I'm gone too long and if I don't call", "Best believe she calling me", "She always gon' go hard for me", "She don't like when hoes be stalking me", "And she don't never trip 'bout nothing if I don't want talk", "She gonna tell stop calling me"], "meaning": "Youngboy is saying that when he’s on the road with his busy lifestyle, the love of his life or the woman that he’s hoping comes to find him will understand that and if he can’t call, she will call. He is also looking for someone that will be extremely aggressive about him and other women who are after him. Lastly, the dream woman of his is laid-back and when he is having a mood where he doesnt have the words to talk, she will tell him leave her alone and talk later.", "annotation_id": "36885062", "url": "https://genius.com/36885062", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Nicki Minaj", "line": "She gon’ fuck me better when she see I’m recording her", "vault_lines": ["She gon' fuck me better when she see I'm recording her"], "meaning": "vit pour les caméras", "annotation_id": "29200659", "url": "https://genius.com/29200659", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Nicki Minaj", "line": "She said that you for me, like I ain’t already for somebody (Already for somebody, yeah) But I responded and I told her I’m good, I’m hurt inside, I can’t trust nobody (Hurt, no, I can’t trust nobody) I need a girl who gon’ tell me that we good, hold me down and just show me how to love (Yeah) I need a woman who gon’ teach me how to do, when they come ’round, she don’t ever give a fuck, yeah [Chorus] Who will never leave me, always happy for her to see me Who will never mistreat me, entertain me like a TV One who adore me, go to war, do anything for me Always go hard for me, never lie, now that’s real loyalty", "vault_lines": ["I need a girl who gon' tell me that we good", "Hold me down and just show me how to love, yeah", "I need a woman who gon' teach me how to do", "When they come 'round she don't ever give a fuck, yeah"], "meaning": "she said that you for me\nLike I ain’t already for somebody (already for somebody, yeah)\nBut I responded and I told her I’m good\nI’m hurt inside, I can’t trust nobody\n(Hurt no I can’t trust nobody)\nI need a girl who gon' tell me that we good\nHold me down and just show me how to love (yeah)\nI need a woman who gon' teach me how to do\nWhen they come ‘round she don’t ever give a fuck, yeah\n\n[Chorus]\nWho will never leave me, always happy for her to see me\nWho will never mistreat me, entertain me like a TV\nOne who adore me, go to war do anything for me\nAlways go hard for me, never lie, now that’s real loyalty", "annotation_id": "24974756", "url": "https://genius.com/24974756", "state": "pending", "votes": -6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
