{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "No Sleep", "line": "That girl ain’t close to loyal, she fuck niggas that want me gone", "vault_lines": ["That girl ain't close to loyal, she fuck niggas that want me gone"], "meaning": "This is the relationship part. He feels that the girl isn’t loyal because she’s involved with people who actively dislike or oppose him. So to him, it’s not just cheating; it’s a deeper betrayal because she’s associating with people who want him out of the picture.", "annotation_id": "41762059", "url": "https://genius.com/41762059", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "No Sleep", "line": "He done murdered his own brother, I done seen it", "vault_lines": ["He done murdered his own brother, I done seen it"], "meaning": "He’s emphasizing how extreme the betrayal and violence around him can get. The point is basically “I’ve personally seen people turn on even their own family.”", "annotation_id": "41762044", "url": "https://genius.com/41762044", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
