{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "No Switch", "line": "We leave you slumped, and that’s on Dump", "vault_lines": ["We leave you slumped, and that's on Dump"], "meaning": "Big Dump was YoungBoy’s manager who was shot and killed in a 2018 drive-by shooting which was meant for YoungBoy. YB’s implying that he’ll have anyone killed and that’s on Dump’s grave.", "annotation_id": "30287478", "url": "https://genius.com/30287478", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
