{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "No Switch", "line": "They know Quando rollin’ like them 60s, buck, he put you up", "vault_lines": ["They know Quando rollin' like them 60s, buck, he put you up"], "meaning": "Quando Rondo is YoungBoy’s Never Broke Again label signee and close friend — Quando’s known to be affiliated with the Rollin' 60s Neighborhood Crips, a Crip Gang set founded in South Los Angeles, however, have spread across the US.\n\nQuando has mentioned his affiliation with the Crip set several times, even titling his third mixtape, From the Neighborhood to the Stage in honour of the gang. Quando has even directly mentioned the gang in his April 2018 breakout track, “ABG,” where he rapped:\n\n60 Gang crippin', I'ma throw that neighborhood up, yeah\n\nDespite YoungBoy rapping as if he’s shouting Quando out, the lyric shows irony between the two as YoungBoy is a known affiliate of the rival Blood Gang — likewise to Quando, YoungBoy spoke about his affiliation in “I-10 Baby” as he rapped:\n\nEverything gon' start with a, “B” bitch ass nigga, Blood gang or no gang", "annotation_id": "27610124", "url": "https://genius.com/27610124", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "No Switch", "line": "Nigga, I’m way from the South, bitch I’m from the bottom of the- I’m from the bottom of the motherfuckin’ United States You heard me? We ain’t nothin’ but some alligators, you heard me", "vault_lines": ["Nigga, I'm way from the South, bitch", "I'm from the bottom of the-", "I'm from the bottom of the motherfuckin' United States", "We ain't nothin' but some alligators, you heard me"], "meaning": "This is showing youngboy’s home area “Lousiana”", "annotation_id": "24990490", "url": "https://genius.com/24990490", "state": "pending", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "No Switch", "line": "All these niggas talkin’ ’bout them switches, choppa came automatic", "vault_lines": ["All these niggas talkin' 'bout them switches, choppa came automatic"], "meaning": "Lil Durk always talks about “Switches” on his glock. This modification is almost always mentioned on his songs. NBA Youngboy is saying his choppa came automatic and that there’s no need for a Switch.", "annotation_id": "24941803", "url": "https://genius.com/24941803", "state": "pending", "votes": 42, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
