{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "No Time", "line": "(Skolo, it’s your turn) (D-Roc, D-Roc)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "These are the producer tags to Skolo and D-Roc respectively. Both of them have produced a few of YoungBoy Never Broke Again’s biggest hits, such as “I’m The One” and “Bring The Hook” respectively.", "annotation_id": "30932875", "url": "https://genius.com/30932875", "state": "accepted", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "No Time", "line": "Bitch ain’t tryna market, I don’t know why the label bought me", "vault_lines": ["Bitch ain't tryna market, I don't know why the label bought me"], "meaning": "Youngboy talks about how his label Motown paid him lots of money, but doesn’t promote him at all. With the amount of effort that Motown puts in, he is basically an independent artist.", "annotation_id": "30932866", "url": "https://genius.com/30932866", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "No Time", "line": "Diamond chain from Carti, don’t know why he done start me", "vault_lines": ["Diamond chain from Carti, don't know why he done start me"], "meaning": "On June 12, Jewelry Unlimited shared video on Instagram of a chunky piece and chain the company was commissioned to make by Playboi Carti. According to the company, the bling is a gift from Playboi Carti to YoungBoy Never Broke Again to celebrate their upcoming joint album.\n\nThe post also captioned.\n“004KT @playboicarti GIFTS YOUNGBOY A CHAIN AHEAD OF THEIR NEW COLLAB ALBUM”\n\n\n\nPlayboi Carti, also posted a picture of YoungBoy Never Broke Again on his Instagram story.\n\n\n\nBut, YoungBoy Never Broke Again doesn’t know why Carti didn’t start him. However, the reason Carti didn’t start Youngboy is obvious to us because we all know Carti is too high up for Youngboy.", "annotation_id": "30932844", "url": "https://genius.com/30932844", "state": "pending", "votes": -23, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
