{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Nussie", "line": "Who got that pussy-nigga smashed in the club?", "vault_lines": ["Who got that pussy-nigga smashed in the club?"], "meaning": "YB is talking about Lil Ivy who was a close friend of Lil Boosie and got killed at a nightclub in 2005. He created TBG which we all know YB’s gang NBA is beefing with. Nussie was also beefing with Lil Ivory just as he was beefing with Boosie Badazz so we all know who got that pussy-nigga smashed in the club", "annotation_id": "36782701", "url": "https://genius.com/36782701", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
