{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "One Shot", "line": "They see my drip, then hold they breath, then dive in like a pool", "vault_lines": ["They see my drip, then hold they breath, then dive in like a pool"], "meaning": "Drip refers to Stylish expensive clothing with diamonds and watches.\nHere Baby is saying he’s so drippy that it’s actually causing a wave so everyone needs to hold their breath.\nThis is another reference to hit song drip too hard where he references drowning off his wave.", "annotation_id": "28845253", "url": "https://genius.com/28845253", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "One Shot", "line": "Try to ride my wave, wonderin’ why they ain’t drownin’ yet", "vault_lines": ["Try to ride my wave, wonderin' why they ain't drownin' yet"], "meaning": "Baby is referring to his hit song “drip too hard ft Gunna”\nWhere the song quotes drip too hard, don’t stand too close you’re gonna fuck around and drown of this wave.\n\nHere he explains confusion as to why they’re not drowning when trying to ride his wave", "annotation_id": "28845238", "url": "https://genius.com/28845238", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
