{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Overdose", "line": "That Soulja Slim, that C-Murder, come in the tank just like a No Limit soldier", "vault_lines": ["That Soulja Slim, that C-Murder, come in the tank just like a No Limit soldier (Word, word, word)"], "meaning": "YoungBoy shouts out Louisiana rappers Soulja Slim and C-Murder who were signed to Master P’s No Limit Records.", "annotation_id": "31565460", "url": "https://genius.com/31565460", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Overdose", "line": "What’s the 4-1-1? They know YB, I be ’bout whatever", "vault_lines": ["What's the 4-1-1? They know YB, I be 'bout whatever"], "meaning": "411- it Another term used for “information”", "annotation_id": "24911612", "url": "https://genius.com/24911612", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Overdose", "line": "I’m poppin’ X so I’m steady rollin’ (Steady rollin’)", "vault_lines": ["I'm poppin' X so I'm steady rollin' (Steady rollin')"], "meaning": "“Rolling” is slang for being high off of ecstasy (MDMA).", "annotation_id": "16027616", "url": "https://genius.com/16027616", "state": "accepted", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Overdose", "line": "When I hit him with this Glock I bet I fold him None of these niggas ain’t never play with me (Who?) Play with me, I bet you see", "vault_lines": ["When I hit him with this Glock I bet I fold him", "None of these niggas ain't never play with me (Who?)", "Play with me, I bet you see"], "meaning": "No matter how hard YoungBoy’s rivals may seem, the bullet from his Glock will end up being more lethal to the extent of killing them. Because of the many rivals he has gotten out of his way through violence, NBA claims that only few dare “play” with him.\n\nThe Glock pistol is a series of polymer-framed, short recoil-operated, locked-breech semi-automatic pistols designed and produced by Austrian weapons manufacturing company, Glock Ges.m.b.H.", "annotation_id": "14644396", "url": "https://genius.com/14644396", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Overdose", "line": "Sippin’ on this drank, RIP Fredo, this that bang shit (That bang shit)", "vault_lines": ["Sippin' on this drank, RIP Fredo, this that bang shit (That bang shit)"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is paying homage to Chicago rapper Fredo Santana, who died on January 19th, 2018 at the age of 27 from a lethal seizure, due to liver and kidney problems because of his heavy use of cough syrup.\n\nCodeine & promethazine cough syrup is poured into soft drinks such as sprite, with Jolly Ranchers added, to make what is known as lean or purple drank. The physiological effects of the cough syrup on the user are euphoria, motor-skill impairment, lethargy, drowsiness, and a dissociative feeling from all other parts of the body.\n\nYoungBoy has rapped about sipping lean before in songs such as “Ride”:\n\nDouble cup my lean just to make it through the night\nLet’s take our chances baby, it’s gon' be alright", "annotation_id": "14644267", "url": "https://genius.com/14644267", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Overdose", "line": "Tell me he want smoke, 187, that’s that same shit", "vault_lines": ["Tell me he want smoke, 187, that's that same shit"], "meaning": "Section 187 of the California Penal Code defines the crime of murder. The number is commonly pronounced by reading the digits separately as “one-eighty-seven”.\n\nYB is stating that anyone who wants smoke (violence) with him get killed. “That’s that same shit” means that he is used to solving his problems by committing murder, such as when he attempted to do so in a drive-by shooting in November 2016.", "annotation_id": "14644206", "url": "https://genius.com/14644206", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Overdose", "line": "I ain’t no bad person, no Ayy I ain’t no gangster, ain’t no killer I ain’t no gangbanger, I’m me Like everybody make mistakes, that’s life", "vault_lines": ["Like everybody make mistakes, that's life"], "meaning": "Despite YoungBoy’s success in the rap industry, his criminal history continues to tarnish his reputation and threatens to cut his career short.\n\nAccording to Complex:\n\nThe rapper,[YoungBoy], who was charged with alleged assault and kidnapping, is facing a heap of legal issues that date all the way back to 2016. It was at that time YoungBoy was arrested in Austin for his alleged involvement in a drive-by shooting. A judge suspended his 10-year prison sentence in the latter case and handed the artist a three-year probation; however, Youngboy’s future is still unclear, as he remains behind bars on suspicion of attacking his girlfriend Jania Jackson.\n\nFeeling misrepresented, YoungBoy asserts that, despite mistakes, he is not the person that many paint him out to be. Similar thoughts are rapped on YoungBoy’s song, “Traumatized”:\n\nThey always talk ‘bout me, no they don’t know 'bout me\nGotta pray before I sleep, the devil talk to me\nGotta get 'em out my dreams, 'fore he take over me", "annotation_id": "14444525", "url": "https://genius.com/14444525", "state": "accepted", "votes": 31, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
