{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Pain Never Fades", "line": "Nawfside", "vault_lines": ["Nawfside, young nigga shot marbles"], "meaning": "Youngboy says he’s from Nawfside(Northside), Baton Rouge. The Northside is where Youngboy grew up and lived as he stated in his 2016 track “Murder”\n\nNBA Youngboy, thousand shots come behind me\nIn the Nawf where you find me, on Chippewa bitch I’m in the streets", "annotation_id": "22615672", "url": "https://genius.com/22615672", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
