{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Palm Of My Hand (Like A Rockstar)", "line": "I got your heart in the palm of my hand", "vault_lines": ["I got your heart in the palm of my hand"], "meaning": "Palm of my hand is a idiomatic meaning where you have control, and influence over something or someone, to be able to get them to do something for you, or whatever they want.\n\nYoungBoy has whoever, most likely the girl, in the palm of his hand, meaning he can control her cause her feelings and actions are always going to be control of him, so she listens to whatever he says.", "annotation_id": "41229863", "url": "https://genius.com/41229863", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
