{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Peace Hardly", "line": "(Oh Lord, Jetson made another one)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "This producer tag belongs to jetsonmade\n\nTahj Morgan, also known as jetsonmade (formerly stylised as JetsonMade), is a Carolina-based producer best recognised for producing many of DaBaby’s breakout songs, including “Suge,” “BOP,” “Goin Baby,” and “VIBEZ,” among others.\n\nHe has worked with 21 Savage, Roddy Ricch, Playboi Carti, YoungBoy Never Broke Again, Lil Keed, Young Nudy, Smokepurpp, and many other musicians, and has become a go-to producer in the Hip-Hop genre.\n\n@jetsonmade", "annotation_id": "28775847", "url": "https://genius.com/28775847", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
