{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Perfecto", "line": "Fuck that nigga, I’m here, you don’t worry ’bout him I got beams in your crib and I’m gon’ aim it, I see him", "vault_lines": ["Fuck that nigga, I'm here, you don't worry 'bout him", "I got beams in your crib and I'm gon' aim it, I see him"], "meaning": "YB is telling a woman he doesn’t care about her boyfriend or ex and to forget him because he’s here now. “I got beams in your crib” is referring to the guns with laser beams on them. He could either be aiming it at her current boyfriend if he tries to trip over his girlfriend treating. Or he could be aiming it towards her ex who did her wrong.", "annotation_id": "41583639", "url": "https://genius.com/41583639", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
