{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Perfecto", "line": "Ninety-nine overall (Oh), she perfecto", "vault_lines": ["Ninety-nine overall (Oh), she perfecto"], "meaning": "He uses 99 ovr to say his girl is maxed out from her attributes to her badges. Video game language with literal meaning behind it (figuratively and literally). Her attributes are her looks, personality, character, etc. Badges help improve her attributes. Considering she’s perfect to him, all her badges are on legendary to him, with all the attributes being a 99.", "annotation_id": "41583530", "url": "https://genius.com/41583530", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
