{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Perfecto", "line": "My bitch bad and she on point and my swag match my gun (Match my gun)", "vault_lines": ["My bitch bad and she on point and my swag match my gun (Match my gun)"], "meaning": "YB is complimenting his woman’s looks and mentions how she is ready for anything that goes down. Then mentions how his swag matches his gun. This could mean he’s in all black like his Glock. Peanut-butter-like-clothing to match his Glock 19X. Peanut butter and black to match his Draco. All black to match his Draco.", "annotation_id": "41583467", "url": "https://genius.com/41583467", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Perfecto", "line": "Bitch, I’m Baby Boo, you try to boot and get a headband", "vault_lines": ["Bitch, I'm Baby Boo, you try to boot and get a headband"], "meaning": "This is a shoutout to rapper h3adband shawty, his song “boo” he was mistaken for youngboy by the internet", "annotation_id": "38382243", "url": "https://genius.com/38382243", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Perfecto", "line": "Syrup by the tank, I’m on that drank, I’m bumpin’ Kankan", "vault_lines": ["Syrup by the tank, I'm on that drank, I'm bumpin' Kankan"], "meaning": "YoungBoy claims to be sipping on “drank,” also known as “lean,” which is a substance mixture typically containing cough syrup, soda, and some form of hard candy. In this case, one “tank” of syrup would equate to one pint. He ends off the line by referencing Dallas rapper Kankan, who is known for his heavy affiliation with the substance; with it appearing in a lot of his branding both across his music and his fashion brand.\n\nKankan has made multiple songs and albums themed around the drug, with him starting off his breakout hit song “Wokeup” by saying:\n\nYeah, woke up sippin' Wock', yeah\nHe sippin' on fake drop, yeah (He sippin' fake Wock')\nThis shit around the clock, uh (‘Round the clock)\nToo high, I can’t stop it\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9N2LzFrsew4", "annotation_id": "38302941", "url": "https://genius.com/38302941", "state": "accepted", "votes": 23, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
