{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Permanent Scar", "line": "For a verse I got ten, gave it straight to my brother Did a verse for a ten, gave it straight to my brother, yeah", "vault_lines": ["For a verse I got ten, gave it straight to my brother", "Did a verse for a ten, gave it straight to my brother, yeah"], "meaning": "At this time, youngboy was reportedly doing verses for 10 thousand dollars. This line implies that most of this money went to his brother as he was struggling financially.", "annotation_id": "31543994", "url": "https://genius.com/31543994", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Permanent Scar", "line": "[Chorus: YoungBoy Never Broke Again] I came in with the dopeboys, I came in with the rockstars I came in with a cold heart, and I left as a popstar I came in with the dopeboys, I came in with the rockstars From the beginning I played my part, I left the game a permanent scar", "vault_lines": ["I came in with the dopeboys, I came in with the rockstars", "I came in with a cold heart, and I left as a popstar"], "meaning": "YB came up in the game in 2016, around when the dopeboys(Kodak Black, 21 Savage) & the rockstars(Lil Uzi Vert, X, Post Malone) started gaining fame. YB was in his own lane with a unique style, ran with that and made his way to the top.", "annotation_id": "21563163", "url": "https://genius.com/21563163", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Permanent Scar", "line": "YSL the slime, we not Saint Laurent (Slime)", "vault_lines": ["YSL the slime, we not Saint Laurent (Slime)"], "meaning": "YSL stands for Young Stoner Life, a recording company founded by Young Thug.\n\nThis is not to be confused with Yves Saint Laurent, a French luxury clothing line that also goes by the acronym YSL.", "annotation_id": "15378728", "url": "https://genius.com/15378728", "state": "accepted", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
