{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Pimpin A Bitch", "line": "Bro bang for P, I bang for me", "vault_lines": ["Bro bang for P, I bang for me"], "meaning": "This could be a shout out to two fellow Louisiana rappers. Master P and C-Murder, the latter being signed to the former’s label. Very early in his career, Youngboy has been adamant of being independent, creating his own label at 16 years old which is what he means when he says “I bang for me”", "annotation_id": "28385138", "url": "https://genius.com/28385138", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Pimpin A Bitch", "line": "I don’t wanna go to the BET awards, I don’t know if I’ma make it there Know them pussy niggas be attendin’, I might have to spray in there", "vault_lines": ["I don't wanna go to the BET awards, I don't know if I'ma make it there", "Know them pussy niggas be attendin', I might have to spray in there"], "meaning": "This is a diss to other artists such as Lil Durk, Polo G, Lil Baby ect. The three mentioned are considered the best rappers of the generation while Youngboy and his camp are considered the “outcasts” of rap due to the camp not changing their opinions or their appearances to satisfy the mainstream. BET Awards is an event where artist are presented awards on the music they’ve put out this year. Durk, Polo and Baby are one of the many artist that attend these events. Youngboy’s saying due to him being on house arrest, he probably won’t even be able to attend the awards and on top of that, he doesn’t like the 3 artist mentioned and claims that if he attended, he would have to use the opportunity to kill his enemies regardless of being at a popular event.", "annotation_id": "28385076", "url": "https://genius.com/28385076", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
