{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Pistol Totting", "line": "With lil’ Tug, he went hard for me Thank you, my nigga, I miss you", "vault_lines": ["With lil' Tug, he went hard for me", "Thank you, my nigga, I miss you"], "meaning": "Charvon Johnson otherwise known as “Lil Tug” was a long time friend of Youngboy who passed away and is referenced in multiple songs, passing away due to gun violence.\n\nhttps://obits.theadvocate.com/us/obituaries/theadvocate/name/charvon-johnson-obituary?id=6866668\n\nhttps://www.theadvocate.com/baton_rouge/news/crime_police/juvenile-arrested-in-december-homicide-on-jackson-avenue-baton-rouge-police-say/article_d5114dde-3a13-11e9-9669-bf3b7b3f02a5.html", "annotation_id": "29149916", "url": "https://genius.com/29149916", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Pistol Totting", "line": "Boozilla caught a charge from poppin’ cars, this shit insane", "vault_lines": ["Boozilla caught a charge from poppin' cars, this shit insane"], "meaning": "This refers to Youngboy’s cousin Boozilla/Keondrae Ricks being arrested for breaking into vehicles in high school, including a backpack that had a signed autograph by President Barack Obama.\n\n\n\nhttps://www.theadvocate.com/baton_rouge/news/crime_police/teen-accused-of-breaking-into-cars-outside-mckinley-high-stealing-copy-of-students-speech-signed/article_8d061713-c31a-5e01-9bd7-e365bd601f0d.html\n\nhttps://www.wbrz.com/news/brpd-arrests-man-accused-of-mckinley-high-vehicle-break-ins/", "annotation_id": "29149877", "url": "https://genius.com/29149877", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
