{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Poppin Shit", "line": "[Chorus: Jazlyn MyChelle] Poppin’ shit, Balenciaga, mmm, yeah I’m the shit, I’m the topic, mmm, yeah Long hair like Rapunzel, make sure my heart never fades Singin’ to the thunder, mmm", "vault_lines": ["I'm the shit, I'm the topic, mmm, yeah", "Long hair like Rapunzel, make sure my heart never fades", "Singin' to the thunder, mmm"], "meaning": "The hook on this song is performed by NBA YoungBoy’s wife Jazlyn MyChelle or simply “Jaz” as listed on streaming services. They have been married for over 2.5 years and are expecting their third child. This marks the first and only official collaboration between the pair although apparently they do have one other unreleased song together. She also appeared on YoungBoy’s album cover for Ma’ I Got A Family alongside their children at the time.", "annotation_id": "36356524", "url": "https://genius.com/36356524", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
