{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Pour One", "line": "Remember smoking weed with your lil’ brother Matter fact nigga, I used to call you my big brother", "vault_lines": ["Matter fact nigga, I used to call you my big brother"], "meaning": "Youngboy is going back before the fame that he used to smoke some weed with gee money.\n\nThen the next line\n\n“Matter fact nigga, I used to call you my big brother”\n\nYoungboy used to call gee money big brother before the fame when he used to be TBG and he used to call gee money big brother and gee money confirmed that he used to call him big brother in his 2017 interview.", "annotation_id": "27309459", "url": "https://genius.com/27309459", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
