{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "RIP", "line": "MC Hammer like Thor (Hammer time), she wanna fuck, sure", "vault_lines": ["MC Hammer like Thor (Hammer time), she wanna fuck, sure (Smash)"], "meaning": "Thor is a marvel superhero who’s weapon is an enchanted hammer. MC Hammer is an American rapper, known for his hit single “U Can’t Touch This”, where he raps:\n\nStop, Hammer time!\n\nIn this line MC Hammer can also be interpreted as Offset being an MC, and the hammer being his penis.", "annotation_id": "15093576", "url": "https://genius.com/15093576", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
