{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Ranada", "line": "Watchin’ Mexico, Narcos while I’m rubbin’ yo’ feet", "vault_lines": ["Watchin' Mexico, Narcos while I'm rubbin' yo' feet"], "meaning": "Narcos: Mexico is a Netflix original series that chronicles the rise of the Guadalajara cartel in Mexico, led by Miguel Angel Felix Gallardo. There’s a lot of violence and drama and gangster shit in this series, truly a great show.", "annotation_id": "20985797", "url": "https://genius.com/20985797", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
