{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Real One (Real)", "line": "Claimin’ that he stay protected by the niggas thuggin’ with him", "vault_lines": ["Claimin' that he stay protected by thе niggas thuggin' with him"], "meaning": "3 possible meanings here.\n\n\nWhoever is claiming his friends got their back, they don’t because they don’t fuck with them like to really protect them. Ex. “Ay, these my folks, they got me, don’t try that shit!” (In reality, they not behind him.)\n\n\n\nOr\n\n\nSame as 1. but if they do have their back, the friends might back down because they know YoungBoy’s status and is too pussy to risk anything.\nMaybe they do got his back, but YoungBoy can touch him easily because they can’t really protect him, as the dude claims he’s protected, like if he was bulletproof.", "annotation_id": "41628527", "url": "https://genius.com/41628527", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
