{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Rear View", "line": "Every thug need a girl with a clip, baby Truth is, you know I know you’re missin’ me, baby", "vault_lines": ["Every thug need a girl with a clip, baby", "Truth is, you know I know you're missin' me, baby"], "meaning": "Mariah uses clever wordplay to tie the word “thug,” often an aggressive person who’s a criminal, to her currently incarcerated boyfriend, Young Thug.\n\nIn the lyric, Mariah notes that it would be beneficial for a thug to be with someone who’s aware and equipped with firearms due to their safety and intentions being directly shown to her partner.\n\nHowever, Mariah could also be referencing Young Thug’s current YSL RICO case in which he’s charged as the alleged leader of a criminal gang. However, Thug has an extensive battle with legal issues as in 2017, he was charged with the possession of a firearm, tieing into Mariah’s lyric.\n\n\n\nPictured: Young Thug and Mariah the Scientist getting married in the official music video for Mariah’s July 2021, “Walked In”", "annotation_id": "28281311", "url": "https://genius.com/28281311", "state": "accepted", "votes": 18, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Rear View", "line": "Watchin’, I been clutchin’ my TEC, no Lookin’ through the rearview, tryna make sure I don’t die", "vault_lines": ["Watchin', I been clutchin' my TEC, no", "Lookin' through the rearview, tryna make sure I don't die"], "meaning": "Indicating that he feels cautious that someone’s out to kill him, YoungBoy notes that he’s holding his Kel-Tec in fear of becoming a victim to murder. Similarly, in his August 2022, “Lost Soul Survivor,” YoungBoy rapped:\n\nHe watch the rearview, he know if he don’t, that’s gon' only come out with his head on the dash (Oh)\nNo, they don’t like me but I keep my foot on they neck, and they know that I step on the gas", "annotation_id": "28281262", "url": "https://genius.com/28281262", "state": "accepted", "votes": 23, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
