{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Red Eye", "line": "We still at war ’bout my cousin", "vault_lines": ["I miss Big Dump like my granny, we still at war 'bout my cousin"], "meaning": "He’s talking about his cousin Keondrae Ricks, who was more known as NBA/BBG Boozilla. Shortly after being killed November 2016, days later Youngboy NBA went out trying to catch who killed his cousin, resulting in him being arrested for 2 Counts of attempted murder later pleading guilty to a reduced charge of aggravated assault and a 10 year suspended sentence with 3 years of probation. Boozilla’s alleged killer was arrested March 2017.", "annotation_id": "23979828", "url": "https://genius.com/23979828", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
