{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Red Rum", "line": "I just raised the murder rate up in my city, bitch Fuck the race, I ain’t in no competition, bitch", "vault_lines": ["I just raised the murder rate up in my city, bitch", "Fuck the race, I ain't in no competition, bitch"], "meaning": "This is likely a reference to Tay-K’s “The Race” in which Tay-K flees to another state to escape capital murder charges.\n\n\n\nYoungboy played accomplice to a shooting on Kentucky Street in Baton Rouge, LA on Nov 2, 2016 in which everyone survived.  He didn’t “do the race” like Tay-K to escape incarceration, but he also didn’t raise the murder rate on that date either.", "annotation_id": "12836913", "url": "https://genius.com/12836913", "state": "accepted", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
