{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Rich Nigga", "line": "You know my chain is gon’ shine even when the whole sun-done", "vault_lines": ["You know my chain is gon' shine even when the whole sun-done"], "meaning": "Uzi has glow-in-the-dark diamonds, the Philadelphian artist is known to display a multitude of diamonds— the caliber of which will consistently glow regardless of the lighting.\n\n\n\nAn additional note of the illustrious minerals came in Uzi’s 2016 track, “Canadian Goose\":\n\nDiamonds they shine in the dark", "annotation_id": "15000480", "url": "https://genius.com/15000480", "state": "accepted", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Rich Nigga", "line": "Keep a 30 stick, nigga", "vault_lines": ["Keep a 30 stick, nigga"], "meaning": "“Stick” is slang for an extended magazine, used to increase the maximum amount of ammunition a gun can carry. The term is universally known in the rap community due to the strong allegiance many artists show their weapons.\n\nUzi once more refers to his upgraded armament during his feature in fellow collaborator Playboi Carti’s 2017 track, “Lookin”:\n\nChopper with the stick and it got the kick\n\n\n\nThe Philadelphian rapper is known to keep a concealed firearm because of his strong lack of assurance in affiliates.", "annotation_id": "14927317", "url": "https://genius.com/14927317", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Rich Nigga", "line": "(Dubba-AA flexin’)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "The tag for Dubba AA, a producer out of West Palm Beach, Florida.\n\n\n\nDubba’s collaboration with Youngboy and Uzi has begun with the release of Youngboy’s new albums, Until Death Call My Name Reloaded and Too Fast.", "annotation_id": "14924981", "url": "https://genius.com/14924981", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
