{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Rob Your Ass", "line": "Pull up to the projects, they be watchin’ They like how I’m wildin’ I won’t tell a thing, he say my name and he forever silent Pull up with some money and narcotics, drugs in my pocket Sit up in that cell and do my day up, I ain’t ever stoppin’ Walk up on that stage, I still got cases pending I used to really think I couldn’t, till the time I did it", "vault_lines": ["Pull up to the projects, they be watchin'", "They like how I'm wildin'", "I won't tell a thing, he say my name and he forever silent", "Pull up with some money and narcotics, drugs in my pocket", "Sit up in that cell and do my day up, I ain't ever stoppin'", "Walk up on that stage, I still got cases pending"], "meaning": "In these lyrics, Youngboy once again reassures his fans that his money hasnt changed him. He also talks about how hes always enjoying his life and never looking back or letting anything stop him.", "annotation_id": "21793624", "url": "https://genius.com/21793624", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Rob Your Ass", "line": "And I’m still YoungBoy, YB, Money in my pocket Molly in my body I can’t sell no drugs, I ran it up I came out the socket I can’t save my money, if I want it I pull up to buy it 30 in my stick and I just put a hundred in my trousers", "vault_lines": ["And I'm still YoungBoy, YB, Money in my pocket", "Molly in my body", "I can't sell no drugs, I ran it up", "I came out the socket", "I can't save my money, if I want it", "I pull up to buy it", "30 in my stick and I just put a hundred in my trousers"], "meaning": "Here, Youngboy talks about how rich he is but that his money hasn’t changed him. When he says he “came out the socket” he means he broke the mold that others have maybe shaped him in.", "annotation_id": "21793613", "url": "https://genius.com/21793613", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
