{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Rock and Roll", "line": "In the valley with Dump, now he fly in the sky Why they stepped on my nigga, I don’t know why", "vault_lines": ["In the valley with Dump, now he fly in the sky", "Why they stepped on my nigga, I don't know why"], "meaning": "Youngboy’s friend Big Dump was murdered in a drive-by shooting on May 2018. He expressed his greivances on the track “RIP Dump.”\n\nRest in peace to my nigga, Big Dump I miss you I just wish I was there", "annotation_id": "16329012", "url": "https://genius.com/16329012", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
