{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Round Table (Top Soprano / Higher Than Life)", "line": "Top Soprano, I am that", "vault_lines": ["Top Soprano, I am that"], "meaning": "Tony Soprano is a New Jersey-based Italian-American Mafia boss who struggles to balance his criminal life with family issues, leading him to seek therapy for panic attacks and depression. Top compares himself to the fictional character off of The Sopranos because of similar characteristics and who YB thinks he is himself.", "annotation_id": "39098036", "url": "https://genius.com/39098036", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
