{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Run", "line": "She stabbed that bitch inside my house, I had five blocks inside my safe", "vault_lines": ["She stabbed that bitch inside my house, I had five blocks inside my safe"], "meaning": "Iyana “Yaya” Mayweather who was Youngboy’s girlfriend at the time stabbed one of his baby mamas Lapattra Jacobs in April 2020.", "annotation_id": "30483250", "url": "https://genius.com/30483250", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Run", "line": "And now, I can’t pay my rent, ’cause all my money spent, yeah I spent it all on sticks, and buyin’ big diamonds for my bitch", "vault_lines": ["And now, I can't pay my rent, 'cause all my money spent, yeah", "I spent it all on sticks, and buyin' big diamonds for my bitch"], "meaning": "The chorus in The Devil Wears Prada song, “Still Fly”, has them singing these exact lines.\n\nYoungboy Never Broke Again pays homage to a classic song from a time unmatched, the nostalgia hits hard, and seeing NBA Youngboy do this is awesome!\n\nhttps://youtu.be/Ny6lX2ubVQo?si=I_gWSz52iyeL269G", "annotation_id": "30329305", "url": "https://genius.com/30329305", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
