{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Run My Bread Up", "line": "They done booked me for a show in Savannah (Savannah)", "vault_lines": ["They done booked me for a show in Savannah (Savannah)"], "meaning": "Back in 2016, not a lot of people know, he had a concert in Georgia, Savannah.\n\n(Unnecessary info, but I had a friend who had their oldest sibling go there, it was one of the best concerts for a upcoming artist for that time.)", "annotation_id": "39610276", "url": "https://genius.com/39610276", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
