{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "SVJ", "line": "I’ll pop this Xanax, 5, by two Ooh I’ma end that note just with a symphony, pussy-ass nigga, stay out my business", "vault_lines": ["I'll pop this Xanax, 5, by two"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is talking to his member, telling him about how he splits a Xan bar in half before taking it and swallowing it.\n\n\nBlasian “Half a Xanax, yeah, yeah (Half a Xan)”\n\n\n\n“I'ma end that note just with a symphony,” is YoungBoy trying to cause you to wonder why he ended the line with a symphony instead of finishing the line with some more lyrics.\n\nHe responds to your wondering with, “Pussy-ass nigga, stay out my business.” Basically saying, “Don’t wonder why I ain’t continue. Move on.”", "annotation_id": "41762713", "url": "https://genius.com/41762713", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "SVJ", "line": "I don’t wan’ hear nothin’, it’s gon’ be a killin’", "vault_lines": ["I don't wan' hear nothin', it's gon' be a killin', uh"], "meaning": "YB doesn’t want to hear any dissing or otherwise it’s gonna turn deadly, and be a sad day for families.", "annotation_id": "41762641", "url": "https://genius.com/41762641", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "SVJ", "line": "Check every note on the car, these whips ain’t rented Uh-oh, I got these millions", "vault_lines": ["Check every note on the car, these whips ain't rented", "Uh-oh, I got these millions"], "meaning": "Flexing that he doesn’t have to rent cars when he has just enough money to buy them all. Hence the, “Uh-oh, I got these millions.”", "annotation_id": "41762632", "url": "https://genius.com/41762632", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
