{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "SVJ", "line": "And one-million to my girl Then, back chasin’ money, baby Get that money and I’m talkin’ ‘bout with havin’ nothin’ late", "vault_lines": ["And one-million to my girl", "Then, back chasin' money, baby"], "meaning": "YB gives one million US currency dollars to his wife like it’s nothing for her to spoil herself, then heads back to chasing money because the grind and hustle never stops. For nobody. Then, he talks about how when he hustles for his money, he always gets it right then and there, and doesn’t have to worry about his paycheck being sent late while working a nine-to-five job.", "annotation_id": "41762437", "url": "https://genius.com/41762437", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "SVJ", "line": "You get away from none", "vault_lines": ["Get away from them"], "meaning": "Basically, you never actually get away and hide from whatever you’re running from whether it’s literally or figuratively. Running from your insecurities, but they’re still there. Running from your opponents, but they’re gonna catch you one day. No matter what, you’re gonna get caught, if you don’t face your fear, and deal with it.", "annotation_id": "41762402", "url": "https://genius.com/41762402", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "SVJ", "line": "Caught in beef, had to learn how to swerve", "vault_lines": ["Caught in beef, had to learn how to swerve"], "meaning": "When numerous people started going against YB, that’s when YB realized he had to find out how to do killings. For example, drive-bys, also known as swerving.", "annotation_id": "41762351", "url": "https://genius.com/41762351", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
