{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Self Control", "line": "When Boozilla died, I almost lost my mind, broke me to pieces (Broke to pieces)", "vault_lines": ["When Boozilla died, I almost lost my mind, broke me to pieces (Broke to pieces)"], "meaning": "Keondrae Ricks, aka Boozilla, was one of YoungBoy’s cousins who was killed in a fatal shooting back in March of 2017. YoungBoy implies that he wasn’t able to cope with the loss of his cousin\n\n\n\nBoozilla (left) and YoungBoy (right)", "annotation_id": "18439677", "url": "https://genius.com/18439677", "state": "accepted", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Self Control", "line": "Smokin’ dro (Dro) ’cause I need it (Need it) So I could be calm instead of dangerous when you see me", "vault_lines": ["Smokin' dro (Dro) 'cause I need it (Need it)", "So I could be calm instead of dangerous when you see me"], "meaning": "“Dro” is a type of homegrown marijuana, grown indoors in hydroponic chambers, regulating light, humidity, and temperature. These circumstances give the “dro” a much higher and pure quality than marijuana found elsewhere.", "annotation_id": "18234417", "url": "https://genius.com/18234417", "state": "accepted", "votes": 27, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
