{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Shark", "line": "He hit Three with that fire, I couldn’t get to the bitch, so I murdered the one on his side", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "YB is talking about the time somebody on the opposition side shot his cousin if I’m not mistaken OG 3Three who’s also a rapper and the manager of the NBA label. YB murdered the brother of the dude who shot 3 for retaliation\n\n\nHustle “That nigga shot 3Three, I popped at his top\nAnd I knocked off his lil' brother too”", "annotation_id": "36877950", "url": "https://genius.com/36877950", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
