{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "She A Demon", "line": "Am the murder man, I am who sent somethin", "vault_lines": ["I am the murder man, I am who sent somethin'"], "meaning": "I think instead of “who sent somethin” I’m sure I hear YB saying he is “Husseins son”. Referring to Saddam Hussein the Iraqi politician and president being most known for his authoritarian dictatorship. Which is why he says he is a “murder man”, comparing himself to offspring of a radical leader.", "annotation_id": "35358214", "url": "https://genius.com/35358214", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
