{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Shot Callin", "line": "Bing, baow, baow, baow, bitch, stop all that holdin’ me", "vault_lines": ["Bing, baow, baow, baow, bitch, stop all that holdin' me"], "meaning": "What Mr. Gaulden is implying in this verse is him fighting and punching someone using onomatopoeia, Kentrell is also hinting that someone is preventing him from fighting saying “Bitch stop all at holding me”", "annotation_id": "37428757", "url": "https://genius.com/37428757", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Shot Callin", "line": "Tell my stylist that I’m tired of Hermès, come Celine me", "vault_lines": ["Tell my stylist that I'm tired of Hermès, come Celine me"], "meaning": "I’m tired of Hermès, come Celine me\n\nNBA Youngboy is flexing high end luxury brands.\nHermès is known for ultra expensive items, and Celine is a high end French fashion brand. In these lyrics, Youngboy is saying that he can afford both Celine and Hermès, and that he has enough money to rotate through designer brands. This lyric is clearly about showing off his wealthiness.\n\nTell my stylist\n\nMany look down upon having a personal stylist, but in this lyric Youngboy is bragging about one. Having a personal stylist shows that you have extreme wealth. This reflects the name “Shot Callin” as he’s making the decisions for what luxury brand he wants to wear.", "annotation_id": "38751967", "url": "https://genius.com/38751967", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Shot Callin", "line": "Gotta get my shake back, baby, hol’ on", "vault_lines": ["Gotta get my shake back, baby, hol' on"], "meaning": "Shake back is getting revenge", "annotation_id": "38525385", "url": "https://genius.com/38525385", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Shot Callin", "line": "I been showin’ my lil’ ass off, I always got my pants down", "vault_lines": ["I been showin' my lil' ass off, I always got my pants down"], "meaning": "This is a double entendre. Sagging one’s pants has been a staple part of gang association since the early 2000s and originated from U.S. prisons in the 1980s. In prison, people’s pants were always sagging because they couldn’t wear belts, as they could be used for harm. Also him “showing his lil' ass off,” signals him acting a fool and flexing his lifestyle on his haters and more.", "annotation_id": "37926542", "url": "https://genius.com/37926542", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Shot Callin", "line": "Pistol packin’, run up on me, I’m gon’ teach a nigga (Baow, baow)", "vault_lines": ["Pistol packin', run up on me, I'm gon' teach a nigga (Baow, baow)"], "meaning": "YoungBoy obviously has a gun and will use it on his opps if they try him (hence, “baow, baow”)", "annotation_id": "37926533", "url": "https://genius.com/37926533", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Shot Callin", "line": "Bo been show ’em how my arm long (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)", "vault_lines": ["Bo been show 'em how my arm long (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)"], "meaning": "This is a triple entendre. YoungBoy’s “arm”, or his gun, is long, so he has a long gun. Figuratively he has a long reach/influence on people far from him.\n\nSometimes, people use the arm to refer to their dicks, already meaning theirs is long like an arm, so YoungBoy could be going for this as well", "annotation_id": "37926476", "url": "https://genius.com/37926476", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
