{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Shot Callin", "line": "Come see how my block roll Control this bitch from outer space, ain’t been there so long, so long", "vault_lines": ["Come see how my block roll", "Control this bitch from outer space, ain't been there so long, so long"], "meaning": "In these bars, Youngboy invites the listener to come to his territory, to witness the savagery his affiliates are supposedly known for. Additionally, he insinuates that he controls the block from a distance, having been on house arrest in Utah for a long period of time, and thus, unable to actually appear on said block.", "annotation_id": "37555320", "url": "https://genius.com/37555320", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
