{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Sky Cry", "line": "You tried to make a choice, but your", "vault_lines": ["You tried to make a choice, but your heart in the middle"], "meaning": "you cant make a choice with yo heart inna middle* …..in this he explains how one cannot choose between 2 things that one loves because you’ll end up hurt or something of that nature", "annotation_id": "27393824", "url": "https://genius.com/27393824", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Sky Cry", "line": "We gone make the rocks hard", "vault_lines": ["Down for the gang, gotta use your brain, we gone make the rocks hard"], "meaning": "The term rock-hard means that something is extremely hard or solid.\n\nTo ”make the rocks hard” in this line means to build a relationship strong enough that it is unlikely to change or fail.", "annotation_id": "24369192", "url": "https://genius.com/24369192", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Sky Cry", "line": "Shawty say go when it’s time I thought you was under this here but you not Puttin’ up with your shit way too many times Everybody you know say you never was mine", "vault_lines": ["Shawty say go when it's time", "I thought you was under this here but you not", "Puttin' up with your shit way too many times"], "meaning": "He is talking about a lover whom is hard to read. He struggles to understand where he has his lover and if they are really down with him. He is just waiting for approval.\n\nHe feels that he is patiently accepting everything his lover does wrong, it eventually comes to an end.\n\nAfter realizing someone doesn’t love you back, through their actions and from what people have told you, you have to accept your fate of letting it go.", "annotation_id": "24360992", "url": "https://genius.com/24360992", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
