{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Something", "line": "The things that happen in a man life I ain’t talkin’ down on you, just realize I made mistakes that you could learn from, don’t run from it, you gon’ conquer", "vault_lines": ["The things that happen in a man life", "I ain't talkin' down on you, just realize", "I made mistakes that you could learn from, don't run from it, you gon' conquer"], "meaning": "Often men are portrayed as people who are strong, and should be able to go through it, as people think they are mentally stable, as he means “things that happen in a man life” which also just means whatever how a man goes through good, bad, alright times, and knowledge.\n\n#MentalHealthAwareness\n\nYoungBoy just means that whatever life changing things he’s saying, don’t take it to heart, but to mind because people who usually made mistakes before, have the book of knowledge that they are passing on, would help them know the game well.", "annotation_id": "38827317", "url": "https://genius.com/38827317", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Something", "line": "My wife ain’t with this lifestyle, and I cannot teach her But, baby, I will not resign, and I would never leave here", "vault_lines": ["My wife ain't with this lifestyle, and I cannot teach her", "But, baby, I will not resign, and I would never leave here"], "meaning": "Despite his actions and what he still portrays, he won’t leave Jaz", "annotation_id": "38827312", "url": "https://genius.com/38827312", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
