{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Stealing Out The Trap", "line": "These pussy niggas gettin’ they homies whacked", "vault_lines": ["These pussy niggas gettin' they homies whacked"], "meaning": "He’s talking about in general (maybe his pov) how people really do dumb shit as in trying to backdoor someone or trying to rob in a group, but when it goes wrong as in they homie getting left behind, they end up getting beat or shot, or possibly killed because their own friends weren’t really ride or die.\n\nYoungBoy’s pov might be saying how people gonna try that shit with him, knowing he’s untouchable.", "annotation_id": "39266993", "url": "https://genius.com/39266993", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
