{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Stealing Out The Trap", "line": "I been fallin’ out with everybody that I seem to love I been poppin’ all these pills, it’s hard to get up off these drugs", "vault_lines": ["I been fallin' out with everybody that I seem to love", "I been poppin' all these pills, it's hard to get up off these drugs"], "meaning": "No matter how much you try to get people to understand you, get people to care about you, get people to love you, you only push em away, and always remember if you dont have respect for yourself and can control yourself no one will care\n\nnotice how he said “that i seem to love” instead of “that loves me”\n\nno one gives a fuck about you no one cares, and trust me you gon have to face it the drugs kill your body slowly trust me, and it brings more pain than people you love walkin out on you.\n\ni cant be no bitch ass nigga for people to feel comfortable around me, especially if they aint doin shit for me and im always givin my life away then for a fuck nigga or hoe ahh bitch to tell me “i aint ask you to do that shit you did it on your own”\n\nno matter what you was taught this aint a “if you give you get world”\n\nand people only give a fuck bout women no one gives a fuck bout no man especially if yeen got shit and even if you do they only with you cause of what you got and not your lip service. better love yourself and ball on yourself keep your insecurities to yourself and work on them like your life depends on it, not for no love not for no attention not for approval, but because you want better for yourself.", "annotation_id": "35239737", "url": "https://genius.com/35239737", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
