{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survive", "line": "Boozilla", "vault_lines": ["Been prayin' that Baby Joe can win, Boozilla seed, that's on my soul"], "meaning": "Boozilla refers to Keondre Ricks, Youngboy’s older cousin he was a member of NBA (Never Broke Again) & BBGs (Bottom Boy Gorillas). He passed away a few hours after midnight November 2nd, 2016. Leaving an impact on youngboy and his career this can be seen especially with his lyrics constantly referring to his late cousin.", "annotation_id": "26919189", "url": "https://genius.com/26919189", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
