{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survive", "line": "I gotta cuff and love your blick more than your ho", "vault_lines": ["I gotta cuff and love your blick more than your ho"], "meaning": "A “blick” alludes to a handgun, which originated in New York. YoungBoy previously mentioned the term on his September 2021 track “My Killa,” on which he raps:\n\nWant it for to go down, shoot a whole hundred rounds if a nigga want beef (Bang)\nYeah, shoot that blicky (Bop), take one off\n\nTo “cuff” an individual proclaims loyalty between a couple. Following his sentiment, NBA YoungBoy insinuates his gang affiliations, as well as implying that his handgun must have a ubiquitous presence for protection, citing the gun as his “lover.”", "annotation_id": "26659871", "url": "https://genius.com/26659871", "state": "accepted", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survive", "line": "And bring a stick out on the road They after us, that boy died playing with Quando", "vault_lines": ["And bring a stick out on the road", "They after us, that boy died playing with Quando"], "meaning": "Here, YoungBoy Never Broke Again references an altercation that occurred on November 6, 2020, outside of a nightclub in Atlanta after Quando Rondo and King Von had begun to have a fist fight. During the fight, a close affiliate of YoungBoy and Quando, Lul Timm shot and killed King Von.\n\nYoungBoy has referenced the incident several times in 2022, for example, in his and Quando’s latest song together, “Give Me A Sign,” YB rapped:\n\nBlackball and wanna see us down ‘cause Timm get dirty with that iron\n\nYoungBoy has mentioned this more head-on in his January 2022 “Bring The Hook” where he rapped:\n\nNigga, this that Squid Game, O'Block pack get rolled up\nMurder what they told us, Atlanta boy get fold up", "annotation_id": "26656074", "url": "https://genius.com/26656074", "state": "accepted", "votes": 17, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
