{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survivor", "line": "I been betrayed by these niggas and hoes But this is the life that I chose, yeah", "vault_lines": ["I been betrayed by these niggas and hoes", "But this is the life that I chose, yeah"], "meaning": "In the “gang” life, and music industry, you get betrayed, by EVERYONE, Yb realizes that this is the life he chose, and that’s what comes with it.", "annotation_id": "29046801", "url": "https://genius.com/29046801", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
