{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survivor", "line": "Livin’ like a Ruff Rider", "vault_lines": ["Livin' like a Ruff Rider, they locked him up for violence"], "meaning": "YoungBoy means hes living with a tough and fearless attitude, just like the members of the Ruff Ryders hip-hop collective, known for their tough and rebellious style. They gained popularity in the late 1990s and early 2000s with their energetic music and aggressive lyrics.", "annotation_id": "28678326", "url": "https://genius.com/28678326", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survivor", "line": "They locked him up for violence He came back like a survivor, yeah", "vault_lines": ["He came back like a survivor, yeah"], "meaning": "Youngboy actually was recommended to stay in a correctional facility because how violent he is\nAnd had a very slight chance of coming home on house arrest freetop ❤️👏👏", "annotation_id": "25782594", "url": "https://genius.com/25782594", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survivor", "line": "I told D to do his time then come back grindin’ with some", "vault_lines": ["I told D to do his time then come back grindin' with some"], "meaning": "“D” in this case is referring to DDawg, one of Youngboy’s cousins. He is currently in jail for murder. Youngboy has a song dedicated to him called “FREE DDAWG” and often mentions him in lyrics.", "annotation_id": "22986374", "url": "https://genius.com/22986374", "state": "pending", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survivor", "line": "Tennis chain", "vault_lines": ["Tennis chain, a hundred and ten thousand (A hundred and ten thousand)"], "meaning": "A tennis chain is a chain that contains small diamonds or gems connected by a thin, precious metal chain. As a piece of elegant jewelry, tennis chains are usually made of 14K or 18K gold, or platinum. The price for one starts at 125$. Youngboy here says that he spent 110.000$ on one chain.\n\n\n\nIced out tennis chain", "annotation_id": "22318528", "url": "https://genius.com/22318528", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survivor", "line": "Jail time and the prayers on lockdown, writing songs on the rec", "vault_lines": ["Jail time and the prayers on lockdown, writing songs on the rec"], "meaning": "He could be saying he was writing songs in jail", "annotation_id": "21573999", "url": "https://genius.com/21573999", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survivor", "line": "This for Dump, spend every dime that I got to bring him back", "vault_lines": ["This for Dump, spend every dime that I got to bring him back"], "meaning": "Desmond Hardnett, aka “Dump”, was an associate and close friend of YoungBoy who was killed in a drive by shooting in May of 2018. YoungBoy later dedicates a song called “R.I.P. Dump” to him.", "annotation_id": "18268473", "url": "https://genius.com/18268473", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survivor", "line": "Wipe a nigga’s nose, I say slatt", "vault_lines": ["Wipe a nigga's nose, I say slatt"], "meaning": "“SLATT,” or Slime Language All The Time is a phrase coined by Atlanta’s YSL and leader, Young Thug.\n\nTo wipe someone’s nose is to kill them, but also (in context) he’s wiping “slime” or mucus from someone’s nose.", "annotation_id": "16154214", "url": "https://genius.com/16154214", "state": "accepted", "votes": 7, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survivor", "line": "Bullets flyin’ like an army Convicted felon bear arms and Shoot the burner, hold it steady Hit a nigga in the arm and leg Hunger Games, Armageddon", "vault_lines": ["Bullets flyin' like an army", "Convicted felon bear arms and", "Shoot the burner, hold it steady", "Hit a nigga in the arm and leg"], "meaning": "In 2017 YoungBoy pled guilty to aggravated assault with a firearm, a felony. The charges stemmed from a 2016 drive-by shooting.\n\nIt is illegal for felons to possess firearms; however, YoungBoy claims it is necessary, and compares his violent surroundings to the free-for-all deathmatch portrayed in the Hunger Games novels, as well as Armageddon, or the end of the world.", "annotation_id": "16154174", "url": "https://genius.com/16154174", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Survivor", "line": "I take these Percs and pop that X to hide the pain", "vault_lines": ["I take these Percs and pop that X to hide the pain"], "meaning": "Percocet (Percs) is a brand of prescription painkillers, while “X” or ecstasy (MDMA) is a party drug. Both drugs come in pill form, and both are frequently abused.", "annotation_id": "16154148", "url": "https://genius.com/16154148", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
