{"type": "song", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Swag", "status": "done", "targets": 0, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Youngboy-never-broke-again-swag-lyrics", "genius_title": "Swag", "genius_id": 13362273, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Swag On Point", "line": "I just got this new supervillain shit", "vault_lines": ["I just got this new supervillain shit, I'ma wear it with some purple jeans (Yeah)"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is shouting out the rising clothing brand Supervillain Wear which YoungBoy is frequently seen wearing. Supervillain is a clothing brand owned by musician and content creator Nanks. Supervillain Wear was started by Nanks & his close friend CozyKye. Most of the clothing’s 3D models are created by Whyb3d and most of the clothing designs and logos are created by graphic designer Tylerissoepic.\n\nSupervillain Wear has made its appearances in YoungBoy Never Broke Again’s music videos Members Only, Demon Party & Made Rich and has been seen on YoungBoy’s Instagram numerous times.", "annotation_id": "29868682", "url": "https://genius.com/29868682", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Swag On Point", "line": "Givenchy necklace got me flexin’, say I’m sexy, she know not to try me (Woah, woo)", "vault_lines": ["Givenchy necklace got me flexin', say I'm sexy, she know not to try me (Woah, woo)"], "meaning": "Here Youngboy mentions his Givenchy necklace. The global ambassadors of this brand are the girlgroup aespa.", "annotation_id": "27523827", "url": "https://genius.com/27523827", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
