{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Tears of War", "line": "Damn, my wife just seen me cryin’, my life too erratic Heh, my life too erratic", "vault_lines": ["Damn, my wife just seen me cryin', my life too erratic", "Heh, my life too erratic"], "meaning": "In this line, YoungBoy reveals a vulnerable moment where his wife finds him crying, showing that despite his tough exterior he struggles deeply with his pain and problems. He acknowledges that his life is chaotic, unpredictable, and filled with emotional highs and lows.", "annotation_id": "34142688", "url": "https://genius.com/34142688", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
