{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Tears of War", "line": "I respect a gangster, I don’t want your bitch", "vault_lines": ["I respect a gangster, I don't want your bitch"], "meaning": "This could refer to the dispute between YoungBoy and Finesse2tymes. YoungBoy posted Finesse2tymes' girl on his IG story with the caption ‘ I got the bag’ after Finesse2tymes had slide in Jaz’s (YoungBoy’s wife) dm’s. Then to go on later to drop  a song together. This could show that there’s no beef between the two artist and that YoungBoy really doesn’t want Finesse2tymes' girl.", "annotation_id": "32148455", "url": "https://genius.com/32148455", "state": "pending", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
