{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Dumb Way", "line": "And bust his head, you know the dumb way Spinnin’ in the broad day, with them cutters Yeah, the dumb way", "vault_lines": ["And bust his head, you know the dumb way", "Spinnin' in the broad day, with them cutters", "Yeah, the dumb way"], "meaning": "“The Dumb Way” is a known saying for Louisiana rappers who come out of Baton Rouge.\n\nBy it’s obvious context it’s just saying to do something extreme just as going all out on something, acting wild, without holding back.\n\nSince he says in broad day, ALLEGEDLY, he’s gonna not give a fuck, and spin in the day where people could be working, walking by, busy street/city, etc.", "annotation_id": "41240791", "url": "https://genius.com/41240791", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Dumb Way", "status": "done", "targets": 1, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Youngboy-never-broke-again-the-dumb-way-lyrics", "genius_title": "The Dumb Way", "genius_id": 5190896, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Gaulden’s", "line": "I’m Jazlyn husband, I’m known for thuggin’, I’m known for fuckin’ on hoes (What else?)", "vault_lines": ["I'm Jazlyn husband, I'm known for thuggin', I'm known for fuckin' on hoes (What else?)"], "meaning": "Despite being in a marriage with his wife jazlyn mychelle, nba youngboy expresses his desire to “thug her” and cheat in his relationship.", "annotation_id": "40727093", "url": "https://genius.com/40727093", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Gaulden’s", "line": "Hit his ass, pussy-ass, down in the dome, bitch-ass nigga, get on, ha", "vault_lines": ["Hit his ass, pussy-ass, down in the dome, bitch-ass nigga, get on, ha"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is talking about the fight in jail where he knocked out an inmate for going around the cell block claiming he was going to beat up NBA YoungBoy whenever he seen him. The man rushed at YoungBoy and YoungBoy beat him up.", "annotation_id": "40649897", "url": "https://genius.com/40649897", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Gaulden’s", "line": "Throwin’ out billies on billies to all my hoes like they sedans (Huh, huh)", "vault_lines": ["Throwin' out billies on billies to all my hoes like they sedans (Huh, huh)"], "meaning": "This lyric features YoungBoy comparing the way he carelessly drops thousands of dollars on multiple women to the everyday process of dropping off passengers in standard 4-door cars.\n\nLyric Breakdown:\n\nThrowin' out billies on billies: Slang for throwing out bundles of $1,000 bills (or throwing stacks of cash in general) on women.\n\nTo all my hoes like they sedans: A clever wordplay on “sedans” and “see dance.\n\n“The \"Sedan” Pun: Sedans are common, everyday passenger cars. He is saying he tosses money at his women as effortlessly and casually as if he were just pulling up to drop off passengers in a standard sedan.\n\nThe “See Dance” Pun: It is a double entendre that also implies paying strippers or women to “see dance” for his own entertainment.\n\nThemes:\n\nFlashy Spending: Bragging about his extreme wealth and how freely he spends it.\n\nPlayboy Lifestyle: Bragging about juggling multiple women at the same time and keeping them all satisfied with cash. – Gemini AI", "annotation_id": "40648842", "url": "https://genius.com/40648842", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
