{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Gaulden’s", "line": "Veeta", "vault_lines": ["You already knowin' these pussy-ass niggas can't stop if, Veeta"], "meaning": "Shortened nickname of YoungBoy “Velveeta.” He nicknamed himself that because of all the money he gets. Velveeta is a cheese brand, and cheese is slang for money.", "annotation_id": "40646692", "url": "https://genius.com/40646692", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
