{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Gaulden’s", "line": "Tellin’ that lil’ ho, period, “I don’t give one fuck, you could call the cops, ho”", "vault_lines": ["Tellin' that lil' ho, period, \"I don't give one fuck, you could call the cops, ho\""], "meaning": "YB isn’t saying he said the word “period,” he’s saying he told her period. Meaning, he told her bluntly that he doesn’t care if she calls the cops or not. That’s the type of period he was interpreting, not the slang that women use", "annotation_id": "40646518", "url": "https://genius.com/40646518", "state": "pending", "votes": -1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Gaulden’s", "line": "Fuckin’ that ho on her period, she know I’m a blood, I’m hittin’ her spot, bro", "vault_lines": ["Fuckin' that ho on her period, she know I'm a blood, I'm hittin' her spot, bro"], "meaning": "Having sex with a girl on her period. A period is the cycle a girl has every month, no standard time, each has their own period (see what I did there? no? was corny? okay, back to the annotation) where the girl leaks blood. This happens because of a disruption inside of the uterus? Somebody correct me if I’m wrong. YoungBoy uses that to go with the fact he’s a UBN member (United Blood Nation) which has nothing to do with it, just fun way of putting it. “Hitting her spot” that spot would be the G-spot. The spot all women want men to reach, as it causes satisfaction for them. They release orgasms. He claims he does that for a particular women while she’s on her period.", "annotation_id": "40646354", "url": "https://genius.com/40646354", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
