{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The North Bleeding", "line": "No new shoes ’til mama get her taxes", "vault_lines": ["No new shoes 'til mama get her taxes"], "meaning": "Youngboy is reminiscing back to the days when he couldn’t get a new pair of shoes until his mother got her taxes. Now he’s living large and his closet’s full of heat", "annotation_id": "25549669", "url": "https://genius.com/25549669", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The North Bleeding", "line": "Swervin’ in that Rolls, ’member back up in the day it was a stolo", "vault_lines": ["Swervin' in that Rolls, 'member back up in the day it was a stolo"], "meaning": "Youngboy owns a Rolls Royce Cullinan, with a sticker price of $330,000. He is also reminiscing on the time where he didn’t have this type of money for these types of cars, and he was riding in a stolen vehicle.", "annotation_id": "25513866", "url": "https://genius.com/25513866", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The North Bleeding", "line": "I stack that money up tall just in case bad days call", "vault_lines": ["I stack that money up tall just in case bad days call"], "meaning": "Youngboy is stacking his money so that he has a backup plan. If something happened to him (like going to jail) where he could not make new music, him and his family would be taken care of.", "annotation_id": "25513846", "url": "https://genius.com/25513846", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
