{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Story of O.J. (Top Version)", "line": "This shit ain’t no fugazi,", "vault_lines": ["Aim and blow the bitch, strapped down, soldier shit, never be no more of this"], "meaning": "A fugazi is something that is fake. The term was popularised by M. Scorsese’s 2013 film “The Wolf Of Wall Street”", "annotation_id": "27311518", "url": "https://genius.com/27311518", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Story of O.J. (Top Version)", "line": "These bitch-ass niggas still gon’ criticize it ’cause they don’t understand Fuck you gon’ criticize a made man? (You a bitch)", "vault_lines": ["These bitch-ass niggas still gon' criticize it 'cause they don't understand", "Fuck you gon' criticize a made man? (You a bitch)"], "meaning": "Ignorant people often criticize that which they cannot comprehend. Despite this, they may be poor. People less successful than YB cricitize him.", "annotation_id": "27311511", "url": "https://genius.com/27311511", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Story of O.J. (Top Version)", "line": "Young nigga, OG demeanor, they don’t fuck with him Rap nigga, trap nigga, lover boy, gang member Still nigga (That’s me, what they talkin’ bout?) Still nigga", "vault_lines": ["Still nigga (That's me, what they talkin' bout?)"], "meaning": "No matter how successful YB gets, or how many personas he has (rapper, gang member, etc), many people, especially white people, will still see him as just black, hence: “still nigga”", "annotation_id": "27311502", "url": "https://genius.com/27311502", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
