{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Story of O.J. (Top Version)", "line": "Riding down Canal with a PTR, bitch, it be", "vault_lines": ["Riding down Canal with a PTR, bitch, it be mistaken for a MAC-11"], "meaning": "I explain About the line before “Top number 1 knocking down building 9/11”\n\nHe went number one with the album TOP which dropped on 9/11\n\nalso on 9/11 were a series of four coordinated terrorist attacks by the militant Islamist terrorist group al-Qaeda they knocking down the Twin Towers", "annotation_id": "25175741", "url": "https://genius.com/25175741", "state": "pending", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Story of O.J. (Top Version)", "line": "But the man thinkin’ he get ten percent from me allowing him to allow someone else to pay me, dumb bitch", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "A further reference to United Masters and how recording labels have traditionally owned the rights to musicians' work, something that Youngboy has no intention of giving up due to the “ten percent” he’d lose of any deal if signed to a label.", "annotation_id": "22939955", "url": "https://genius.com/22939955", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Story of O.J. (Top Version)", "line": "Convicted felon rollin’, smokin’ all morning with another five years on my hip", "vault_lines": ["Convicted felon rollin', smokin' all morning with another five years on my hip"], "meaning": "As a previously convicted felon, a subsequent gun possession charge would carry a 5 year minimum sentence.", "annotation_id": "22939937", "url": "https://genius.com/22939937", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "The Story of O.J. (Top Version)", "line": "The Shade Room was posting things, they ain’t understand how I’m living, slime But they wouldn’t understand how I’m twenty clockin’ over ten million now, huh?", "vault_lines": ["The Shade Room was posting things, they ain't understand how I'm living, slime", "But they wouldn't understand how I'm twenty clockin' over ten million now, huh?"], "meaning": "The Shade Room is an American media company focusing on rap music that primarily distributes content through Instagram. Past coverage of NBA Youngboy’s arrests and status of his relationships on The Shade Room has been highly critical, explaining this insult.", "annotation_id": "22939926", "url": "https://genius.com/22939926", "state": "pending", "votes": 15, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
