{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "This Month Confessions", "line": "You ain’t never once quit on me, how many times you had to get cleaned", "vault_lines": ["You ain't never once quit on me, how many times you had to get cleaned?"], "meaning": "He loves his girl so fucking much for staying with him, getting over things with him, and putting up with his truama and problems. He’s talking about sexually transmitted diseases here, and asking a rhetorical question, how many times has she got cleaned? Cleaned in this scenario means getting rid of the STD.", "annotation_id": "38659253", "url": "https://genius.com/38659253", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
