{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "This Month Confessions", "line": "Now Yaya pregnant, gotta make her get rid of it, this ain’t the time, I told you no", "vault_lines": ["Now Yaya pregnant, gotta make her get rid of it, this ain't the time, I told you no"], "meaning": "Yaya Mayweather is his ex and mother of his son, Kentrell Jr. In July 2025, rumors were circulating that Yaya was pregnant again and he seemingly confirms it here.", "annotation_id": "36561022", "url": "https://genius.com/36561022", "state": "pending", "votes": 3, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
