{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "This Not a Song “This for My Supporters”", "line": "I got C-Murder on my phone", "vault_lines": ["I got C-Murder on my phone"], "meaning": "C Murder is a OG baton rouge rapper. Youngboy remixed his a song “Like A Jungle” titled Out Numbered where he shouted out C Murder on the song numerous times. C Murder is currently incarcerated and serving life in prison.", "annotation_id": "31663207", "url": "https://genius.com/31663207", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
