{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Thrasher", "line": "RedEye versus that cop car, that’s a cold chase (Skrrt, skrrt) No way", "vault_lines": ["RedEye versus that cop car, that's a cold chase (Skrrt, skrrt)"], "meaning": "A Redeye is a Dodge Charger or Challenger Hellcat. This car is extremely fast, and Youngboy is saying a cop car stands no chance against this type of vehicle, hence “that’s a cold chase” NBA Youngboy owns two hellcats, one charger and one challenger redeye.", "annotation_id": "22911499", "url": "https://genius.com/22911499", "state": "pending", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
