{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Through the Storm", "line": "[Intro] (I need to talk to Mike Laury) (Hello? It’s Mike Laury)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "This intro was sampled from a scene in the movie Bad Boys (1995), where Marcus Burnett (played by Martin Lawrence) takes a call from Julie Mott (played by Tea Leoni), pretending to be Detective Mike Lowrey.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Cu2gVjiE6Uw", "annotation_id": "24596438", "url": "https://genius.com/24596438", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
