{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Through the Storm", "line": "I’m in the middle of the room posted with a .44", "vault_lines": ["I'm in the middle of the room posted with a .44"], "meaning": "44 Magnum laid claim to being the most powerful handgun in the world, its standard load produced about 900 ft. -lb. of muzzle energy. Several new loads have since eclipsed that, but the handgun most commonly used by big game hunters.", "annotation_id": "22475275", "url": "https://genius.com/22475275", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Through the Storm", "line": "I told Nene I’m comin’ back, she think I’m with a hoe though", "vault_lines": ["I told Nene I'm comin' back, she think I'm with a hoe though"], "meaning": "Nene* is NBA Youngboys nickname for his girlfriend Jania.\nShe has been a big part of his music and life since 2017. He has mentioned her in multiple songs such as Drawing Symbols, which came out September 2018, Lonely Child which came out October 2019 and Red Eye which came out February 2020.\nhttps://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn%3AANd9GcQkRz89wlFFMH-Ueg1Fh1dAVOWkslBk984s3w&usqp=CAU", "annotation_id": "21032111", "url": "https://genius.com/21032111", "state": "pending", "votes": 10, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Through the Storm", "line": "Today Friday so you know we on that Clyde and Dodo", "vault_lines": ["Today Friday so you know we on that Clyde and Dodo"], "meaning": "Youngboy is referring the the movie Friday After the Next where Craig, played by Ice Cube, and Day-Day, played by Mike Epps, get jobs as mall security. Their Employer Moly refers to them as Clyde and Dodo.", "annotation_id": "19076539", "url": "https://genius.com/19076539", "state": "accepted", "votes": 20, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
