{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Thug Alibi", "line": "23 up on my shoe, .223 up in this coupe", "vault_lines": ["23 up on my shoe, .223 up in this coupe"], "meaning": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again is rocking Jordans on his feet. Michael Jordan’s NBA number was 23. A .223 is a rifle cartridge.\n\nYoungBoy is in his coupe, rocking jays and being strapped up.", "annotation_id": "12890806", "url": "https://genius.com/12890806", "state": "accepted", "votes": 5, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
