{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Thug Nigga Story", "line": "Double-cup in the mud", "vault_lines": ["Double-fist and the double-cup in the mud (In the mud)"], "meaning": "A true, double cup reference is the stacking of two Styrofoam cups that contain Promethazine with Codeine then mixed with soda (commonly Sprite) and a jolly rancher.", "annotation_id": "29026955", "url": "https://genius.com/29026955", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
