{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Thug of Spades", "line": "Main nigga, big Rollie, big pistol", "vault_lines": ["Main nigga, big Rollie, big pistol"], "meaning": "Youngboy is saying that big rollie and big pistol is needed\n\nRollie is referred to Rolex. Rolex is a Swiss luxury watch manufacturer based in Geneva, Switzerland. Originally founded as Wilsdorf and Davis by Hans Wilsdorf and Alfred Davis in London, England in 1905, the company registered Rolex as the brand name of its watches in 1908 and became Rolex Watch Co. Ltd. in 1915. Its price ranges from $8,550 and $7,500.", "annotation_id": "19658129", "url": "https://genius.com/19658129", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
