{"type": "song", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Timeless", "status": "done", "targets": 0, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Youngboy-never-broke-again-timeless-lyrics", "genius_title": "Timeless", "genius_id": 6543674, "source": "api"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "To My Lowest", "line": "It ain’t no reason another man should have to raise my son Claim that you bleedin’, another man shouldn’t have to bust your gun", "vault_lines": ["It ain't no reason another man should have to raise my son"], "meaning": "These lines delve into themes of fatherhood, duty, and selflessness. The first line expresses the speaker’s worry that someone else might end up raising his son, stressing the parental role he feels he ought to take on. The second line builds on this idea, implying that another man shouldn’t have to “bust your gun,” which suggests the need to protect or defend the person being addressed—a responsibility the speaker thinks he should handle himself. Altogether, these lines reflect a feeling of obligation and perhaps a sense of regret or frustration about not being able to fulfill these expectations.", "annotation_id": "36410770", "url": "https://genius.com/36410770", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "To My Lowest", "line": "You hurt me deep when I was down to my lowest I needed you, you ain’t give a fuck ’bout me growing All this pain I’ve been showing I ain’t never stop, just keep on flowin’", "vault_lines": ["All this pain I've been showing", "I ain't never stop, just keep on flowin'"], "meaning": "This lyrics show the pain of being left behind at the lowest point, especially by someone who was supposed to care but didn’t. Even with all the hurt, the artist keeps going, using the pain as fuel to grow and move forward.", "annotation_id": "34607378", "url": "https://genius.com/34607378", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "To My Lowest", "line": "Written in my eyes, pedigree I ain’t in no kennel, I’m a dog tryna feed my needs", "vault_lines": ["Written in my eyes, pedigree", "I ain't in no kennel, I'm a dog tryna feed my needs"], "meaning": "Pedigree is dog food and dog food means in slang heroin\n\nIts a hint for heroin use (which is common in the south)", "annotation_id": "29427934", "url": "https://genius.com/29427934", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "To My Lowest", "line": "Yeah, fuckin’ on someone else and textin’ like you want me, disrespectful", "vault_lines": ["Yeah, fuckin' on someone else and textin' like you want me, disrespectful"], "meaning": "the girl is showing ground level respect, acting like she wants yb, then going behind his back and crossing her own words.", "annotation_id": "27662553", "url": "https://genius.com/27662553", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
