{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Top Cobain", "line": "All I hear on the stage when I’m walkin’ up on it, “Top Cobain” (Top Cobain) “Top Cobain” (Top Cobain) Say my name (Say my name, Top Cobain) “Top Cobain”", "vault_lines": ["All I hear on the stage when I'm walkin' up on it, \"Top Cobain\" (Top Cobain)", "\"Top Cobain\" (Top Cobain)"], "meaning": "This is definitely a tribute to the late Kurt Cobain, he was the lead vocalist, guitarist, primary songwriter, and a founding member of the grunge band Nirvana.\nSafe to say Kurt embodied the definition of Rockstar but unfortunately died suicidal.", "annotation_id": "37953358", "url": "https://genius.com/37953358", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
