{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Toxic Punk", "line": "(Dmac on the fuckin’ track)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "This is the official producer tag for David McDowell, otherwise, known as Dmac.\n\nDmac has produced for many artists such as Dave East, BlocBoy JB, and TrenchMobb.\n\nDmac’s most popular tracks are, “No Stylist” by Dave East, “Left Right” by BlocBoy JB, and this track.", "annotation_id": "38469174", "url": "https://genius.com/38469174", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Toxic Punk", "line": "Thinkin’ ’bout you gone, it got me sad Ridin’ fast, police on my ass, uh Do the dash, hopin’ I don’t crash But if I do, so (Hm)", "vault_lines": ["Thinkin' 'bout you gone, it got me sad", "Ridin' fast, police on my ass, uh", "Do the dash, hopin' I don't crash"], "meaning": "With the absence of his loved one, Youngboy is saying that he is so upset that it is causing him to drive fast, causing the police to be after him.\nHe then says he hopes he doesn’t crash, but in his depression over the loss of a loved one, he realizes he truly doesn’t care", "annotation_id": "25887156", "url": "https://genius.com/25887156", "state": "pending", "votes": 13, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
