{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Trapped Out", "line": "Them niggas shot up my whole car, BaBa got them up off my ass", "vault_lines": ["Them niggas shot up my whole car, BaBa got them up off my ass"], "meaning": "YB is talking about the May 2019 shooting targeting him and his team in Sunny Isles Beach, Florida. They were in Miami for YB’s performance at the Rolling Loud festival. Someone in a black Cadillac Escalade opened fire on YB’s car outside his hotel and struck his then girlfriend in the arm. Some of YB’s people, including his friend Baba, shot back and several innocent bystanders were struck, one man fatally. No criminal charges were filed against YB and his team because of Florida’s Stand Your Ground law. But YB and Baba were later sued by the family of the killed bystander. The TBG rapper Lit Yoshi is suspected of involvement in the shooting.", "annotation_id": "35748731", "url": "https://genius.com/35748731", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
