{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Turnt Up", "line": "I’ma rock a nigga, I’ma play it like Carti", "vault_lines": ["I'ma rock a nigga, I’ma play it like Carti"], "meaning": "Homage to carti, referring to “Milly Rock”, which is a line from “Magnolia” by Playboi Carti.\n\nHe says this cause P'ierre is mainly one of Carti’s producers during the 2018 era.\n\nHe also mentions atl in the song, which might’ve been to how his time in atl, which he was later arrested in April of 2018.", "annotation_id": "41447448", "url": "https://genius.com/41447448", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
