{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Tyuiio (Dealing With You)", "line": "Berge on the track, bet they want Mike Lowrey (Dubba-AA)", "vault_lines": ["Berge on the track, bet they want Mike Lowrey (Dubba-AA)"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is talking about how his fans don’t want berge.af as the producer of this song, or his tracks. They want Infamous Dubba-AA’s producer to produce again, and the tag, “Hello, It’s Mike Lowrey” wants to be heard instead because of his discography contribution, and made hits with Youngboy’s raw pain through the mic,  being more touching and memorable to most fans.", "annotation_id": "36148603", "url": "https://genius.com/36148603", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
