{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Umm Hmm", "line": "Youngin sixteen, that’s who we got with the Drac’ and he ain’t got no aim", "vault_lines": ["Youngin sixteen, that's who we got with the Drac' and he ain't got no aim"], "meaning": "This line has been updated to reflect the correct lyric: ‘and he ain’t got no name,’ showing that YoungBoy is identifying the shooter as unknown, not lacking skill.", "annotation_id": "38192300", "url": "https://genius.com/38192300", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Umm Hmm", "line": "Spin it, don’t compare me to these broke-ass niggas", "vault_lines": ["Spin it, don't compare me to these broke-ass niggas"], "meaning": "This is a subliminal shot at rapper Lil Durk. From 2021 to 2023, there was a trend where NBA YoungBoy fans would constantly say ‘YB better.’ In this song, YoungBoy uses that phrase to imply that he’s better than Lil Durk, making it clear that people shouldn’t compare him to Durk", "annotation_id": "37764407", "url": "https://genius.com/37764407", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Umm Hmm", "line": "Haha, laughin’, but I’ll shoot you in your shit, hold up, baow, baow", "vault_lines": ["Haha, laughin’, but I'll shoot you in your shit, hold up, baow, baow"], "meaning": "Here, YoungBoy Never Broke Again could possibly be referring to Lil Durk’s “AHHH HA” — a diss track directed at YoungBoy regarding the death of the late King Von.\n\nThe diss track’s title “AHHH HA” is a common way to type laughter. Nearing the end of the song’s music video, Durk can be seen in a room full of people while everyone can be seen shouting “AHHH HA.” YB later sampled the clip at the end of Durk’s video while promoting his The Last Slimeto Merchandise.\n\nYoungBoy and Durk have had an ongoing “beef” following the death of King Von as YB is a close affiliate of Lul Timm, the man responsible for Von’s murder.", "annotation_id": "26432135", "url": "https://genius.com/26432135", "state": "accepted", "votes": 31, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "song", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Umm Hmm", "status": "done", "targets": 3, "clicked": 0, "genius_url": "https://genius.com/Youngboy-never-broke-again-umm-hmm-lyrics", "genius_title": "Umm Hmm", "genius_id": 8265673, "source": "api"}
