{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Untouchable", "line": "I put my all into this shit, man I can’t fuckin’ lose", "vault_lines": ["I put my all into this shit, man I can't fuckin' lose"], "meaning": "YoungBoy is saying he’s fully invested in what he’s doing—his career, hustle, or life—and that there’s a real risk of failure. He’s expressing both passion and vulnerability, showing that even though he’s strong and confident, the stakes are high and losing would hurt deeply.", "annotation_id": "38741167", "url": "https://genius.com/38741167", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
