{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Up Nawth (Better days)", "line": "I won’t ever spill, put that on Josiah Knock ’em all, go read the bible", "vault_lines": ["I won't ever spill, put that on Josiah", "Knock 'em all, go read the bible"], "meaning": "He is referring to Josiah in the bible which he followed a specific rules from God.\n\nHe removed people who aren’t doing the things they should be doing or are bad to anyone, and by also removing the idols, altars, and pagan shrines in Judah after hearing the Book of the Law read to him.\n\nHe followed Gods commands immediately to make him to true worship, and making his life a lot easier and mind clearing.", "annotation_id": "38668325", "url": "https://genius.com/38668325", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Up Nawth (Better days)", "line": "And I’m forever standing tall, just like the Eiffel Tower", "vault_lines": ["And I'm forever standing tall, just like the Eiffel Tower"], "meaning": "The Eiffel Tower is know for its amazing Architecture since engineering was something that mattered in most of the early world’s development. Tt has made a impact on how the structure evolved and how buildings last long, so YoungBoy just refers to that but simple terms, he just saying he’s going to be strong.", "annotation_id": "38668308", "url": "https://genius.com/38668308", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
