{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Valuable Pain", "line": "I got too many brothers that done died by the gun", "vault_lines": ["I got too many brothers that done died by the gun"], "meaning": "Youngboy is saying he has had friends and family that have died to gun violence. One of his closest friends and former manager, nicknamed “Dump” was gunned down in Baton Rouge in 2018. Since then, Youngboy has frequently mentioned him in songs, in “RIP Dump” he says, “Rest in peace to my nigga, Big Dump I miss you I just wish I was there\nFeed off the pain and fuck the gang, shit ain’t the same since you left”", "annotation_id": "41553679", "url": "https://genius.com/41553679", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
