{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Valuable Pain", "line": "I don’t know shit about no Jodeci", "vault_lines": ["I don't know shit about no Jodeci"], "meaning": "Jodeci is an American R&B quartet with members DeVanté Swing, Mr. Dalvin, K-Ci, and JoJo. Formed in 1989 in Charlotte, North Carolina, Jodeci’s members began their musical careers as two duos of brothers and, after years of limited success, joined forces. After signing with Uptown Records in 1991, the group began to work on their debut album, Forever My Lady, which brought them mainstream success with the Billboard Hot 100 single “Come and Talk to Me” and the album’s titular track. Youngboy is saying he dont kno nun bout Jodeci", "annotation_id": "21988472", "url": "https://genius.com/21988472", "state": "pending", "votes": 11, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
