{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Valuable Pain", "line": "Smokin’ on this Cherry Pie, fuckin’ your favorite athlete daughter", "vault_lines": ["Smokin' on this Cherry Pie, fuckin' your favorite athlete daughter"], "meaning": "Many speculate that YoungBoy and professional boxer Floyd Mayweather’s oldest daughter Iyanna, nicknamed “Yaya,” have relations.\n\nIn his song “Blasian,” YoungBoy raps:\n\nYaya, what I do to you?\nWhat the fuck is it gon' take?", "annotation_id": "15987841", "url": "https://genius.com/15987841", "state": "accepted", "votes": 55, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
