{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Vette Motors", "line": "(Oh Lord, jetson made another one)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "This producer tag belongs to jetsonmade\n\nTahj Morgan, also known as jetsonmade (formerly stylised as JetsonMade), is a Carolina-based producer best recognised for producing many of DaBaby’s breakout songs, including “Suge,” “BOP,” “Goin Baby,” and “VIBEZ,” among others.\n\nHe has worked with 21 Savage, Roddy Ricch, Playboi Carti, YoungBoy Never Broke Again, Lil Keed, Young Nudy, Smokepurpp, and many other musicians, and has become a go-to producer in the Hip-Hop genre.\n\n@jetsonmade", "annotation_id": "28775838", "url": "https://genius.com/28775838", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Vette Motors", "line": "Fill up a clip or go fill up a safe (Buh, buh, buh, buh)", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "In this context, “fill up a clip” refers to loading a gun magazine with bullets, while “fill up a safe” means putting money in a safe.\n\nThe line can be interpreted as a juxtaposition of violence and wealth, with the choice between filling up a clip or filling up a safe representing a decision between engaging in dangerous, violent behavior or pursuing financial security and success. It could also be seen as a reflection of the harsh realities of many people in impoverished communities, where violence and crime are often prevalent and money can be difficult to come by through legal means.", "annotation_id": "28124409", "url": "https://genius.com/28124409", "state": "pending", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Vette Motors", "line": "Bought that bitch that rock and told her, “It better not get shown once, ho” (Better not)", "vault_lines": ["Crash out, turn up, bought that bitch that rock and told her, \"It better not get shown once, ho\" (Better not)"], "meaning": "He bought his girl an engagement ring with a big Diamond in told her to never show it off youngboy don’t like to show really nothing he owns", "annotation_id": "26441611", "url": "https://genius.com/26441611", "state": "pending", "votes": 4, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
