{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Walking Dead", "line": "I run that money up, I could fill a Brinks truck", "vault_lines": ["I run that money up, I could fill a Brinks truck (Fill a Brinks)"], "meaning": "A Brinks truck is a type of armored truck that specializes in carrying large sums of cash or valuable goods. These trucks are heavily armored and bullet resistant. A Brinks truck has the capacity to carry up to 600 million dollars. Youngboy is saying that he has so much money he could fill one of these trucks.", "annotation_id": "22940758", "url": "https://genius.com/22940758", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
