{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Warzone", "line": "Whitey Bulger, my swag", "vault_lines": ["Shotta shades, Whitey Bulger, my swag (My swag)"], "meaning": "James Joseph “Whitey” Bulger Jr. was an American organized crime boss who led the Winter Hill Gang, an Irish Mob group in the Winter Hill neighborhood of Somerville, Massachusetts, a city directly northwest of Boston.\n\nYoungBoy also has a song named “Whitey Bulger” that is on his 2020 album, “Until I Return”.", "annotation_id": "32378666", "url": "https://genius.com/32378666", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Warzone", "line": "High definition Patek", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "In this context, “Patek” is shorthand for Patek Philippe, a luxury Swiss watch brand. When YoungBoy refers to a “High Definition Patek,” he is likely talking about a highly detailed and possibly customized or diamond-encrusted version of a Patek Philippe watch, highlighting its luxury and high value.\n\nThis term is used to convey wealth, status, and the rapper’s taste for high-end, luxurious items.", "annotation_id": "32378641", "url": "https://genius.com/32378641", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Warzone", "line": "Still flexin and steppin, this Top", "vault_lines": ["Still flexin and steppin, this Top (Top, mmm)"], "meaning": "“Still Flexin, Still Steppin” is a mixtape by the American rapper YoungBoy Never Broke Again (NBA YoungBoy). Released on February 21, 2020, it features 14 tracks and showcases YoungBoy’s distinctive style of blending raw, emotional lyrics with hard-hitting beats.\n\nThe mixtape includes popular songs like “Lil Top” and “Red Eye,” and it generally explores themes of street life, personal struggles, and resilience. The project received positive reviews for its production and YoungBoy’s consistent energy and authenticity.\n\nFor more details on the mixtape, you can visit its Wikipedia page.", "annotation_id": "32378634", "url": "https://genius.com/32378634", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
