{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Wat Chu Gone Do", "line": "Longway, Longway, really crippin’ lil nigga", "vault_lines": ["Longway, Longway, really crippin' lil nigga"], "meaning": "Although he sometimes tries to deny it, PeeWee Longway is a Rollin 60’s Neighborhood Crip. He frequently raps about this as well as heavily wearing and repping the color blue. He even featured himself as a blue M&M on the album covers of his Blue M&M Mixtape series\n\nhttps://twitter.com/peeweelongway/status/325068874527698945?lang=en", "annotation_id": "12845072", "url": "https://genius.com/12845072", "state": "accepted", "votes": 6, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Wat Chu Gone Do", "line": "Don’t let me find out you gon’ stunt with that tec", "vault_lines": ["Don't let me find out you gon' stunt with that tec"], "meaning": "A Tec-9 is a semi-automatic 9mm pistol popular for being relatively cheap and effective. Its simple design makes it easy to fix and customize.", "annotation_id": "12487745", "url": "https://genius.com/12487745", "state": "accepted", "votes": 8, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
