{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "What Da What?", "line": "Probably mad, one of your hoes, I fucked her, hm, street, mm", "vault_lines": ["Probably mad, one of your hoes, I fucked her, hm, street, mm"], "meaning": "Youngboy is alluding that he had sex with one of Future’s girlfriends and which is probably why Future doesn’t like him, He also says ‘'Street’‘ nickname to Future’s late friend and rapper Young Scooter, whose nickname is 'Street’ He is seemingly trying to taunt him,", "annotation_id": "41564294", "url": "https://genius.com/41564294", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "What Da What?", "line": "Fuck ‘em, them youngins gon’ catch ’em and do ’em for free (Skrrt, skrrt) Pussy, I call that free bandin’ (Skrrt, skrrt), bitch, fuck ya Fuck ya", "vault_lines": ["Fuck 'em, them youngins gon' catch 'em and do 'em for free (Skrrt, skrrt)", "Pussy, I call that free bandin' (Skrrt, skrrt), bitch, fuck ya"], "meaning": "YoungBoy flips the name of Future’s record label, Freebandz, into a disrespectful pun. While “freebandz” originally implies stacks of cash wrapped in rubber bands, YoungBoy redefines “free bandin” as having his young shooters slide on his enemies without needing a payout (“do em for free”). – Gemini AI", "annotation_id": "40670160", "url": "https://genius.com/40670160", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "What Da What?", "line": "I’m fuckin’ they daughters, I’m slidin’ in— yeah", "vault_lines": ["I'm fuckin' they daughters, I'm slidin' in— yeah"], "meaning": "YB’s baby mama is Yaya, which is the daughter of Floyd Maywhether. He’s saying he f*cked yaya.", "annotation_id": "40612748", "url": "https://genius.com/40612748", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "What Da What?", "line": "I wan’ go bezel for bezel I wanna go hit after hit (Wanna go hit after hit) I wanna go million for million Pussy wan’ probably go bitch for bitch", "vault_lines": ["I wan' go bezel for bezel", "I wanna go hit after hit (Wanna go hit after hit)", "I wanna go million for million", "Pussy wan' probably go bitch for bitch"], "meaning": "YoungBoy expresses how he wants to go bezel for bezel, hit song after hit song, millions after millions with Future, and says that Future would probably just wanna go girl for girl, which YoungBoy doesn’t care about.", "annotation_id": "40599940", "url": "https://genius.com/40599940", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "What Da What?", "line": "Old-ass nigga, I’ma catch ya down bad and stretch ya (Stretch ya)", "vault_lines": ["Old-ass nigga, I'ma catch ya down bad and stretch ya (Stretch ya)"], "meaning": "A potential diss to Future after the tension they’ve had, well actually just the tension YoungBoy showed all throughout his IG stories yesterday, July 9.", "annotation_id": "40598488", "url": "https://genius.com/40598488", "state": "pending", "votes": 2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "What Da What?", "line": "This nigga mad ’cause I just fucked his bitch", "vault_lines": [], "meaning": "There’s speculation he had sex with Mellow Rackz, so this could be a diss towards Kodak Black as Mellow Rackz was in the IG live with YoungBoy, letting YoungBoy touch all on her, and they hugged. She was in the bathroom tub all comfortable like, she had a hangover and wasn’t feeling too well.", "annotation_id": "40598450", "url": "https://genius.com/40598450", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
