{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Willing To Die (Lost Soul)", "line": "Death before dishonor", "vault_lines": ["Death before dishonor, every nigga with me, they dumpin'"], "meaning": "Lil Phat even talked about the phrase “Death before dishonor” which means someone would prefer to die than to act shamefully or disgracefully, symbolizing a commitment to integrity, loyalty, and personal values above all else, even life itself.", "annotation_id": "37028186", "url": "https://genius.com/37028186", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
