{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "XXX", "line": "Sex and violence (Huh), sex and violence (Huh, huh) Sex and violence (Huh, huh), sex and violence (Slatt) Sex and violence (Uh, uh), sex and violence (Uh, uh) Sex and violence (Baow), sex and violence (Come on) Sex and violence (Huh), sex and violence (Let’s do it) Sex and violence, sex and violence (Woo) Sex and violence (Go), sex and violence (5) Sex and violence, sex and violence", "vault_lines": ["Sex and violence, sex and violence"], "meaning": "Here (Again) The glorious Kentrell DeSaun Gaulden yells about his favorite two things again. I sure hope he doesn’t yell again about these things", "annotation_id": "38659782", "url": "https://genius.com/38659782", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "XXX", "line": "Sex and violence, sex and violence Sex and violence, sex and violence Sex and violence (Baow), sex and violence (Come on) Sex and violence (Huh), sex and violence (Let’s do it) Sex and violence, sex and violence (Wow) Sex and violence, sex and violence Sex and violence, sex and violence", "vault_lines": ["Sex and violence, sex and violence"], "meaning": "Mr. Never Broke Again expresses how much he loves his two favorite things in the world by repeating “sex and violence” 16 times. He is really passionate about these as you can hear from his voice.", "annotation_id": "36874330", "url": "https://genius.com/36874330", "state": "pending", "votes": 9, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "XXX", "line": "Make America Slimy Again", "vault_lines": ["Make America Slimy Again"], "meaning": "YoungBoy endorses US President Donald Trump by repurposing his “Make America Great Again” slogan, a complete 180 from his 2017 song “Red Rum” where he rapped:\n\nAnd fuck Donald Trump, bitch, that NBA shit\n\nHe has reasons though; after being sentenced to 27 months in prison on gun possession and identity fraud charges, among others, President Trump officially pardoned him and released him from prison in March 2025.", "annotation_id": "36403455", "url": "https://genius.com/36403455", "state": "pending", "votes": 1, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
