{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "XXX", "line": "Whatever Trump doin’, bitch, it’s good for the unity", "vault_lines": ["Whatever Trump doin', bitch, it's good for the unity"], "meaning": "Kentrell Shows love to United States President Donald Trump. The Trump administration pardoned Kentrells federal Charges on May 28th 2025 which is what likely led to this line.", "annotation_id": "36354715", "url": "https://genius.com/36354715", "state": "pending", "votes": 12, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
