{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "You Knew", "line": "As long as I got you, with bitches, I’m through For a fact, I won’t watch you, you fuck up, that’s you ’Cause you do what you do and you knew", "vault_lines": ["As long as I got you, with bitches, I'm through", "For a fact, I won't watch you, you fuck up, that's you"], "meaning": "YB states that as long as he has his lady, he doesn’t need no other woman. He also states that he won’t watch her behavior closely because she’s old enough to know right from wrong, so if she cheats, that’s on her, not him.", "annotation_id": "41778824", "url": "https://genius.com/41778824", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "You Knew", "line": "See my exes ain’t adding and you label ’em five Don’t be sayin’ what you said, got me hurtin’ inside", "vault_lines": ["See my exes ain't adding and you label 'em five", "Don't be sayin' what you said, got me hurtin' inside"], "meaning": "“See my actions ain’t addin' and you label ‘em foul\nSo me seein’ what you said got me hurtin' inside”\n\nThese two lines show why their relationship is failing. She doesn’t understand his actions, so she judges them negatively, and what she says leaves YoungBoy hurt emotionally.", "annotation_id": "41778799", "url": "https://genius.com/41778799", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "You Knew", "line": "Need shorty insurance ’cause I feel that you tired And might get what you want, then I’m burnin’ my side", "vault_lines": ["Need shorty insurance 'cause I feel that you tired", "And might get what you want, then I'm burnin' my side"], "meaning": "“Need shorty insurance ‘cause I feel that you tired (Tired)\nYou might get what you want, then abandon my side (Side)”\n\n“Insurance” is figurative for reassurance and security. He wants some kind of assurance from his girlfriend because he feels that she’s becoming tired of the relationship and may be getting ready to leave. There’s also a possible tire wordplay in “tired”: when a tire loses its air, it becomes deflated and can no longer keep moving properly. In the same way, he feels that she is becoming emotionally “deflated” in their relationship—losing the energy or desire to keep going—so he wants “insurance” and against losing her.", "annotation_id": "41778792", "url": "https://genius.com/41778792", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "You Knew", "line": "Not expressin’ myself ‘cause I’m scared you gon’ leave Yeah, wanna tell you the reasons for things ’Cause I know that you think a certain way and it’s not what it seems", "vault_lines": ["Not expressin' myself 'cause I'm scared you gon' leave", "Yeah, wanna tell you the reasons for things", "'Cause I know that you think a certain way and it's not what it seems"], "meaning": "YB doesn’t want to express his feelings to his lady because he’s scared if he does, she will leave him. YB wants to tell her the reasons he does what he does because he knows his actions are giving a bad impression onto himself into her mind.", "annotation_id": "41778776", "url": "https://genius.com/41778776", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "You Knew", "line": "Toxic", "vault_lines": ["She be comin’ toxic on the net, tryna show her body, Amsterdam on the Kawasaki"], "meaning": "yb has a song called toxic on his 2020 mixtape until I return (i have that fucking song on repeat fucking awesome)", "annotation_id": "28108011", "url": "https://genius.com/28108011", "state": "pending", "votes": -2, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "You Knew", "line": "She be playin’ games and she got it on repeat, that’s that shit that I don’t like", "vault_lines": ["She be playin' games and she got it on repeat, that's that shit that I don't like"], "meaning": "Summer Walker song is called “playing games” and he hates that Jaz keeps it on repeat.", "annotation_id": "27595316", "url": "https://genius.com/27595316", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "You Knew", "line": "I got on Balmain and she got on that CC, this was planned before Christ", "vault_lines": ["I got on Balmain and she got on that CC, this was planned before Christ"], "meaning": "YoungBoy uses a play on words to exaggerate how much he spends on French designer brands such as Balmain and Chanel — popularly referred to as “CC” as the company is named after its founder, Coco Chanel.\n\nBefore Christ otherwise known as (BC) is a title utilized to number years in the Julian and Gregorian calendars. The term plays along with Anno Domini, more simply, AD. Before Christ is used to refer to the time before the birth of Jesus Christ.\n\nYoungBoy uses clever wordplay in the lyric as he raps “Balmain” then “CC,” in the same order as “Before Christ.”", "annotation_id": "26768650", "url": "https://genius.com/26768650", "state": "accepted", "votes": 16, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "accepted"}
