{"type": "line", "artist": "YoungBoy Never Broke Again", "song": "Ypyd", "line": "Put straight out the house for a fact how you find her (How you find her)", "vault_lines": ["Put straight out the house for a fact how you find her (How you find her)"], "meaning": "Top makes it clear that if a girl isn’t reciprocating his energy, he has no problem kicking her out immediately. The phrase “how you find her” emphasizes that anyone looking for her afterward will literally find her stranded out on the street right where he left her.", "annotation_id": "40322934", "url": "https://genius.com/40322934", "state": "pending", "votes": 0, "second_sense": true, "clicked": false, "click_status": "api", "strength": "weak"}
